tes, every detail is imbued with the artisan's soul. <br><br>Turn stone to sand, gather sand to walls-stand unwavering, oath unbroken! An epic weapon for Guardblade Class.","weaponName":""},"2000562":{"name":"Jade Longbow - Breaker","description":"An epic Marksman weapon.","flavorText":"Handcrafted to perfection—Though devoid of rare attributes, every detail is imbued with the artisan's soul. <br><br>Bend the bow like a full moon, unleash fury like a piercing rainbow, this is an epic weapon for the Marksman class.","weaponName":""},"2000563":{"name":"Sacred Legacy - Judgment","description":"An epic Shield Knight weapon.","flavorText":"Handcrafted to perfection—Though devoid of rare attributes, every detail is imbued with the artisan's soul. <br><br>Clad in unyielding steel, ablaze with silver radiance, this is an epic Shield Knight weapon.","weaponName":""},"2000564":{"name":"Celestial Pyre - Severe","description":"This epic weapon is forged for the Beat Performer.","flavorText":"Handcrafted to perfection—Though devoid of rare attributes, every detail is imbued with the artisan's soul. <br><br>Emberstride Strings (Em), Cindercleave Edge (C), Gilded Pyre Chord (G), and Dawnforged Symphony (D)","weaponName":""},"2000601":{"name":"Stormfire Cleaver","description":"An epic Stormblade weapon.","flavorText":"Divine Thunder Descends, like a heavenly punishment! Its blade is sharp enough to cut hair with a blow, An epic Stormblade weapon.","weaponName":"天罚神雷（物理）"},"2000602":{"name":"Permafrost Crystal Staff","description":"An epic Frost Mage weapon.","flavorText":"Its texture is like jade, its feel like ice, an epic weapon for the Frost Mage.","weaponName":"冰之玉响（魔法）"},"2000603":{"name":"Gale-Impaling Spear","description":"An epic Wind Knight weapon.","flavorText":"As slow as a forest, as swift as the wind, immovable as a mountain, aggressive as fire, an epic weapon for the Wind Knight.","weaponName":"正义之风（物理）"},"2000604":{"name":"Flourishing Nature","description":"An epic Verdant Oracle weapon.","flavorText":"Surrounded by the forest, resurrected from ashes, an epic weapon for the Verdant Oracle.","weaponName":"命理之森（魔法）"},"2000605":{"name":"Blade of Endless Fury","description":"An epic Heavy Guardian weapon.","flavorText":"Turning rock into sand, gathering sand into a wall, steadfast protection, unwavering commitment! An epic weapon for the Heavy Guardian Class.","weaponName":"砂岩守御（物理）"},"2000606":{"name":"Sunflare Eternal Bow","description":"An epic Marksman weapon.","flavorText":"Drawing a bow to its full moon, with energy piercing the rainbow, an epic weapon for the Marksman.","weaponName":"金玉长弓（物理）"},"2000607":{"name":"Radiant Bastion","description":"An epic Shield Knight weapon.","flavorText":"Bearing Greatplate and wielding sharp weapons, with a dazzling silver glow, an epic Shield Knight weapon.","weaponName":"光灼银辉（物理）"},"2000608":{"name":"Inferno Shockwave","description":"This epic weapon is forged for the Beat Performer.","flavorText":"Emberstride Strings (Em), Cindercleave Edge (C), Gilded Pyre Chord (G), and Dawnforged Symphony (D)","weaponName":"灵魂吉他（魔法）"},"2000609":{"name":"Thunder Blade","description":"An epic Stormblade weapon.","flavorText":"Divine Thunder Descends, like a heavenly punishment! Its blade is sharp enough to cut hair with a blow, An epic Stormblade weapon.","weaponName":"天罚神雷（物理）"},"2000610":{"name":"Abyssal Frost Staff","description":"An epic Frost Mage weapon.","flavorText":"Its texture is like jade, its feel like ice, an epic weapon for the Frost Mage.","weaponName":"冰之玉响（魔法）"},"2000611":{"name":"Azure Skyfire Lance","description":"An epic Wind Knight weapon.","flavorText":"As slow as a forest, as swift as the wind, immovable as a mountain, aggressive as fire, an epic weapon for the Wind Knight.","weaponName":"正义之风（物理）"},"2000612":{"name":"Luminous World Ring","description":"An epic Verdant Oracle weapon.","flavorText":"Surrounded by the forest, resurrected from ashes, an epic weapon for the Verdant Oracle.","weaponName":"命理之森（魔法）"},"2000613":{"name":"Rock Spinebreaker","description":"An epic Heavy Guardian weapon.","flavorText":"Turning rock into sand, gathering sand into a wall, steadfast protection, unwavering commitment! An epic weapon for the Heavy Guardian Class.","weaponName":"砂岩守御（物理）"},"2000614":{"name":"Jade Treasure Bow","description":"An epic Marksman weapon.","flavorText":"Drawing a bow to its full moon, with energy piercing the rainbow, an epic weapon for the Marksman.","weaponName":"金玉长弓（物理）"},"2000615":{"name":"Blazing Light Guardian","description":"An epic Shield Knight weapon.","flavorText":"Bearing Greatplate and wielding sharp weapons, with a dazzling silver glow, an epic Shield Knight weapon.","weaponName":"光灼银辉（物理）"},"2000616":{"name":"Celestial Pyre","description":"This epic weapon is forged for the Beat Performer.","flavorText":"Emberstride Strings (Em), Cindercleave Edge (C), Gilded Pyre Chord (G), and Dawnforged Symphony (D)","weaponName":"灵魂吉他（魔法）"},"2000617":{"name":"Shadow of the Far Sea","description":"An epic weapon for the Stormblade class. It can be upgraded to higher levels using a few Glinting Stellar Cores as this season progresses.\\nAfter upgrading to item level 180, it can be crafted at Lunel, an NPC of the Artisan Guild, into an \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapon at item level 220, which also activates the weapon's visual effects.\\nThe gear Modification feature can be used to select up to 4 entry effects for \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapons.","flavorText":"\"In the dark of night, tides surge like a silent blade slicing through the deep.<br>Lightning cleaves the waves, leaving behind traces that vanish in an instant.<br>The scythe dances with the wind. What it reaps is not just mortal bodies, but the rifts of fate. <br>Each strike is a judgment jointly issued by the sea and storm. <br>And the echo that remains is but solemn silence within shattered tides.\" <br>(Excerpt from \"Book of the Depths VII\")","weaponName":"天罚神雷（物理）"},"2000618":{"name":"Revelation of the Far Sea","description":"An epic weapon for the Frost Mage class. It can be upgraded to higher levels using a few Glinting Stellar Cores as this season progresses.\\nAfter upgrading to item level 180, it can be crafted at Lunel, an NPC of the Artisan Guild, into an \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapon at item level 220, which also activates the weapon's visual effects.\\nThe gear Modification feature can be used to select up to 4 entry effects for \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapons.","flavorText":"\"Between the sea's breaths lies an untold truth. <br>It carves verses into the surging waves, writing them upon moonlit waters.<br>The tip of the staff catches a fleeting ripple, turning it into light.<br>Light pierces the mist, reaching even the deepest longing.<br>If you're willing to listen, the sea will offer you its answer.\"<br>(Excerpt from \"Book of the Depths II\")","weaponName":"冰之玉响（魔法）"},"2000619":{"name":"Wish of the Far Sea","description":"An epic weapon for the Wind Knight class. It can be upgraded to higher levels using a few Glinting Stellar Cores as this season progresses.\\nAfter upgrading to item level 180, it can be crafted at Lunel, an NPC of the Artisan Guild, into an \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapon at item level 220, which also activates the weapon's visual effects.\\nThe gear Modification feature can be used to select up to 4 entry effects for \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapons.","flavorText":"\"Its edge points straight into the distance, like tides rushing toward the endless sky.<br>It holds the sea's whispers, engraving vows between wind and water.<br>Every thrust is for the sake of protection, turning gales into unwavering creed.<br>And the knight's wish shall echo with the tide, reaching the farthest shore.\"<br>(Excerpt from \"Book of the Depths VIII\")","weaponName":"正义之风（物理）"},"2000620":{"name":"Grace of the Far Sea","description":"An epic weapon for the Verdant Oracle class. It can be upgraded to higher levels using a few Glinting Stellar Cores as this season progresses.\\nAfter upgrading to item level 180, it can be crafted at Lunel, an NPC of the Artisan Guild, into an \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapon at item level 220, which also activates the weapon's visual effects.\\nThe gear Modification feature can be used to select up to 4 entry effects for \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapons.","flavorText":"\"In the realm of ebbing tides, the sea leaves behind its final sigh.<br>The shattered reflections of starlight float on the water, like dreams yet unbroken.<br>Listen! Each rising tide is the heartbeat of a gentle and solemn deity.<br>The light surging through the ring soothes bloodstains, granting peace to weary souls.\"<br>(Excerpt from \"Book of the Depths I\")","weaponName":"命理之森（魔法）"},"2000621":{"name":"Waiting of the Far Sea","description":"An epic weapon for the Heavy Guardian class. It can be upgraded to higher levels using a few Glinting Stellar Cores as this season progresses.\\nAfter upgrading to item level 180, it can be crafted at Lunel, an NPC of the Artisan Guild, into an \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapon at item level 220, which also activates the weapon's visual effects.\\nThe gear Modification feature can be used to select up to 4 entry effects for \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapons.","flavorText":"\"The tide is not only gentle; it can become a stern barrier.<br>Great waves lie prostrate before the reefs, safeguarding the silence behind.<br>The blade's edge is like the spine of the earth, firm and unyielding.<br>Each impact echoes the ceaseless song of the ocean.<br>Guardian, the faith of the deep sea has long been bound to your soul.\"<br>(Excerpt from \"Book of the Depths III\")","weaponName":"砂岩守御（物理）"},"2000622":{"name":"Gaze of the Far Sea","description":"An epic weapon for the Marksman class. It can be upgraded to higher levels using a few Glinting Stellar Cores as this season progresses.\\nAfter upgrading to item level 180, it can be crafted at Lunel, an NPC of the Artisan Guild, into an \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapon at item level 220, which also activates the weapon's visual effects.\\nThe gear Modification feature can be used to select up to 4 entry effects for \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapons.","flavorText":"\"The sea's gaze reaches farther than the wind, longer than the waves.<br>The bowstring draws tight, as if binding the skyline tightly.<br>The arrow carry the breath of the tide, crossing the boundary of water and sky.<br>It always finds its destination, reaching where the heart yearns.\" <br>(Excerpt from \"Book of the Depths IV\")","weaponName":"金玉长弓（物理）"},"2000623":{"name":"Vow of the Far Sea","description":"An epic weapon for the Shield Knight class. It can be upgraded to higher levels using a few Glinting Stellar Cores as this season progresses.\\nAfter upgrading to item level 180, it can be crafted at Lunel, an NPC of the Artisan Guild, into an \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapon at item level 220, which also activates the weapon's visual effects.\\nThe gear Modification feature can be used to select up to 4 entry effects for \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapons.","flavorText":"\"Withdraw, withdraw, yet there always remain the unyielding reefs.<br> That is the ocean's silent vow, standing firmly on the shore forever.<br>The shield bears the waves, embracing the surge without resistance.<br>With every impact, it endures alongside the sea, without end.<br>It grants peace to the soul, so the brave may walk without fear.<br>In the eternal sound of the tide, protection becomes an endless poem.\"<br>(Excerpt from \"Book of the Depths V\")","weaponName":"光灼银辉（物理）"},"2000624":{"name":"Hymn of the Far Sea","description":"An epic weapon for the Beat Performer. It can be upgraded\nto higher levels using a few Glinting Stellar Cores as this season progresses.\\nAfter upgrading to item level 180, it can be crafted at Lunel, an NPC of the Artisan Guild, into an \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapon at item level 220, which also activates the weapon's visual effects.\\nThe gear Modification feature can be used to select up to 4 entry effects for \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapons.","flavorText":"\"Waves strike the reef like trembling strings.<br>Their sound rises from the surge, chasing the wind into the boundless sky.<br>Each chord is a secret the deep sea has yet to speak. <br>Stars and waterlight resonate, weaving a melody that surrounds the battlefield.<br>And those who listen shall find their way home within the hymn.\"<br>(Excerpt from \"Book of the Depths VI\")","weaponName":"灵魂吉他（魔法）"},"2000625":{"name":"Fury of the Far Sea","description":"An epic Twin Striker weapon.It can be upgraded to higher levels using a few Glinting Stellar Cores as this season progresses.\\nAfter breaking through to item level 180, it can be crafted at Lunel, an NPC of the Artisan Guild, into an \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapon at item level 220, which also activates the weapon's visual effects.\\nThe gear Modification feature can be used to select up to 4 entry effects for \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapons.","flavorText":"\"When the tides converge within the abyss, they cleave through chaos, forging a fearless heart into the surging waves.<br>A vow of resolve is cast into the boundless depths.<br>Within that ceaseless tempest, only an unyielding soul may endure the deep sea's eternal solitude.\" <br>(Excerpt from \"Book of the Depths IX\")","weaponName":"双斧"},"2000626":{"name":"Ember - Shadow of the Far Sea","description":"An epic weapon for the Stormblade class. It can be upgraded to higher levels using a few Glinting Stellar Cores during the current season.","flavorText":"\"In the dark of night, tides surge like a silent blade slicing through the deep.<br>Lightning cleaves the waves, leaving behind traces that vanish in an instant.<br>The scythe dances with the wind. What it reaps is not just mortal bodies, but the rifts of fate. <br>Each strike is a judgment jointly issued by the sea and storm. <br>And the echo that remains is but solemn silence within shattered tides.\" <br>(Excerpt from \"Book of the Depths VII\")","weaponName":"天罚神雷（物理）"},"2000627":{"name":"Ember - Revelation of the Far Sea","description":"An epic weapon for the Frost Mage class. It can be upgraded to higher levels using a few Glinting Stellar Cores during the current season.","flavorText":"\"Between the sea's breaths lies an untold truth. <br>It carves verses into the surging waves, writing them upon moonlit waters.<br>The tip of the staff catches a fleeting ripple, turning it into light.<br>Light pierces the mist, reaching even the deepest longing.<br>If you're willing to listen, the sea will offer you its answer.\"<br>(Excerpt from \"Book of the Depths II\")","weaponName":"冰之玉响（魔法）"},"2000628":{"name":"Ember - Wish of the Far Sea","description":"An epic weapon for the Wind Knight class. It can be upgraded to higher levels using a few Glinting Stellar Cores during the current season.","flavorText":"\"Its edge points straight into the distance, like tides rushing toward the endless sky.<br>It holds the sea's whispers, engraving vows between wind and water.<br>Every thrust is for the sake of protection, turning gales into unwavering creed.<br>And the knight's wish shall echo with the tide, reaching the farthest shore.\"<br>(Excerpt from \"Book of the Depths VIII\")","weaponName":"正义之风（物理）"},"2000629":{"name":"Ember - Grace of the Far Sea","description":"An epic weapon for the Verdant Oracle class. It can be upgraded to higher levels using a few Glinting Stellar Cores during the current season.","flavorText":"\"In the realm of ebbing tides, the sea leaves behind its final sigh.<br>The shattered reflections of starlight float on the water, like dreams yet unbroken.<br>Listen! Each rising tide is the heartbeat of a gentle and solemn deity.<br>The light surging through the ring soothes bloodstains, granting peace to weary souls.\"<br>(Excerpt from \"Book of the Depths I\")","weaponName":"命理之森（魔法）"},"2000630":{"name":"Ember - Waiting of the Far Sea","description":"An epic weapon for the Heavy Gu