n epic weapon for the Twin Striker class.<br><br>This weapon cannot be forged into Fury of the Far Sea.","flavorText":"ui/atlas/weap_icon/weap_equip_square_03","weaponName":"梦呓怒涛斧"},"2001504":{"name":"Mirage Spear","description":"An epic weapon for the Wind Knight.","flavorText":"As gentle as a forest, as swift as the wind, immovable as a mountain, aggressive as fire, an epic weapon for the Wind Knight.","weaponName":"蜃影千幻枪"},"2001505":{"name":"Voidforge Ring","description":"An epic weapon for the Verdant Oracle.","flavorText":"Surrounded by the forest, resurrected from ashes, an epic weapon for the Verdant Oracle.","weaponName":"虚界造物环"},"2001506":{"name":"Crushing Nightmare Blade","description":"An epic weapon for Heavy Guardian.","flavorText":"Turning rock into sand, gathering sand into a wall, steadfast protection, unwavering commitment! An epic weapon for the Heavy Guardian Class.","weaponName":"千钧梦魇之刃"},"2001507":{"name":"Phantomstar Bow","description":"An epic weapon for the Marksman.","flavorText":"Drawing a bow to its full moon, with energy piercing the rainbow, an epic weapon for the Marksman.","weaponName":"星幻流光弓"},"2001508":{"name":"Oath of the Immortal Watch","description":"An epic weapon for Shield Knight.","flavorText":"Bear the burden and hold the sharp weapons. With a dazzling silver glow, this is an epic weapon for the Shield Knights.","weaponName":"不朽守望之誓"},"2001509":{"name":"Voidcall Movement","description":"This epic weapon is forged for the Beat Performer.","flavorText":"Emberstride Strings (Em), Cindercleave Edge (C), Gilded Pyre Chord (G), and Dawnforged Symphony (D)","weaponName":"虚空共鸣乐章"},"2001510":{"name":"Serene Water Blade","description":"An epic weapon for the Stormblade.","flavorText":"Divine Thunder Descends, like a heavenly punishment! Its blade is sharp enough to cut hair with a blow. An epic Stormblade weapon.","weaponName":"明镜止水斩"},"2001511":{"name":"Staff of Manifested Truth","description":"An epic weapon for the Frost Mage.","fla