nd bold materials, making one marvel: miracles are everywhere."},"2060333":{"name":"Wane Crimson Necklace","description":"Seems to grant higher Strength.<br><br>[This gear's advanced attributes will not include Haste.]","flavorText":"Handcrafted to perfection—Though devoid of rare attributes, every detail is imbued with the artisan's soul. <br><br>Forged in homage to the Bapharian Legacy and blessed by the Creed, it is cherished by many as a prized item."},"2060334":{"name":"Wane Emerald Necklace","description":"Seems to grant higher Agility.<br><br>[This gear's advanced attributes will not include Mastery.]","flavorText":"Handcrafted to perfection—Though devoid of rare attributes, every detail is imbued with the artisan's soul. <br><br>Renowned for their soft luster and exquisite craftsmanship, Bahamar gem necklace is highly coveted by adventurers."},"2060335":{"name":"Wane Zircon Necklace","description":"Seems to grant higher Intellect.<br><br>[This gear's advanced attributes will not include Luck.]","flavorText":"Handcrafted to perfection—Though devoid of rare attributes, every detail is imbued with the artisan's soul. <br><br>Forged by an unnamed hand with bold materials and exquisite detail, this necklace whispers of ubiquitous miracles woven into the fabric of the world."},"2060401":{"name":"Wane Ruby Necklace","description":"Seems to grant higher Strength.<br><br>[This gear's advanced attributes will not include Haste.]","flavorText":"Said to be made in imitation of Bapharian Legacy techniques, blessed by the order, many regard it as a treasure."},"2060402":{"name":"Lethal Ruby Necklace - Radiant","description":"Seems to grant higher Strength. <br><br>[This gear's advanced attributes will not include Haste.]","flavorText":"Said to be made in imitation of Bapharian Legacy techniques, blessed by the order, many regard it as a treasure."},"2060403":{"name":"Lethal Ruby Necklace - Tempest Flow","description":"Seems to grant higher Strength. <br><br>[This gear's a