},"3020217":{"name":"","description":"Embedding a sigil into gear grants it the unique effects contained within the sigil. <br>Sigils can be used on: Weapon, Earrings, Necklace, and Ring"},"3020218":{"name":"","description":"ui/atlas/weap_icon/weap_equip_square_03"},"3020219":{"name":"","description":"ui/atlas/weap_icon/weap_equip_square_03"},"3020221":{"name":"Paradox-Calamity Remnant - Final Sigil","description":"Embedding a sigil into gear grants it the unique effects contained within the sigil. <br>Sigils can be used on: Weapon, Earrings, Necklace, and Ring"},"3020222":{"name":"Paradox-Calamity Remnant - Final Sigil - Fine","description":"ui/atlas/weap_icon/weap_equip_square_03"},"3020223":{"name":"Paradox-Calamity Remnant - Final Sigil - Rare","description":"ui/atlas/weap_icon/weap_equip_square_03"},"3020224":{"name":"","description":"Embedding a sigil into gear grants it the unique effects contained within the sigil. <br>Sigils can be used on: Weapon, Earrings, Necklace, and Ring"},"3020225":{"name":"","description":"ui/atlas/weap_icon/weap_equip_square_03"},"3020226":{"name":"","description":"ui/atlas/weap_icon/weap_equip_square_03"},"3020227":{"name":"","description":"Embedding a sigil into gear grants it the unique effects contained within the sigil. <br>Sigils can be used on: Weapon, Earrings, Necklace, and Ring"},"3020228":{"name":"","description":"ui/atlas/weap_icon/weap_equip_square_03"},"3020229":{"name":"","description":"ui/atlas/weap_icon/weap_equip_square_03"},"8000001":{"name":"Shadow of the Far Sea","description":"An epic weapon for the Stormblade class. It can be upgraded to higher levels using a few Glinting Stellar Cores as this season progresses.\\nAfter upgrading to item level 180, it can be crafted at Lunel, an NPC of the Artisan Guild, into an \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapon at item level 220, which also activates the weapon's visual effects.\\nThe gear Modification feature can be used to select up to 4 entry effects for \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapons.","flavorText":"\"In the dark of night, tides surge like a silent blade slicing through the deep.<br>Lightning cleaves the waves, leaving behind traces that vanish in an instant.<br>The scythe dances with the wind. What it reaps is not just mortal bodies, but the rifts of fate. <br>Each strike is a judgment jointly issued by the sea and storm. <br>And the echo that remains is but solemn silence within shattered tides.\" <br>(Excerpt from \"Book of the Depths VII\")","weaponName":"天罚神雷（物理）"},"8000002":{"name":"Revelation of the Far Sea","description":"An epic weapon for the Frost Mage class. It can be upgraded to higher levels using a few Glinting Stellar Cores as this season progresses.\\nAfter upgrading to item level 180, it can be crafted at Lunel, an NPC of the Artisan Guild, into an \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapon at item level 220, which also activates the weapon's visual effects.\\nThe gear Modification feature can be used to select up to 4 entry effects for \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapons.","flavorText":"\"Between the sea's breaths lies an untold truth. <br>It carves verses into the surging waves, writing them upon moonlit waters.<br>The tip of the staff catches a fleeting ripple, turning it into light.<br>Light pierces the mist, reaching even the deepest longing.<br>If you're willing to listen, the sea will offer you its answer.\"<br>(Excerpt from \"Book of the Depths II\")","weaponName":"冰之玉响（魔法）"},"8000003":{"name":"Wish of the Far Sea","description":"An epic weapon for the Wind Knight class. It can be upgraded to higher levels using a few Glinting Stellar Cores as this season progresses.\\nAfter upgrading to item level 180, it can be crafted at Lunel, an NPC of the Artisan Guild, into an \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapon at item level 220, which also activates the weapon's visual effects.\\nThe gear Modification feature can be used to select up to 4 entry effects for \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapons.","flavorText":"\"Its edge points straight into the distance, like tides rushing toward the endless sky.<br>It holds the sea's whispers, engraving vows between wind and water.<br>Every thrust is for the sake of protection, turning gales into unwavering creed.<br>And the knight's wish shall echo with the tide, reaching the farthest shore.\"<br>(Excerpt from \"Book of the Depths VIII\")","weaponName":"正义之风（物理）"},"8000004":{"name":"Grace of the Far Sea","description":"An epic weapon for the Verdant Oracle class. It can be upgraded to higher levels using a few Glinting Stellar Cores as this season progresses.\\nAfter upgrading to item level 180, it can be crafted at Lunel, an NPC of the Artisan Guild, into an \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapon at item level 220, which also activates the weapon's visual effects.\\nThe gear Modification feature can be used to select up to 4 entry effects for \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapons.","flavorText":"\"In the realm of ebbing tides, the sea leaves behind its final sigh.<br>The shattered reflections of starlight float on the water, like dreams yet unbroken.<br>Listen! Each rising tide is the heartbeat of a gentle and solemn deity.<br>The light surging through the ring soothes bloodstains, granting peace to weary souls.\"<br>(Excerpt from \"Book of the Depths I\")","weaponName":"命理之森（魔法）"},"8000005":{"name":"Waiting of the Far Sea","description":"An epic weapon for the Heavy Guardian class. It can be upgraded to higher levels using a few Glinting Stellar Cores as this season progresses.\\nAfter upgrading to item level 180, it can be crafted at Lunel, an NPC of the Artisan Guild, into an \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapon at item level 220, which also activates the weapon's visual effects.\\nThe gear Modification feature can be used to select up to 4 entry effects for \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapons.","flavorText":"\"The tide is not only gentle; it can become a stern barrier.<br>Great waves lie prostrate before the reefs, safeguarding the silence behind.<br>The blade's edge is like the spine of the earth, firm and unyielding.<br>Each impact echoes the ceaseless song of the ocean.<br>Guardian, the faith of the deep sea has long been bound to your soul.\"<br>(Excerpt from \"Book of the Depths III\")","weaponName":"砂岩守御（物理）"},"8000006":{"name":"Gaze of the Far Sea","description":"An epic weapon for the Marksman class. It can be upgraded to higher levels using a few Glinting Stellar Cores as this season progresses.\\nAfter upgrading to item level 180, it can be crafted at Lunel, an NPC of the Artisan Guild, into an \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapon at item level 220, which also activates the weapon's visual effects.\\nThe gear Modification feature can be used to select up to 4 entry effects for \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapons.","flavorText":"\"The sea's gaze reaches farther than the wind, longer than the waves.<br>The bowstring draws tight, as if binding the skyline tightly.<br>The arrow carry the breath of the tide, crossing the boundary of water and sky.<br>It always finds its destination, reaching where the heart yearns.\" <br>(Excerpt from \"Book of the Depths IV\")","weaponName":"金玉长弓（物理）"},"8000007":{"name":"Vow of the Far Sea","description":"An epic weapon for the Shield Knight class. It can be upgraded to higher levels using a few Glinting Stellar Cores as this season progresses.\\nAfter upgrading to item level 180, it can be crafted at Lunel, an NPC of the Artisan Guild, into an \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapon at item level 220, which also activates the weapon's visual effects.\\nThe gear Modification feature can be used to select up to 4 entry effects for \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapons.","flavorText":"\"Withdraw, withdraw, yet there always remain the unyielding reefs.<br> That is the ocean's silent vow, standing firmly on the shore forever.<br>The shield bears the waves, embracing the surge without resistance.<br>With every impact, it endures alongside the sea, without end.<br>It grants peace to the soul, so the brave may walk without fear.<br>In the eternal sound of the tide, protection becomes an endless poem.\"<br>(Excerpt from \"Book of the Depths V\")","weaponName":"光灼银辉（物理）"},"8000008":{"name":"Hymn of the Far Sea","description":"An epic weapon for the Beat Performer. It can be upgraded\nto higher levels using a few Glinting Stellar Cores as this season progresses.\\nAfter upgrading to item level 180, it can be crafted at Lunel, an NPC of the Artisan Guild, into an \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapon at item level 220, which also activates the weapon's visual effects.\\nThe gear Modification feature can be used to select up to 4 entry effects for \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapons.","flavorText":"\"Waves strike the reef like trembling strings.<br>Their sound rises from the surge, chasing the wind into the boundless sky.<br>Each chord is a secret the deep sea has yet to speak. <br>Stars and waterlight resonate, weaving a melody that surrounds the battlefield.<br>And those who listen shall find their way home within the hymn.\"<br>(Excerpt from \"Book of the Depths VI\")","weaponName":"灵魂吉他（魔法）"},"8000009":{"name":"Shadow of the Far Sea","description":"An epic weapon for the Stormblade class. It can be upgraded to higher levels using a few Glinting Stellar Cores as this season progresses.\\nAfter upgrading to item level 180, it can be crafted at Lunel, an NPC of the Artisan Guild, into an \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapon at item level 220, which also activates the weapon's visual effects.\\nThe gear Modification feature can be used to select up to 4 entry effects for \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapons.","flavorText":"\"In the dark of night, tides surge like a silent blade slicing through the deep.<br>Lightning cleaves the waves, leaving behind traces that vanish in an instant.<br>The scythe dances with the wind. What it reaps is not just mortal bodies, but the rifts of fate. <br>Each strike is a judgment jointly issued by the sea and storm. <br>And the echo that remains is but solemn silence within shattered tides.\" <br>(Excerpt from \"Book of the Depths VII\")","weaponName":"天罚神雷（物理）"},"80