cerpt from \"Book of the Depths IV\")","weaponName":"金玉长弓（物理）"},"8000023":{"name":"Vow of the Far Sea","description":"An epic weapon for the Shield Knight class. It can be upgraded to higher levels using a few Glinting Stellar Cores as this season progresses.\\nAfter upgrading to item level 180, it can be crafted at Lunel, an NPC of the Artisan Guild, into an \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapon at item level 220, which also activates the weapon's visual effects.\\nThe gear Modification feature can be used to select up to 4 entry effects for \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapons.","flavorText":"\"Withdraw, withdraw, yet there always remain the unyielding reefs.<br> That is the ocean's silent vow, standing firmly on the shore forever.<br>The shield bears the waves, embracing the surge without resistance.<br>With every impact, it endures alongside the sea, without end.<br>It grants peace to the soul, so the brave may walk without fear.<br>In the eternal sound of the tide, protection becomes an endless poem.\"<br>(Excerpt from \"Book of the Depths V\")","weaponName":"光灼银辉（物理）"},"8000024":{"name":"Hymn of the Far Sea","description":"An epic weapon for the Beat Performer. It can be upgraded\nto higher levels using a few Glinting Stellar Cores as this season progresses.\\nAfter upgrading to item level 180, it can be crafted at Lunel, an NPC of the Artisan Guild, into an \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapon at item level 220, which also activates the weapon's visual effects.\\nThe gear Modification feature can be used to select up to 4 entry effects for \"Ember - Far Sea\" weapons.","flavorText":"\"Waves strike the reef like trembling strings.<br>Their sound rises from the surge, chasing the wind into the boundless sky.<br>Each chord is a secret the deep sea has yet to speak. <br>Stars and waterlight resonate, weaving a melody that surrounds the battlefield.<br>And those who listen shall find their way home within the hymn.\"<br>(Excerpt from \"Book of the Depths VI\")","weaponName":"灵魂吉他（魔法）"},"800002