avy incoming DMG.</style></size>","skillLabel":["Ultimate","Physical","Rock","Direct DMG","AoE","Protect","Energy Restore","Melee"],"activeEffectParams":[["Total DMG",[{"r":["450%","468%","486%","540%","558%","576%","629.99%"]}," ATK +",{"l":["45","105","166","226","287","347","408","468","529","589","650","710","771","831","892","952","1013","1073","1134","1194","1255","1315","1376","1436","1497","1557","1618","1678","1739","1800"]}," (Resilience Break: 884)"]],["CD",["60s"]]]},"1917":{"name":"Titan Charge","description":"Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">40</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Rage</style> to gather Strength and dash forward, knocking back all enemies in the way and dealing continuous <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>. When the dash ends, unleashes a devastating slam that causes massive <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>. The dash can be redirected. Targets with Resilience won't be knocked back but will have it reduced.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Cast against enemies without Super Armor or chip away at tough targets' resistance.</style></size>","skillLabel":["Expertise Skill","Physical","Rock","Direct DMG","AoE","Sprint","Stagger"],"activeEffectParams":[["Charge DMG per hit",[{"r":["43%","44.28%","45.57%","49.44%","50.73%","52.02%","55.89%"]}," ATK +",{"l":["11","15","18","22","26","29","33","36","40","44","47","51","54","58","62","65","69","72","76","80","83","87","91","94","98","101","105","109","112","116"]}]],["Finishing Strike Damage",[{"r":["140%","144.19%","148.39%","160.99%","165.19%","169.39%","181.99%"]}," ATK +",{"l":["37","49","61","72","84","96","108","119","131","143","155","166","178","190","202","213","225","237","248","260","272","284","295","307","319","331","342","354","366","377"]}]],["CD",["30s"]]]},"1922":{"name":"Shield Bash","description":"Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">40</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Rage</style> to unleash a powerful shockwave that deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to all nearby enemies. When sufficient <style=\"accent-gn\">Sand Crystal</style> is available, <style=\"accent-gn\">it</style> is consumed to generate a <linktext=1035><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Shield</style></linktext> that absorbs all incoming DMG, lasting for <style=\"accent-gn\">12s</style>. For <style=\"accent-gn\">each</style> additional <style=\"accent-gn\">Sand Crystal</style> consumed, additional shield value is added, with a maximum of <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Sand Crystals</style> consumed at a time. (Shields can stack, but cannot exceed <style=\"accent-gn\">150%</style> of Max HP.)<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Casting is recommended when no shield is active to ensure continuous shield uptime.</style></size>","skillLabel":["Special Attack","Physical","Rock","Direct DMG","Single Target","Shield","Melee"],"activeEffectParams":[["Total DMG",[{"r":["130%","135.2%","140.4%","156%","161.2%","166.4%","182%"]}," ATK +",{"l":["13","30","47","65","82","100","117","135","152","170","187","205","222","240","257","275","292","310","327","345","362","380","397","415","432","450","467","485","502","520"]}," (Resilience Break: 578)"]],["Shield Amount per Sand Crystal Consumed",[{"u":"up","l":[5000,5344,5689,6034,6379,6724,7068,7413,7758,8103,8448,8793,9137,9482,9827,10172,10517,10862,11206,11551,11896,12241,12586,12931,13275,13620,13965,14310,14655,15000],"r":[0,600,1200,3000,3600,4200,6000]}," ATK +",{"l":["10","61","112","164","215","266","318","369","421","472","523","575","626","677","729","780","832","883","934","986","1037","1088","1140","1191","1243","1294","1345","1397","1448","1500"]}]],["Extra Shield Amount per Sand Crystal Consumed",[{"r":["5%","5.3%","5.6%","6.5%","6.8%","7.1%","8%"]}," Max HP"]],["CD",["1s"]]]},"1923":{"name":"Sandward","description":"Erects an immovable rock wall and enter a defensive stance, <linktext=1092><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">taunting</style></linktext> nearby monsters and becoming invincible. Blocking a <style=\"physical\">Lethal Skill</style> causes the wall to shatter and counterattack the target, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to all the enemies in front.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Ultimate tank skill, perfect for absorbing extreme DMG.</style></size>","skillLabel":["Expertise Skill","Physical","Rock","Direct DMG","AoE","Protect","Melee"],"activeEffectParams":[["Total DMG",[{"r":["450%","468%","486%","540%","558%","576%","629.99%"]}," ATK +",{"l":["45","105","166","226","287","347","408","468","529","589","650","710","771","831","892","952","1013","1073","1134","1194","1255","1315","1376","1436","1497","1557","1618","1678","1739","1800"]}," (Resilience Break: 500)"]],["CD",["45s"]]]},"1924":{"name":"Star Shatter","description":"Charges ahead with immense force. Upon hit, gains <style=\"accent-gn\">25</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Rage</style> and <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Sand Crystal</style>, deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>, and <linktext=3005><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">stuns</style></linktext> the enemy. Becomes <style=\"accent-gn\">unstoppable</style> during the execution of the charge. <br>This skill holds <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> charges. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: This skill enhances mobility and accumulates Rage quickly.</style></size>","skillLabel":["Expertise Skill","Physical","Rock","Direct DMG","Single Target","Sprint","Energy Restore","Stun","Melee"],"activeEffectParams":[["Total DMG",[{"r":["260%","270.4%","280.8%","312%","322.4%","332.8%","364%"]}," ATK +",{"l":["26","60","95","130","165","200","235","270","305","340","375","410","445","480","515","550","585","620","655","690","725","760","795","830","865","900","935","970","1005","1040"]}," (Resilience Break: 629)"]],["CD",["12s"]],["Charge Time",["12s"]]]},"1925":{"name":"Rage Burst","description":"Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">50</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Rage</style> and <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> <st