es max, <style=\"accent-gn\">Storm Arrow</style> instantly gains <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> charges, and the max number of charges increases to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style>.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Even after five uses, Storm Arrow will continue to re-charge. Use other skills to buy time for more casts.</style></size>"},"2222":{"name":"Double Arrow","description":"Slides sideways and quickly shoots <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> arrows, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>.<br>In <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Reforge</style> state, <style=\"accent-gn\">Double Arrow</style> evolves into <style=\"accent-gn\">Quadraflare</style>, leaping into the air and firing <style=\"accent-gn\">4</style> empowered arrows that deal high Attack DMG with doubled critical rate.<br>This skill holds <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> charges.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Keep an eye on the Photon Reforge state and use ​Quadraflare​ at the right moment.</style></size>","skillLabel":["Special Attack","Physical","Light","Direct DMG","Single Target","Energy Restore","Ranged"],"activeEffectParams":[["Normal",[{"r":["200%","208%","216%","240%","248%","256%","280%"]}," ATK +",{"l":["20","46","73","100","127","154","181","208","235","262","288","315","342","369","396","423","450","477","504","531","557","584","611","638","665","692","719","746","773","800"]}," (Resilience Break: 175)"]],["Enhanced",[{"r":["600%","624%","648%","720%","744%","768%","840%"]}," ATK +",{"l":["58","138","218","298","378","459","543","623","704","784","865","945","1025","1105","1185","1267","1347","1427","1511","1591","1672","1752","1833","1913","1993","2074","2154","2234","2314","2400"]}," (Resilience Break: 171)"]],["Charge Time",["7s"]]]},"2223":{"name":"场地标记01","description":"场地标记01"},"2224":{"name":"Lethal Shot","description":"场地标记01","skillLabel":["Special Attack","Physical","Light","Direct DMG","Single Target","Ranged"]},"2230":{"name":"Torrent Volley","description":"Continuously draws bow to launch a barrage of arrows at enemies, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>. Recast to end early.<br><style=\"accent-gn\">While in Photon Reforge</style> state, Photon Energy consumption stops until the next Special Attack cast and hitting enemies recovers up to <style=\"accent-gn\">42</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style>.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Cast during Photon Reforge state to pause Photon Energy consumption and regenerate Photon Energy.</style></size>","skillLabel":["Expertise Skill","Physical","Light","Direct DMG","Single Target","Channelling","Ranged"],"activeEffectParams":[["Total DMG",[{"r":["504%","524.16%","544.32%","604.8%","624.96%","645.12%","705.6%"]}," ATK +",{"l":["42","105","168","231","315","378","441","504","567","651","714","777","840","903","987","1050","1113","1176","1239","1323","1386","1449","1512","1575","1659","1722","1785","1848","1911","1995"]}," (Resilience Break: 189)"]],["CD",["23s"]]]},"2231":{"name":"Focus","description":"Enters Focus state, greatly increasing Haste and reducing the CD of Special Attacks by <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Best paired with Falconry Spec. Use it just before activating Photon Reforge for maximum uptime.</style></size>","skillLabel":["Expertise Skill","Haste"],"activeEffectParams":[["Haste bonus",[{"r":["15%","15.6%","16.2%","18%","18.6%","19.2%","21%"]},"+",{"l":["800","808","816","824","833","841","849","857","866","874","882","891","899","907","915","924","932","940","948","957","965","973","982","990","998","1006","1015","1023","1031","1040"]}]],["Duration",[{"r":["12s","12.3s","12.6s","13.5s","13.8s","14.1s","15s"]}]],["CD",["45s"]]]},"2232":{"name":"Arrow Rain","description":"Fires a rain of arrows over a target area, dealing continuous <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>. Grants <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style> upon cast, plus <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> additional <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style> per enemy hit, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> extra.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: The more enemies hit, the more energy you gain.</style></size>","skillLabel":["Expertise Skill","Physical","Light","AoE","Energy Restore","Ranged","DoT"],"activeEffectParams":[["Total DMG",[{"r":["200%","208%","216%","240%","248%","256%","280%"]}," ATK +",{"l":["20","40","70","100","120","150","180","200","230","260","280","310","340","360","390","420","450","470","500","530","550","580","610","630","660","690","710","740","770","800"]}," (Resilience Break: 80)"]],["CD",["20s"]]]},"2233":{"name":"Powerdraw","description":"Charges and then fires a piercing arrow that deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> and <style=\"accent-gn\">Knockback</style> to all enemies in its path. Cannot knock back targets with Resilience, but reduces targets' Resilience. <style=\"accent-gn\">Powerdraw</style> deals a bonus <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> Crit DMG.<br>This skill holds <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> charges.<br>No charge time required when in <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Reforge</style> state.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Great for reducing enemies' Resilience while dealing area damage.</style></size>","skillLabel":["Expertise Skill","Physical","Light","Direct DMG","AoE","Ranged"],"activeEffectParams":[["Total DMG",[{"r":["900%","936%","972%","1080%","1116%","1152%","1259.99%"]}," ATK +",{"l":["90","211","332","453","574","695","816","937","1058","1179","1300","1421","1542","1663","1784","1905","2026","2147","2268","2389","2510","2631","2752","2873","2994","3115","3236","3357","3478","3600"]}," (Resilience Break: 493)"]],["CD",["30s"]],["Charge Time",["30s"]]]},"2234":{"name":"Radiance Barrage","description":"Charges and fires Photon Arrows to a target area, dealing continuous <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>. The damage interval scales with Attack SPD. <br>While in <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Reforge</style> state, Photon Arrows consume no Photon Energy, generate extra arrows, and deal <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> more <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Casting during Photon Reforge increases its damage and consumes no Photon Energy.</style></size>","skillLabel":["Expertise Skill","Physical","Light","AoE","Ranged","DoT"],"activeEffectParams":[["Total DMG",[{"r":["1200%","1248%","1296%","1440%","1488%","1536%","1680%"]}," ATK +",{"l":["120","280","440","600","760","920","1080","1240","1410","1570","1730","1890","2050","2210","2370","2540","2700","2860","3020","3180","3340","3500","3670","3830","3990","4150","4310","4470","4630","4800"]}," (Resilience Break: 470)"]],["CD",["30s"]]]},"2235":{"name":"Deter Shot","description":"Leaps upward swiftly and fires at enemies, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>. Grants immunity to <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> for you and up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> nearby Allies for <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>. <br>This skill holds <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> charges. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: This is intended to be equipped in high-pressure situations to increase survivability.</style></size>","skillLabel":["Expertise Skill","Physical","Light","Direct DMG","Single Target","Sprint","Protect","Ranged"],"activeEffectParams":[["Total DMG",[{"r":["100%","104%","108%","120%","124%","128%","140%"]}," ATK +",{"l":["10","23","36","50","63","77","90","104","117","131","144","157","171","184","198","211","225","238","252","265","278","292","305","319","332","346","359","373","386","400"]}]],["CD",["25s"]],["Charge Time",["25s"]]]},"2236":{"name":"场地标记01","description":"场地标记01","activeEffectParams":[["Arrow Damage",[]],["Crit DMG",[]],["Falling Damage",[]]]},"2237":{"name":"Wildcall","description":"Summons a powerful combat Companion to provide assistance in battle. <br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Summon Wild Wolf</style>: The summoned Wild Wolf pounces on the current target, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to the target and nearby enemies, then joins the battle for <style=\"accent-gn\">20s</style> before disappearing. <br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Summon Falcon</style>: The summoned Falcon dives in a straight line, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to all enemies in its path before disappearing. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Boosts the number of active Companions during the battle. Casting is recommended when all buffs are prepared to ensure maximum efficiency.</style></size>","skillLabel":["Expertise Skill","Physical","Light","Direct DMG","AoE","Companion","Ranged"],"activeEffectParams":[["Wolf Damage",[{"r":["100%","104%","108%","120%","124%","128%","140%"]}," ATK +",{"l":["10","23","36","50","63","77","90","104","117","131","144","157","171","184","198","211","225","238","252","265","278","292","305","319","332","346","359","373","386","400"]}," (Resilience Break: 109)"]],["Falcon Damage",[{"r":["100%","104%","108%","120%","124%","128%","140%"]}," ATK +",{"l":["10","23","36","50","63","77","90","104","117","131","144","157","171","184","198","211","225","238","252","265","278","292","305","319","332","346","359","373","386","400"]}," (Resilience Break: 109)"]],["CD",["0.5s"]],["Charge Time",["45s"]]]},"2238":{"name":"Blast Shot","description":"Fires an <style=\"accent-gn\">Explosive Arrow</style> at the target that detonates on impact. The <style=\"accent-gn\">Explosive Arrow</style> deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to all nearby enemies. <br>Each time when a <style=\"accent-gn\">Class Skill</style> deals Crit DMG, <style=\"accent-gn\">Explosive Arrow</style> gains <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> charge. At <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> charges or after <style=\"accent-gn\">6s</style>, the <style=\"accent-gn\">Explosive Arrow</style> explodes, <style=\"accent-gn\">each</style> charge increases the DMG of <style=\"accent-gn\">Explosive Arrow</style> by <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style>. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Better paired with Falconry Spec. Focus on Crit DMG to power up the explosion.</style></size>","skillLabel":["Expertise Skill","Physical","Light","Direct DMG","Single Target","Ranged"],"activeEffectParams":[["Explosive Arrow Damage",[{"r":["180%","187.2%","194.4%","216%","223.2%","230.4%","252%"]}," ATK +",{"l":["18","42","66","90","114","139","163","187","211","235","260","284","308","332","356","381","405","429","453","477","502","526","550","574","598","623","647","671","695","720"]}," (Resilience Break: 67)"]],["Detonation Base DMG",[{"r":["70%","72.8%","75.6%","84%","86.8%","89.6%","98%"]}," ATK +",{"l":["7","16","25","35","44","54","63","72","82","91","101","110","119","129","138","148","157","167","176","185","195","204","214","223","232","242","251","261","270","280"]}," (Resilience Break: 26)"]],["CD",["15s"]]]},"2239":{"name":"Explosive Arrow II","description":"场地标记01"},"2240":{"name":"Sky Piercing Star Strike","description":"Fires a giant arrow at the target, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">1000%</style> ATK.","skillLabel":["Expertise Skill","Physical","Light","Direct DMG","Single Target","Ranged"]},"2301":{"name":"Resonant Strings","description":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Peaceful Tune</style><br>A magical melody that, whenever DMG is dealt, restores HP equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> of the DMG dealt, distributed evenly among up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> allies (Party Members Prioritized). <br>Allies at full HP will not be included in the healing targets. If all Allies are at full HP, the healing will be considered as excess healing. <br><style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Energy</style>: Energy required to play Melody skills (<style=\"accent-gn\">Heroic Melody</style> and <style=\"accent-gn\">Healing Melody</style>). <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> point is regenerated <style=\"accent-gn\">per</style> second. <br><style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style>: Required to perform music. <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> point is regenerated every <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>. <br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack: Resonant Strings</style><br>Strums the strings to emit a scorching soundwave, dealing long-range <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> to the enemy. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Using Basic Attacks when Performance Passion and Performance Energy are not maxed out provides consistent healing. Pair with talents to store this healing for emergency use.</size></style>","skillLabel":["Basic Attack","Magic","Fire","Direct DMG","Single Target","Ranged"],"activeEffectParams":[["Strike I",[{"r":["18%","18.72%","19.44%","21.6%","22.32%","23.04%","25.2%"]}," MATK +",{"l":["2","6","9","13","17","20","24","28","31","35","39","42","46","49","53","57","60","64","68","71","75","78","82","86","89","93","97","100","104","108"]}," (Resilience Break: 14)"]],["Strike II",[{"r":["18%","18.72%","19.44%","21.6%","22.32%","23.04%","25.2%"]}," MATK +",{"l":["2","6","9","13","17","20","24","28","31","35","39","42","46","49","53","57","60","64","68","71","75","78","82","86","89","93","97","100","104","108"]}," (Resilience Break: 14)"]],["Strike III",[{"r":["30%","31.2%","32.4%","36%","37.2%","38.4%","42%"]}," MATK +",{"l":["4","10","16","22","28","34","40","46","52","58","65","71","77","83","89","95","101","107","113","119","125","131","137","143","149","155","161","167","173","180"]}," (Resilience Break: 24)"]],["Strike IV",[{"r":["42%","43.68%","45.36%","50.4%","52.08%","53.76%","58.8%"]}," MATK +",{"l":["6","14","23","31","40","48","57","65","74","82","91","99","107","116","124","133","141","150","158","167","175","184","192","201","209","218","226","235","243","252"]}," (Resilience Break: 34)"]],["Red Light Counter",[{"r":["100%","104%","108%","120%","124%","128%","140%"]}," MATK +",{"l":["10","23","36","50","63","77","90","104","117","131","144","157","171","184","198","211","225","238","252","265","278","292","305","319","332","346","359","373","386","400"]}," (Resilience Break: 100)"]]]},"2306":{"name":"Amplified Beat","description":"Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style> to swing your guitar with force, dealing heavy <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> to enemies. <br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style>: Required to perform music. Regenerates <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack every <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: High coverage healing skill. Use it before your Performance Passion overflows.</size></style>","skillLabel":["Special Attack","Magic","Fire","Direct DMG","Single Target","Melee"],"activeEffectParams":[["Total DMG",[{"r":["80%","83.2%","86.4%","96%","99.2%","102.4%","112%"]}," MATK +",{"l":["12","28","44","60","76","92","108","124","141","157","173","189","205","221","237","254","270","286","302","318","334","350","367","383","399","415","431","447","463","480"]}," (Resilience Break: 111)"]]]},"2307":{"name":"Healing Beat","description":"Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> stacks of <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style> to play a tune that heals the caster and the nearby ally with the lowest HP (party members prioritized). The healing amount scales with the caster's MATK (plus an additional fixed heal equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">3%</style> of the target's Max HP).<br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style>: Required to perform music. <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> point is regenerated every <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: A healing skill with high uptime. Cast it to avoid letting Performance Passion overflow.</size></style>","skillLabel":["Special Attack","Magic","Fire","Direct Healing","Single Target"],"activeEffectParams":[["Total Healing",[{"r":["60%","62.4%","64.8%","72%","74.4%","76.8%","84%"]}," MATK +",{"l":["6","14","22","30","38","46","54","62","70","78","86","94","102","110","118","127","135","143","151","159","167","175","183","191","199","207","215","223","231","240"]}]]]},"2308":{"name":"Harmonic Anthem","description":"Leaps high and slams your guitar into the ground to burst sparks, dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> to the enemies within range. <br>Each instance of DMG dealt by Amplified Beat (only once per multi-target hit) increases the hit count of <style=\"accent-gn\">Harmonic Anthem</style> by <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style>. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Master the Amplified Beat's mechanic of increasing hit count to boost Harmonic Anthem's Attack.</size></style>","skillLabel":["Expertise Skill","Magic","Fire","Direct DMG","AoE","Melee"],"activeEffectParams":[["DMG per hit",[{"r":["150%","156%","162%","180%","186%","192%","210%"]}," MATK +",{"l":["22","52","83","113","143","173","204","234","264","294","325","355","385","415","446","476","506","536","567","597","627","657","688","718","748","778","809","839","869","900"]}," (Resilience Break: 292)"]],["Charge Time",["10s"]]]},"2309":{"name":"Rhapsody of Flame","description":"My Passion Still Burns! Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> stacks of <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style> to summon a randomly shaped graffiti on the ground, healing <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> allies (party members prioritized) and dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> to the enemies within range.<br>While standing within the graffiti, the caster gains <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> Fire Bonus.<br>Only 1 graffiti can exist at a time.<br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style>: Required to perform music. <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> point is regenerated every <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: This skill has the widest range for both healing and DMG. Cast it once the CD ends for max effectiveness.</size></style>","skillLabel":["Expertise Skill","Magic","Fire","Direct DMG","Direct Healing","AoE","Melee"],"activeEffectParams":[["Total DMG",[{"r":["450%","468%","486%","540%","558%","576%","629.99%"]}," MATK +",{"l":["67","158","249","339","430","521","612","702","793","884","975","1066","1156","1247","1338","1429","1519","1610","1701","1792","1883","1973","2064","2155","2246","2336","2427","2518","2609","2700"]}," (Resilience Break: 139)"]],["Total Healing",[{"r":["150%","156%","162%","180%","186%","192%","210%"]}," MATK +",{"l":["15","35","55","75","95","115","136","156","176","196","216","236","257","277","297","317","337","357","378","398","418","438","458","478","499","519","539","559","579","600"]}]],["CD",["15s"]]]},"2310":{"name":"Heroic Melody","description":"A rousing melody. When <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Energy</style> exceeds <style=\"accent-gn\">15</style> stacks, you can begin the performance, which cannot be stopped once started. CD: <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>. <br>While performing <style=\"accent-gn\">Heroic Melody</style>, you consume <style=\"accent-gn\">6</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Energy</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">per</style> second, and every <style=\"accent-gn\">3s</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> allies restore HP (Interval affected by Haste). <br>While you perform <style=\"accent-gn\">Heroic Melody</style>, every <style=\"accent-gn\">7s</style>, your <style=\"accent-gn\">String Strike</style> transforms into <linktext=1615><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Fierce Strike</style></linktext>. <br>While you perform <style=\"accent-gn\">Heroic Melody</style>, the conversion rate of <style=\"accent-gn\">Peaceful Tune</style> +<style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>. <br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Energy</style>: Required to play Melody skills (<style=\"accent-gn\">Heroic Melody</style> and <style=\"accent-gn\">Healing Melody</style>). <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> point of energy is regenerated <style=\"accent-gn\">per</style> second. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: The skill can't be stopped manually, so time its activation wisely to maximize synergy with Peaceful Tune and Fierce Strike.</size></style>","skillLabel":["Expertise Skill","Magic","Fire","Direct DMG","HoT","AoE"],"activeEffectParams":[["Single Healing",[{"r":["20%","20.8%","21.6%","24%","24.8%","25.6%","28%"]}," MATK +",{"l":["2","4","7","10","12","15","18","20","23","26","28","31","34","36","39","42","45","47","50","53","55","58","61","63","66","69","71","74","77","80"]}]]]},"2311":{"name":"Healing Melody","description":"A soothing melody. When <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Energy</style> exceeds <style=\"accent-gn\">15</style>, you can start the performance freely and stop at will. Each time you start, a <style=\"accent-gn\">speaker</style> is deployed to perform a Concerto. (<style=\"accent-gn\">Speaker</style> disappears when <style=\"accent-gn\">Healing Melody</style> ends.) CD: <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>. <br>While performing <style=\"accent-gn\">Healing Melody</style>, consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Energy</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">per</style> second, and heals <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> allies every <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> second (Interval affected by Haste). <br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Speaker</style>: When you cast <style=\"accent-gn\">Healing Beat</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Fivefold Crescendo</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Rock the Stage</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Concert Circuit</style>, the <style=\"accent-gn\">speaker</style> will simultaneously cast the same skill.<br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Energy</style>: Required to play Melody skills (<style=\"accent-gn\">Heroic Melody</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Healing Melody</style>). Regenerates <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> point <style=\"accent-gn\">per</style> second. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Mastering where and when to place the speaker is essential.</size></style>","skillLabel":["Expertise Skill","Magic","Fire","HoT","AoE"],"activeEffectParams":[["Single Healing",[{"r":["20%","20.8%","21.6%","24%","24.8%","25.6%","28%"]}," MATK +",{"l":["2","4","7","10","12","15","18","20","23","26","28","31","34","36","39","42","45","47","50","53","55","58","61","63","66","69","71","74","77","80"]}]]]},"2312":{"name":"Fivefold Crescendo","description":"Let the passion surge again! Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style>, reigniting the spirits of the weary. Performs a sequence of notes that restores HP to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> allies within range (prioritizing teammates) and grants Tenacity Chord. Each stack of Tenacity Chord additionally increases Max HP by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5%</style> (up to <style=\"accent-gn\">2.5%</style> Max HP) for <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style>s (duration cannot be refreshed once 5 stacks are reached).<br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style>: Required to perform music. Regenerates <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack every <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Highest healing potential. Monitor your team's health to maximize efficiency and prevent overhealing.</size></style>","skillLabel":["Expertise Skill","Magic","Fire","Direct Healing","AoE"],"activeEffectParams":[["Total Healing",[{"r":["350%","364%","378%","420%","434%","448%","490%"]}," MATK +",{"l":["35","80","125","175","220","270","315","360","410","455","505","550","595","645","690","740","785","835","880","925","975","1020","1070","1115","1160","1210","1255","1305","1350","1400"]}]],["CD",["35s"]]]},"2313":{"name":"Passion Burst","description":"Strums the strings and releases searing flames forward, dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> to the enemies within range.<br>Charging alters the skill's range and DMG.<br><style=\"accent-gn\">Tier 1</style>: Chants for <style=\"accent-gn\">0.7s</style>, targeting a fan-shaped area with an <style=\"accent-gn\">8</style>-meter radius in front.<br><style=\"accent-gn\">Tier 2</style>: Chants for <style=\"accent-gn\">1.4s</style>, targeting a fan-shaped area with an <style=\"accent-gn\">8</style>-meter radius in front and increasing DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>.<br><style=\"accent-gn\">Tier 3</style>: Chants for <style=\"accent-gn\">2.1s</style>, targeting a fan-shaped area with an <style=\"accent-gn\">8</style>-meter radius in front and increasing DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style>.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: High DMG skill. Combine with Talent effects and the amplifier for strong DMG and healing. Be mindful of environmental safety during casting.</size></style>","skillLabel":["Expertise Skill","Magic","Fire","Direct DMG","AoE"],"activeEffectParams":[["Total DMG",[{"r":["250%","260%","270%","300%","310%","320%","350%"]}," MATK +",{"l":["37","87","138","188","239","289","340","390","440","491","541","592","642","693","743","793","844","894","945","995","1046","1096","1146","1197","1247","1298","1348","1399","1449","1500"]}," (Resilience Break: 648)"]],["CD",["20s"]]]},"2314":{"name":"Rock the Stage","description":"As a passionate music lover, your impromptu performance immediately grants <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style>. It also heals nearby allies and gives them a <style=\"accent-gn\">Shield</style> that lasts for <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style>s, while dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> to nearby enemies.<br><style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style>: Required to perform music. Regenerates <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack every <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style>s.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: In emergencies, this powerful shield can ease the team's survival pressure. Time the cast carefully.</size></style>","skillLabel":["Ultimate","Magic","Fire","Direct Healing","Shield","AoE"],"activeEffectParams":[["Shield",[{"r":["20%","25%","30%","35%","40%","45%","50%"]}," Max HP"]],["Total Healing",[{"r":["351%","365.04%","379.08%","421.2%","435.24%","449.28%","491.4%"]}," MATK +",{"l":["33","81","128","176","221","269","316","364","409","457","504","552","597","645","692","740","788","833","881","928","976","1021","1069","1116","1164","1209","1257","1304","1352","1400"]}]],["Total DMG",[{"r":["351%","365.04%","379.08%","421.2%","435.24%","449.28%","491.4%"]}," MATK +",{"l":["52","121","192","264","333","404","474","545","616","685","757","828","897","969","1040","1109","1181","1252","1321","1392","1464","1533","1604","1674","1745","1816","1886","1957","2028","2098"]}]],["CD",["60s"]]]},"2315":{"name":"Encore","description":"The perfect piece for fan interaction. Grants <style=\"accent-gn\">Encore</style> effect to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> allies for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>. <br><style=\"accent-gn\">Encore</style>: Grants <style=\"accent-gn\">Super Armor</style>. Each time an offensive or healing <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> is cast, there is a <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> fixed chance to trigger <style=\"accent-gn\">Encore Strings</style> once, dealing DMG to the current target or healing the lowest-HP ally. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Cast during your team's burst window for optimal DMG and healing of Encore.</size></style>","skillLabel":["Expertise Skill","Blessing"],"activeEffectParams":[["DMG per hit",[{"r":["30%","31.2%","32.4%","36%","37.2%","38.4%","42%"]}," ATK/MATK +",{"l":["4","10","16","22","28","34","40","46","52","58","65","71","77","83","89","95","101","107","113","119","125","131","137","143","149","155","161","167","173","180"]}]],["Single Healing",[{"r":["30%","31.2%","32.4%","36%","37.2%","38.4%","42%"]}," ATK/MATK +",{"l":["3","7","11","15","19","23","27","31","35","39","43","47","51","55","59","63","67","71","75","79","83","87","91","95","99","103","107","111","115","120"]}]],["Duration",["10s"]],["CD",["45s"]]]},"2316":{"name":"Center Stage","description":"Increases your <style=\"accent-gn\">MATK</style> for a period of time and amplifies the next skill you cast. <br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style>: Your next <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> Special Attacks do not consume <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style>. <br><linktext=1607><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Fivefold Crescendo</style></linktext>: Doubles the healing instances. <br><linktext=1614><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Heroic Melody</style></linktext>: Halves the time needed to trigger <linktext=1615><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Fierce Strike</style></linktext>. <br><linktext=1605><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Harmonic Anthem</style></linktext>: Doubles the DMG dealt. <br><linktext=1608><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Passion Burst</style></linktext>: Allows for direct cast in its strongest form, no chanting required. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Evaluate the battle environment and your combat style, then apply the appropriate enhancement at the optimal moment.</size></style>","skillLabel":["Expertise Skill","Blessing","Increased Damage"],"activeEffectParams":[["MATK bonus",[{"r":["4%","4.4%","4.8%","6%","6.4%","6.8%","8%"]},"+",{"l":["5","7","10","12","15","17","20","23","25","28","30","33","36","38","41","43","46","48","51","54","56","59","61","64","67","69","72","74","77","80"]}]],["Duration",["15s"]],["CD",["0.5s"]],["Charge Time",["60s"]]]},"2317":{"name":"Fierce Strike","description":"Swings your guitar with force, dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">300%</style> ATK to nearby enemies. <linktext=1605><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Harmonic Anthem</style></linktext> instantly gains 1 charge. Scales with the Level/Tier of <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack</style>. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Cast this skill when Harmonic Anthem is on CD.</size></style>"},"2321":{"name":"String Strike","description":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Peaceful Tune</style><br>A magical melody that, whenever DMG is dealt, restores HP equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> of the DMG dealt, distributed evenly among up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> allies (Party Members Prioritized). <br>Allies at full HP will not be included in the healing targets. If all Allies are at full HP, the healing will be considered as excess healing. <br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Energy</style>: Energy required to play Melody skills (<style=\"accent-gn\">Heroic Melody</style> and <style=\"accent-gn\">Healing Melody</style>). <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> point is regenerated <style=\"accent-gn\">per</style> second. <br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style>: Required to perform music. <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> point is regenerated every <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>. <br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack: String Strike</style><br>Strikes the guitar's sideboard to produce a frenzied wave, dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> to nearby enemies. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Using Basic Attacks when Performance Passion and Performance Energy are not maxed out provides consistent healing. Pair with talents to store this healing for emergency use.</size></style>","skillLabel":["Basic Attack","Magic","Fire","Direct DMG","Single Target","Melee"],"activeEffectParams":[["Strike I",[{"r":["18%","18.72%","19.44%","21.6%","22.32%","23.04%","25.2%"]}," MATK +",{"l":["2","6","9","13","17","20","24","28","31","35","39","42","46","49","53","57","60","64","68","71","75","78","82","86","89","93","97","100","104","108"]}," (Resilience Break: 14)"]],["Strike II",[{"r":["18%","18.72%","19.44%","21.6%","22.32%","23.04%","25.2%"]}," MATK +",{"l":["2","6","9","13","17","20","24","28","31","35","39","42","46","49","53","57","60","64","68","71","75","78","82","86","89","93","97","100","104","108"]}," (Resilience Break: 14)"]],["Strike III",[{"r":["30%","31.2%","32.4%","36%","37.2%","38.4%","42%"]}," MATK +",{"l":["4"