n\">2</style> stacks of <style=\"accent-gn\">Lightforged Barrier</style>.<br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Lightforged Barrier</style>: Each stack increases max HP by <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style>, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> stacks. Taking any DMG consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack. The Barrier lasts <style=\"accent-gn\">25s</style> or until all stacks are consumed. Gaining a new stack refreshes the duration.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Maintain high stacks of Lightforged Barrier while weaving in attacks. Pay attention to the use of Vanguard Hunt to trigger bonus effects.</style></size>","skillLabel":["Special Attack","Physical","Light","Direct DMG","Single Target","Melee"],"activeEffectParams":[["Total DMG",[{"r":["120%","124.8%","129.6%","144%","148.8%","153.6%","168%"]}," ATK +",{"l":["12","28","44","60","76","92","108","124","141","157","173","189","205","221","237","254","270","286","302","318","334","350","367","383","399","415","431","447","463","480"]}," (Resilience Break: 503)"]]]},"2407":{"name":"Radiant Infusion","description":"Unleashes holy energy to strike nearby enemies, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> and inflicting <linktext=3009><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Dazzle</style></linktext> for <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>. Grants a <style=\"accent-gn\">Radiant Shield</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">300%</style> ATK. For the next <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>, instantly refreshes <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Holy Sigil</style> for every <style=\"accent-gn\">2s</style> (prioritizing the <style=\"accent-gn\">Holy Sigil</style> with the longest remaining CD), and generates <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style> each time. <br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Radiant Shield</style>: Infuses the Shield with light, absorbing <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> of incoming DMG. The effect can stack absorption and reset duration when the Skill is reused. Max absorption cannot exceed <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> of Max HP. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Instantly boosts survivability and generates Holy Sigil and Photon Energy. Time the casts wisely.</style></size>","skillLabel":["Ultimate","Light","Physical","Direct DMG","AoE","Protect","Melee"],"activeEffectParams":[["Total DMG",[{"r":["300%","312%","324%","360%","372%","384%","420%"]}," ATK +",{"l":["30","70","110","151","191","231","272","312","352","393","433","473","514","554","594","635","675","715","756","796","836","877","917","957","998","1038","1078","1119","1159","1200"]}," (Resilience Break: 720)"]],["CD",["60s"]]]},"2408":{"name":"Shield Toss","description":"Spins and throws a shield, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to enemies hit, <linktext=3000><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">interrupting</style></linktext> them, and reducing all DMG they deal to the caster for the next <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: While improving survivability, it performs well in multi-target situations with its wide-area DMG. Cast it according to your survival conditions or the battle environment.</style></size>","skillLabel":["Expertise Skill","Physical","Light","Direct DMG","AoE","Melee"],"activeEffectParams":[["DMG per hit",[{"r":["100%","104%","108%","120%","124%","128%","140%"]}," ATK +",{"l":["10","23","36","50","63","77","90","104","117","131","144","157","171","184","198","211","225","238","252","265","278","292","305","319","332","346","359","373","386","400"]}," (Resilience Break: 65)"]],["Incoming DMG Resistance",[{"r":["10%","11%","12%","13%","14%","15%","16%"]}]],["CD",["12s"]]]},"2409":{"name":"Divine Circle","description":"Creates a holy zone beneath your feet, healing yourself <style=\"accent-gn\">every</style> second and healing allies in the area slightly, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to enemies.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Great for sustained DMG and healing. Try to cover as much area as possible.</style></size>","skillLabel":["Expertise Skill","Physical","Light","DoT","HoT","AoE","Melee"],"activeEffectParams":[["Total DMG",[{"r":["96%","99.84%","103.68%","115.2%","119.04%","122.88%","134.4%"]}," ATK +",{"l":["12","36","72","96","120","144","180","204","228","252","288","312","336","360","396","420","444","468","504","528","552","576","612","636","660","684","720","744","768","792"]}," (Resilience Break: 288)"]],["Total Healing",[{"r":["348%","361.92%","375.84%","417.6%","431.52%","445.44%","487.08%"]}," ATK +",{"l":["24","72","120","168","216","264","312","360","408","456","504","552","600","636","684","732","780","828","876","924","972","1020","1068","1116","1164","1212","1260","1296","1344","1392"]}]],["CD",["30s"]]]},"2410":{"name":"Judgment","description":"Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">45</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style> to call down a blast of holy light on the target area, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> and healing yourself based on HP lost (minimum heal: <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style> of Max HP).<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Cast when your HP is low—but not critically low—to maximize healing while staying safe.</style></size>","skillLabel":["Expertise Skill","Physical","Light","Direct DMG","Direct Healing","Single Target","Melee"],"activeEffectParams":[["Total DMG",[{"r":["150%","156%","162%","180%","186%","192%","210%"]}," ATK +",{"l":["15","35","55","75","95","115","136","156","176","196","216","236","257","277","297","317","337","357","378","398","418","438","458","478","499","519","539","559","579","600"]}," (Resilience Break: 326)"]],["Total Healing",[{"r":["30%","31%","32%","35%","36%","37%","40%"]}," Lost HP"]]]},"2411":{"name":"Scorching Judgment","description":"场地标记01"},"2412":{"name":"Reckoning","description":"Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Holy Sigils</style>. Performs a fiery blade strike at all nearby enemies, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Powerful offensive skill. Use when survivability is not an issue.</style></size>","skillLabel":["Expertise Skill","Physical","Light","Direct DMG","AoE","Melee"],"activeEffectParams":[["Total DMG",[{"r":["350%","364%","378%","420%","434%","448%","489.99%"]}," ATK +",{"l":["34","81","127","175","221","270","316","363","410","457","504","551","597","646","692","740","787","834","881","927","975","1022","1070","1116","1163","1210","1257","1304","1351","1400"]}," (Resilience Break: 451)"]]]},"2413":{"name":"Inferno Reckon","description":"Empowered <linktext=1563><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Reckoning</style></linktext> deals <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> times the normal DMG of <linktext=1563><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Reckoning</style></linktext>, starts at <style=\"accent-gn\">250%</style> Crit DMG, and does not consume <style=\"accent-gn\">Holy Sigils</style>, but still generates Holy <style=\"accent-gn\">Energy</style>."},"2415":{"name":"Aegis Ward","description":"Summons Aegis Ward to shield yourself, automatically countering <style=\"accent-gn\">Lethal Skills</style> while increasing <style=\"accent-gn\">Armor</style> and <style=\"accent-gn\">DMG Reduction</style>. If you take lethal DMG while this effect is active, the effect is consumed to prevent death and immediately restore <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">HP</style>. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Powerful Resistance effect combined with death prevention, extremely valuable when facing extreme survival threats.</style></size>","skillLabel":["Expertise Skill","Protect","Direct Healing"],"activeEffectParams":[["Armor increase",[{"l":["1000","1024","1048","1072","1096","1120","1144","1168","1193","1217","1241","1265","1289","1313","1337","1362","1386","1410","1434","1458","1482","1506","1531","1555","1579","1603","1627","1651","1675","1700"]}]],["DMG Reduction",[{"r":["20%","21.2%","22.4%","26%","27.2%","28.4%","32%"]}]],["Duration",["10s"]],["CD",["45s"]]]},"2416":{"name":"Condemn","description":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">200%</style> ATK to the enemy (which scales with the Level/Tier of <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack</style>)."},"2417":{"name":"Enhanced Condemn","description":"Enhanced <linktext=1563><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Condemn</style></linktext>, whose DMG is equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style>times that of <linktext=1563><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Condemn</style></linktext>."},"2419":{"name":"Zeal Crusade","description":"Consumes up to <style=\"accent-gn\">8</style> stacks of <style=\"accent-gn\">Lightforged Barrier</style>, summoning continuous radiant energy to spiral rapidly around you. <style=\"accent-gn\">Each</style> second, it deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to nearby enemies (interval affected by Attack Speed) and grants <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack of <style=\"accent-gn\">Lightforged Barrier</style>. <br>Each time it deals DMG to <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> target, restores <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> max HP (up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style>). When activated, <style=\"accent-gn\">each</style> stack of <style=\"accent-gn\">Lightforged Barrier</style> adds <style=\"accent-gn\">2s</style> to the duration, up to a maximum of <style=\"accent-gn\">16s</style>. <br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Lightforged Barrier</style>: Max HP +<style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style> with each stack. Lightforged Barrier stacks up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> times. Any incoming DMG consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack. The effect lasts <style=\"accent-gn\">25s</style> or until all stacks are consumed. Duration resets each time a new stack is gained. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Cast Lightforged Barrier to deal DMG and heal. Cast the skill when Lightforged Barrier is fully stacked to achieve excellent defense and burst potential.</style></size>","skillLabel":["Expertise Skill","Physical","Light","DoT","AoE","Melee"],"activeEffectParams":[["DMG per hit",[{"r":["100%","104%","108%","120%","124%","128%","140%"]}," ATK +",{"l":["10","23","36","50","63","77","90","104","117","131","144","157","171","184","198","211","225","238","252","265","278","292","305","319","332","346","359","373","386","400"]}," (Resilience Break: 841)"]],["CD",["45s"]]]},"2420":{"name":"Radiance","description":"Gains unwavering resolve and throws <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> shields at the enemies within <style=\"accent-gn\">10m</style> (closest first), dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> and <linktext=3000><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">interrupting</style></linktext> them. Afterward, throws <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> time every <style=\"accent-gn\">2s</style> and gains <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style> each time. For the next <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>, each instance of damage taken is reduced by a percentage of the caster's Max HP, and the caster automatically counters <style=\"accent-gn\">Lethal Skill</style>. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: This skill requires no Photon Energy or Holy Sigil to cast and provides solid survivability, making it suitable as an opener.</style></size>","skillLabel":["Expertise Skill","Protect"],"activeEffectParams":[["Total DMG",[{"r":["120%","124.8%","129.6%","144%","148.8%","153.6%","168%"]}," ATK +",{"l":["12","28","44","60","76","92","108","124","141","157","173","189","205","221","237","254","270","286","302","318","334","350","367","383","399","415","431","447","463","480"]}," (Resilience Break: 312)"]],["Resistance ratio",[{"r":["10%","10.4%","10.8%","12%","12.4%","12.8%","14%"]}," Max HP"]],["Charge Time",["70s"]]]},"2421":{"name":"Sacred Blade","description":"Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Holy Sigils</style>, summoning a sword from beneath the target's feet to deal <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to the targe