","dialogue":"Darkness, to be illuminated by thunder!","activeSkillName":"Arcane! Thunderfall Grasp","description":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Summons Boss</style>: Tempest Ogre and channels the power of thunder to generate a vortex, continuously pulling in enemies near the target and dealing AoE <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> when the duration ends.","passiveBufDescriptions":[["Every <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>, unleashes a lightning strike on a random nearby target, dealing <style=\"magic\">Thunder</style> <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">37.3%</style> ATK. Taking DMG reduces the lightning trigger interval by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5s</style>. Each trigger reduces the CD of this skill by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5</style>, and targets hit deal <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style> less DMG to you for <style=\"accent-gn\">3s</style>.","Every <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>, unleashes a lightning strike on a random nearby target, dealing <style=\"magic\">Thunder</style> <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">48.49%</style> ATK. Taking DMG reduces the lightning trigger interval by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5s</style>. Each trigger reduces the CD of this skill by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5</style>, and targets hit deal <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style> less DMG to you for <style=\"accent-gn\">3s</style>.","Every <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>, unleashes a lightning strike on a random nearby target, dealing <style=\"magic\">Thunder</style> <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">59.68%</style> ATK. Taking DMG reduces the lightning trigger interval by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5s</style>. Each trigger reduces the CD of this skill by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5</style>, and targets hit deal <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style> less DMG to you for <style=\"accent-gn\">3s</style>.","Every <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>, unleashes a lightning strike on a random nearby target, dealing <style=\"magic\">Thunder</style> <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">70.87%</style> ATK. Taking DMG reduces the lightning trigger interval by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5s</style>. Each trigger reduces the CD of this skill by <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>, and targets hit deal <style=\"accent-gn\">8%</style> less DMG to you for <style=\"accent-gn\">3s</style>.","Every <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>, unleashes a lightning strike on a random nearby target, dealing <style=\"magic\">Thunder</style> <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">82.06%</style> ATK. Taking DMG reduces the lightning trigger interval by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5s</style>. Each trigger reduces the CD of this skill by <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>, and targets hit deal <style=\"accent-gn\">8%</style> less DMG to you for <style=\"accent-gn\">3s</style>.","Every <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>, unleashes a lightning strike on a random nearby target, dealing <style=\"magic\">Thunder</style> <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">93.25%</style> ATK. Taking DMG reduces the lightning trigger interval by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5s</style>. Each trigger reduces the CD of this skill by <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style>, and targets hit deal <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> less DMG to you for <style=\"accent-gn\">3s</style>."]],"activeEffectParams":[["Total DMG",["1050% ATK/MATK +105 (Resilience Break: 100)","1207.4% ATK/MATK +105 (Resilience Break: 100)","1365% ATK/MATK +105 (Resilience Break: 100)","1522.5% ATK/MATK +105 (Resilience Break: 100)","1680% ATK/MATK +105 (Resilience Break: 100)","1837.5% ATK/MATK +105 (Resilience Break: 100)"]],["CD",["120s","120s","120s","100s","100s","80s"]]],"skillLabel":["Resonance Skill","Magic","Direct DMG","AoE","Crowd Control"]},"3903":{"name":"Brigand Leader","dialogue":"Come, feel the heat of my battle axe!","activeSkillName":"Arcane! Blazing Axe","description":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Transforms i