,"Physical","Direct DMG","AoE","Increased Damage"]},"3949":{"name":"Dorothy","dialogue":"Technique is born from practice, but true artistry is born from responsibility.","activeSkillName":"Arcane! Illusion Resonance","description":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Transforms into</style> Dorothy, replacing basic attack modules and gaining <linktext=1210><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Artisan's Power</style></linktext>. <br>Passive: Dealing damage has a <style=\"accent-gn\">40%</style> chance to trigger Chain Lightning (trigger interval: at least <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5s</style>).<br>① Charges and fires a powerful shot at the target, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>. Each additional charge increases the damage by <style=\"accent-gn\">150%</style>.<br>② Leaps into the air and launches a Thunderstorm Bolt at the target, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> and creating a Thunderstorm Zone at the target for 7s. Thunderstorm Zone deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> per second to enemies within and <linktext=3011><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">slows</style></linktext> them. <br>③ Continuously unleashes Thunder Tracers, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> and inflicting <linktext=3008><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Paralysis</style></linktext> on hit. <br>④ Fires an Oblivion Bomb, which explodes after traveling a distance or upon impact, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>.","activeEffectParams":[["Transformation Cooldown",["20s","20s","20s","20s","20s","20s"]],["[Passive]",["Effect","Effect","Effect","Effect","Effect","Effect"]],["Lightning Chain",["1000% ATK/MATK +50","1000% ATK/MATK +50","1000% ATK/MATK +50","1000% ATK/MATK +50","1000% ATK/MATK +50","1000% ATK/MATK +50"]],["[Basic Attack]",["Effect","Effect","Effect","Effect","Effect","Effect"]],["Basic Attack 1st Hit",["400% ATK/MATK +20","480% ATK/MATK +20","560% ATK/MATK +20","640% ATK/MATK +20","720% ATK/MATK +20","800% ATK/MATK +20"]],["Basic Attack 2nd Hit",["800% ATK/MATK +40","960% ATK/