"20s","20s","20s","20s"]],["Charge Time",["120s","120s","120s","100s","100s","80s"]]],"skillLabel":["Resonance Skill","Physical","Direct DMG","AoE","Increased Damage"]},"3969":{"name":"Igoreus","dialogue":"skill_aoyi_advanced_texture025","activeSkillName":"Arcane! Rift Recoil","description":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Summons</style> Igoreus to deal <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>. Holds <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> charges.<br>After casting, your <style=\"accent-gn\">Crit</style> is temporarily increased. Any base Crit Rate exceeding <style=\"accent-gn\">60%</style> is converted into a <style=\"accent-gn\">Crit DMG</style> boost at a set ratio.","passiveBufDescriptions":[["Crit DMG +<style=\"accent-gn\">5.6%</style>. Landing a Crit has a chance to further increase Crit DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">1.66%</style> (chance equals Crit Rate; triggers at most once every <style=\"accent-gn\">0.1s</style>), up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> stacks, lasting <style=\"accent-gn\">2s</style>.","Crit DMG +<style=\"accent-gn\">7.28%</style>. Landing a Crit has a chance to further increase Crit DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">2.16%</style> (chance equals Crit Rate; triggers at most once every <style=\"accent-gn\">0.1s</style>), up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> stacks, lasting <style=\"accent-gn\">2s</style>.","Crit DMG +<style=\"accent-gn\">8.96%</style>. Landing a Crit has a chance to further increase Crit DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">2.67%</style> (chance equals Crit Rate; triggers at most once every <style=\"accent-gn\">0.1s</style>), up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> stacks, lasting <style=\"accent-gn\">2s</style>.","Crit DMG +<style=\"accent-gn\">10.64%</style>. Landing a Crit has a chance to further increase Crit DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">3.18%</style> (chance equals Crit Rate; triggers at most once every <style=\"accent-gn\">0.1s</style>), up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> stacks, lasting <style=\"accent-gn\">2s</style>.","Crit DMG +<style=\"accent-gn\">12.32%</style>. Landing a Crit has a chance to further increase Crit DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">3.69%</style> (chance equals Crit Rate; triggers at most once every <style=\"accent-gn\">0.1s</style>), up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> stacks, lasting <style=\"accent-gn\">2s</style>.","Crit DMG +<style=\"accent-gn\">14%</style>. Landing a Crit has a chance to further increase Crit DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">4.2%</style> (chance equals Crit Rate; triggers at most once every <style=\"accent-gn\">0.1s</style>), up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> stacks, lasting <style=\"accent-gn\">2s</style>."]],"activeEffectParams":[["Total DMG",["1500% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)","1725% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)","1950% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)","2175% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)","2400% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)","2625% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)"]],["Crit Bonus",["","","","","",""]],["Excess Crit to Crit DMG Conversion Rate",["","","","","",""]],["Crit DMG Limit",["","","","","",""]],["Duration",["20s","20s","20s","20s","20s","20s"]],["Charge Time",["90s","90s","90s","75s","75s","60s"]]],"skillLabel":["Resonance Skill","Physical","Direct DMG","AoE","Increased Damage","Crit"]},"3970":{"name":"Plague Nappo","dialogue":"skill_aoyi_advanced_texture025","activeSkillName":"Arcane! Command Quadrant","description":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Summons</style> Plague Nappo. The Nappo's attack method and skill effects change based on the type of skill cast previously.<br>If cast directly or after a <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">summons</style> Stormblade Nappo to deal AoE <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> once, and reduces the current Resonance Skill's CD by <style=\"accent-gn\">81.25%</style>.<br>If cast after an <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">summons</style> Marksman Nappo to deal <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to a single target, and reduces the current Resonance Skill's CD by <style=\"accent-gn\">68.75%</style>.<br>If cast after an <style=\"accent-gn\">Ultimate</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">summons</style> Wind Knight Nappo to deal <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> once, reduces the current Resonance Skill's CD by <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style>, and temporarily increases your <style=\"accent-gn\">DMG</style>.<br>If cast after another <style=\"accent-gn\">Resonance Skill</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">summons</style> Beat Performer Nappo to reduce the CD of the previously cast <style=\"accent-gn\">Resonance Skill</style> (excluding this one).","passiveBufDescriptions":[["Casting Class Skills reduces the CD of the current Resonance Skill's active effect by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.2</style> (triggers up to once every <style=\"accent-gn\">1s</style>).","Casting Class Skills reduces the CD of the current Resonance Skill's active effect by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.3</style> (triggers up to once every <style=\"accent-gn\">1s</style>).","Casting Class Skills reduces the CD of the current Resonance Skill's active effect by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.3</style> (triggers up to once every <style=\"accent-gn\">1s</style>).","Casting Class Skills reduces the CD of the current Resonance Skill's active effect by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.4</style> (triggers up to once every <style=\"accent-gn\">1s</style>).","Casting Class Skills reduces the CD of the current Resonance Skill's active effect by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.4</style> (triggers up to once every <style=\"accent-gn\">1s</style>).","Casting Class Skills reduces the CD of the current Resonance Skill's active effect by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5</style> (triggers up to once every <style=\"accent-gn\">1s</style>)."]],"activeEffectParams":[["Stormblade Nappo Damage",["2000% ATK/MATK +200 (Resilience Break: 100)","2299.5% ATK/MATK +200 (Resilience Break: 100)","2600% ATK/MATK +200 (Resilience Break: 100)","2900% ATK/MATK +200 (Resilience Break: 100)","3200% ATK/MATK +200 (Resilience Break: 100)","3500% ATK/MATK +200 (Resilience Break: 100)"]],["Marksman Nappo Damage",["6000% ATK/MATK +600 (Resilience Break: 2000)","6900% ATK/MATK +600 (Resilience Break: 2000)","7800% ATK/MATK +600 (Resilience Break: 2000)","8700% ATK/MATK +600 (Resilience Break: 2000)","9600% ATK/MATK +600 (Resilience Break: 2000)","10500% ATK/MATK +600 (Resilience Break: 2000)"]],["Wind Knight Nappo Damage",["1500% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)","1724.9% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)","1950% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)","2175% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)","2400% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)","2625% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)"]],["DMG Boost",["12.5%","15%","17.5%","20%","22.5%","25%"]],["Duration",["20s","20s","20s","20s","20s","20s"]],["Beat Performer Nappo Damage",["4500% ATK/MATK +450 (Resilience Break: 300)","5175% ATK/MATK +450 (Resilience Break: 300)","5850% ATK/MATK +450 (Resilience Break: 300)","6525% ATK/MATK +450 (Resilience Break: 300)","7200% ATK/MATK +450 (Resilience Break: 300)","7875% ATK/MATK +450 (Resilience Break: 300)"]],["Other Resonance Skills CD Reduction",["40%","52%","64%","76%","88%","100%"]],["CD",["120s","120s","120s","100s","100s","80s"]]],"skillLabel":["Resonance Skill","Physical","Direct DMG","Single Target","AoE","Increased Damage"]},"3971":{"name":"Kartgriff","dialogue":"skill_aoyi_advanced_texture025","activeSkillName":"Arcane! Superconductor Surge","description":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Summons</style> Kartgriff to deal <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style>.<br>After casting, temporarily grants a <style=\"accent-gn\">Main Stats</style> and <style=\"accent-gn\">Healing Received</style> boost to you and up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> nearby allies (prioritizing teammates).<br><style=\"accent-gn\">(Cannot be affected by the same type of effect within 60s.)</style>","passiveBufDescriptions":[["Current Spec's Strength/Intellect/Agility <style=\"accent-gn\">+6%</style>, Healing <style=\"a