7</style> stacks, lasting <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>.","Expertise Skill DMG increased by <style=\"accent-gn\">1.56%</style> of ATK. Grants 1 additional stack for every <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> Haste, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">7</style> stacks, lasting <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>.","Expertise Skill DMG increased by <style=\"accent-gn\">1.92%</style> of ATK. Grants 1 additional stack for every <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> Haste, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">7</style> stacks, lasting <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>.","Expertise Skill DMG increased by <style=\"accent-gn\">2.28%</style> of ATK. Grants 1 additional stack for every <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> Haste, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">7</style> stacks, lasting <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>.","Expertise Skill DMG increased by <style=\"accent-gn\">2.64%</style> of ATK. Grants 1 additional stack for every <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> Haste, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">7</style> stacks, lasting <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>.","Expertise Skill DMG increased by <style=\"accent-gn\">3%</style> of ATK. Grants 1 additional stack for every <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> Haste, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">7</style> stacks, lasting <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>."]],"activeEffectParams":[["Total DMG",["1500% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)","1725% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)","1950% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)","2175% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)","2400% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)","2625% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)"]],["Extra ATK Boost Per Stack",["0.2%","0.24%","0.28%","0.32%","0.36%","0.4%"]],["Extra ATK Boost Per Stack Limit",["2.4%","2.88%","3.36%","3.84%","4.32%","4.8%"]],["Duration",["20s","20s","20s","20s","20s","20s"]],["CD",["120s","120s","120s","100s","100s","80s"]]],"skillLabel":["Resonance Skill","Physical","Direct DMG","AoE","Increased Damage"]},"3973":{"name":"Rebel King","dialogue":"skill_aoyi_advanced_texture025","activeSkillName":"Arcane! Flash Stomp","description":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Summons</style> Boss: Rebel King to deal <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>.<br>After casting, temporarily grants full passive stacks, with the effect multiplied by <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style>.","passiveBufDescriptions":[["Casting a Class Skill different from the previous one (excluding Basic Attacks) grants a <style=\"accent-gn\">1.6%</style> Elemental Bonus, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> times. Casting the same skill resets the stacks. At max stacks, stacks can no longer be gained or lost for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>, and are cleared when the duration ends.","Casting a Class Skill different from the previous one (excluding Basic Attacks) grants a <style=\"accent-gn\">2.08%</style> Elemental Bonus, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> times. Casting the same skill resets the stacks. At max stacks, stacks can no longer be gained or lost for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>, and are cleared when the duration ends.","Casting a Class Skill different from the previous one (excluding Basic Attacks) grants a <style=\"accent-gn\">2.56%</style> Elemental Bonus, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> times. Casting the same skill resets the stacks. At max stacks, stacks can no longer be gained or lost for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>, and are cleared when the duration ends.","Casting a Class Skill different from the previous one (excluding Basic Attacks) grants a <style=\"accent-gn\">3.04%</style> Elemental Bonus, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> times. Casting the same skill resets the stacks. At max stacks, stacks can no longer be gained or lost for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>, and are cleared when the duration ends.","Casting a Class Skill different from the previous one (excluding Basic Attacks) grants a <style=\"accent-gn\">3.52%</style> Elemental Bonus, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> times. Casting the same skill resets the stacks. At max stacks, stacks can no longer be gained or lost for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>, and are cleared when the duration ends.","Casting a Class Skill different from the previous one (excluding Basic Attacks) grants a <style=\"accent-gn\">4%</style> Elemental Bonus, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> times. Casting the same skill resets the stacks. At max stacks, stacks can no longer be gained or lost for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>, and are cleared when the duration ends."]],"activeEffectParams":[["Total DMG",["1500% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)","1725% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)","1950% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)","2175% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)","2400% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)","2625% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)"]],["Duration",["20s","20s","20s","20s","20s","20s"]],["CD",["120s","120s","120s","100s","100s","80s"]]],"skillLabel":["Resonance Skill","Physical","Direct DMG","AoE","Increased Damage"]},"3974":{"name":"Void Watcher","dialogue":"skill_aoyi_advanced_texture025","activeSkillName":"Arcane! Precision Burst","description":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Summons</style> Boss: Void Watcher, dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> and occupying an area for a period of time.<br>You and your teammates within the area gain increased <style=\"accent-gn\">ATK</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Attack SPD</style>, and <style=\"accent-gn\">Casting SPD</style>. The effect on yourself is multiplied by <style=\"accent-gn\">2.5</style>.<br><style=\"accent-gn\">(Does not stack; only one of the same effect may be active.)</style>","passiveBufDescriptions":[["Casting a healing skill deals <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">80%</style> of ATK to nearby enemies (each time a healing skill is cast, this damage effect is increased by <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style>, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> times for <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>).","Casting a healing skill deals <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">104%</style> of ATK to nearby enemies (each time a healing skill is cast, this damage effect is increased by <style=\"accent-gn\">26%</style>, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> times for <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>).","Casting a healing skill deals <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">128%</style> of ATK to nearby enemies (each time a healing skill is cast, this damage effect is increased by <style=\"accent-gn\">32%</style>, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> times for <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>).","Casting a healing skill deals <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">152%</style> of ATK to nearby enemies (each time a healing skill is cast, this damage effect is increased by <style=\"accent-gn\">38%</style>, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> times for <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>).","Casting a healing skill deals <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">176%</style> of ATK to nearby enemies (each time a healing skill is cast, this damage effect is increased by <style=\"accent-gn\">44%</style>, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> times for <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>).","Casting a healing skill deals <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">200%</style> of ATK to nearby enemies (each time a healing skill is cast, this damage effect is increased by <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> times for <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>)."]],"activeEffectParams":[["Total DMG",["1050% ATK/MATK +105 (Resilience Break: 93)","1206.3% ATK/MATK +105 (Resilience Break: 93)","1365% ATK/MATK +105 (Resilience Break: 93)","1522.5% ATK/MATK +105 (Resilience Break: 93)","1680% ATK/MATK +105 (Resilience Break: 93)","1837.5% ATK/MATK +105 (Resilience Break: 93)"]],["ATK bonus",["3%","3.6%","4.2%","4.8%","5.4%","6%"]],["Attack SPD Boost",["3%","3.6%","4.2%","4.8%","5.4%","6%"]],["Casting SPD Boost",["6%","7.2%","8.4%","9.6%","10.8%","12%"]],["Duration",["15s","15s","15s","15s","15s","15s"]],["CD",["120s","120s","120s","100s","100s","80s"]]],"skillLabel":["Resonance Skill","Magic","Direct DMG","AoE","Increased Damage","Acceleration"]},"3975":{"name":"Ridge Fang","dialogue":"skill_aoyi_advanced_texture025","activeSkillName":"Arcane! Piercing Roar","description":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Summons</style> Boss: Ridge Fang to deal <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>.<br>After casting, instantly resets Survival Instinct CD. You remain Invigorated temporarily, and your <style=\"accent-gn\">Armor and Max HP</style> are increased.","passiveBufDescriptions":[["When HP is above <style=\"accent-gn\">90%</style>, grants Invigorated: Super Armor and immunity to <linktext=3020><style=\"accent-gn\">status effects</style></linktext><br>. Upon taking lethal DMG, grants Survival Instinct: HP will not fall below <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>, and restores <style=\"accent-gn\">4%</style> HP per second (triggers at most once every <style=\"accent-gn\">90</style>).","When HP is above <style=\"accent-gn\">90%</style>, grants Invigorated: Super Armor and immunity to <linktext=3020><style=\"accent-gn\">status effects</style></linktext><br>. Upon taking lethal DMG, grants Survival Instinct: HP will not fall below <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>, and restores <style=\"accent-gn\">5.2%</style> HP per second (triggers at most once every <style=\"accent-gn\">85</style>).","When HP is above <style=\"accent-gn\">90%</style>, grants Invigorated: Super Armor and immunity to <linktext=3020><style=\"accent-gn\">status effects</style></linktext><br>. Upon taking lethal DMG, grants Survival Instinct: HP will not fall below <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>, and restores <style=\"accent-gn\">6.4%</style> HP per second (triggers at most once every <style=\"accent-gn\">80</style>).","When HP is above <style=\"accent-gn\">90%</style>, grants Invigorated: Super Armor and immunity to <linktext=3020><style=\"accent-gn\">status effects</style></linktext><br>. Upon taking lethal DMG, grants Survival Instinct: HP will not fall below <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">1.5</style>, and restores <style=\"accent-gn\">7.6%</style> HP per second (triggers at most once every <style=\"accent-gn\">73</style>).","When HP is above <style=\"accent-gn\">90%</style>, grants Invigorated: Super Armor and immunity to <linktext=3020><style=\"accent-gn\">status effects</style></linktext><br>. Upon taking lethal DMG, grants Survival Instinct: HP will not fall below <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">1.5</style>, and restores <style=\"accent-gn\">8.8%</style> HP per second (triggers at most once every <style=\"accent-gn\">68</style>).","When HP is above <style=\"accent-gn\">90%</style>, grants Invigorated: Super Armor and immunity to <linktext=3020><style=\"accent-gn\">status effects</style></linktext><br>. Upon taking lethal DMG, grants Survival Instinct: HP will not fall below <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style>, and restores <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> HP per second (triggers at most once every <style=\"accent-gn\">60</style>)."]],"activeEffectParams":[["Total DMG",["1500% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)","1725% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)","1950% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)","2175% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)","2400% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)","2625% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)"]],["Armor Boost",["10%","12%","14%","16%","18%","20%"]],["Max HP Boost",["10%","12%","14%","16%","18%","20%"]],["Duration",["20s","20s","20s","20s","20s","20s"]],["CD",["120s","120s","120s","100s","100s","80s"]]],"skillLabel":["Resonance Skill","Physical","Direct DMG","AoE","Protect"]},"3976":{"name":"Bloodthirsty Furball","dialogue":"skill_aoyi_advanced_texture025","activeSkillName":"Arcane! Swift Devour","description":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Summons</style> Boss: Bloodthirsty Furball to deal <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>.<br>For a period of time after casting, every time your <style=\"accent-gn\">Class Skills</style> and <style=\"accent-gn\">Luck effect</style> deal damage, they add extra damage on top of the skill's base value, equal to a certain percentage of your ATK.","passiveBufDescriptions":[["For every <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> instances of DMG dealt by Class Skills (each attack counts only once), the next DMG instance additionally deals AoE Adaptive <style=\"physical\">Attack/Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">160%</style> of ATK.","For every <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> instances of DMG dealt by Class Skills (each attack counts only once), the next DMG instance additionally deals AoE Adaptive <style=\"physical\">Attack/Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">208%</style> of ATK.","For every <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> instances of DMG dealt by Class Skills (each attack counts only once), the next DMG instance additionally deals AoE Adaptive <style=\"physical\">Attack/Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">256%</style> of ATK.","For every <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> instances of DMG dealt by Class Skills (each attack counts only once), the next DMG instance additionally deals AoE Adaptive <style=\"physical\">Attack/Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">304%</style> of ATK.","For every <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> instances of DMG dealt by Class Skills (each attack counts only once), the next DMG instance additionally deals AoE Adaptive <style=\"physical\">Attack/Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">352%</style> of ATK.","For every <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> instances of DMG dealt by Class Skills (each attack counts only once), the next DMG instance additionally deals AoE Adaptive <style=\"physical\">Attack/Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">400%</style> of ATK."]],"activeEffectParams":[["Total DMG",["1500% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)","1725% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)","1950% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)","2175% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)","2400% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)","2625% ATK/MATK +150 (Resilience Break: 100)"]],["Additional Damage",["39% ATK/MATK","46.8% ATK/MATK","54.6% ATK/MATK","62.4% ATK/MATK","70.2% ATK/MATK","78% ATK/MATK"]],["Duration",["20s","20s","20s","20s","20s","20s"]],["CD",["120s","120s","120s","100s","100s","80s"]]],"skillLabel":["Resonance Skill","Physical","Direct DMG","AoE","Increased Damage"]},"3977":{"name":"Killer Arachnocrab","dialogue":"skill_aoyi_advanced_texture025","activeSkillName":"Stunt! Hidden Strike","description":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Summons</style> Elite: Killer Arachnocrab to deal <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>.<br>After casting, you gain full passive stacks for a period of time, during which they do not decrease.","passiveBufDescriptions":[["When damage triggers a Lucky Strike, it may activate a \"Luck effect\": Causes an explosion at the target's location, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">11.2%</style> of ATK (CD: <style=\"accent-gn\">0.1s</style>).<br>Each successful trigger increases the Elemental DMG of this Luck effect by <style=\"accent-gn\">4%</style>, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> times, lasting <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5s</style>.","When damage triggers a Lucky Strike, it may activate a \"Luck effect\": Causes an explosion at the target's location, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">14.56%</style> of ATK (CD: <style=\"accent-gn\">0.1s</style>).<br>Each successful trigger increases the Elemental DMG of this Luck effect by <style=\"accent-gn\">5.2%</style>, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> times, lasting <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5s</style>.","When damage triggers a Lucky Strike, it may activate a \"Luck effect\": Causes an explosion at the target's location, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">17.92%</style> of ATK (CD: <style=\"accent-gn\">0.1s</style>).<br>Each successful trigger increases the Elemental DMG of this Luck effect by <style=\"accent-gn\">6.4%</style>, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> times, lasting <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5s</style>.","When damage triggers a Lucky Strike, it may activate a \"Luck effect\": Causes an explosion at the target's location, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">21.28%</style> of ATK (CD: <style=\"accent-gn\">0.1s</style>).<br>Each successful trigger increases the Elemental DMG of this Luck effect by <style=\"accent-gn\">7.6%</style>, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> times, lasting <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5s</style>.","When damage triggers a Lucky Strike, it may activate a \"Luck effect\": Causes an explosion at the target's location, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">24.64%</style> of ATK (CD: <style=\"accent-gn\">0.1s</style>).<br>Each successful trigger increases the Elemental DMG of this Luck effect by <style=\"accent-gn\">8.8%</style>, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> times, lasting <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5s</style>.","When damage triggers a Lucky Strike, it may activate a \"Luck effect\": Causes an explosion at the target's location, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">28%</style> of ATK (CD: <style=\"accent-gn\">0.1s</style>).<br>Each successful trigger increases the Elemental DMG of this Luck effect by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> times, lasting <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5s</style>."]],"activeEffectParams":[["Total DMG",["750% ATK/MATK +75 (Resilience Break: 100)","862.5% ATK/MATK +75 (Resilience Break: 100)","975% ATK/MATK +75 (Resilience Break: 100)","1087.5% ATK/MATK +75 (Resilience Break: 100)","1200% ATK/MATK +75 (Resilience Break: 100)","1312.5% ATK/MATK +75 (Resilience Break: 100)"]],["Duration",["20s","20s","20s","20s","20s","20s"]],["CD",["120s","120s","120s","100s","100s","80s"]]],"skillLabel":["Resonance Skill","Physical","Direct DMG","AoE","Luck"]},"3978":{"name":"Verdant Fang","dialogue":"skill_aoyi_advanced_texture025","activeSkillName":"Stunt! Absolute Zero","description":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Summons</style> Elite: Verdant Fang to deal <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>.<br>For a period of time after casting, each Class Skill used reduces your remaining <style=\"accent-gn\">Ultimate</style> CD (triggers up to once every <style=\"accent-gn\">1s</style>).","passiveBufDescriptions":[["Ultimate DMG <style=\"accent-gn\">+12%</style>.","Ultimate DMG <style=\"accent-gn\">+15.6%</style>.","Ultimate DMG <style=\"accent-gn\">+19.2%</style>.","Ultimate DMG <style=\"accent-gn\">+22.8%</style>.","Ultimate DMG <style=\"accent-gn\">+26.4%</style>.","Ultimate DMG <style=\"accent-gn\">+30%</style>."]],"activeEffectParams":[["Total DMG",["750% ATK/MATK +75 (Resilience Break: 100)","862.5% ATK/MATK +75 (Resilience Break: 100)","975% ATK/MATK +75 (Resilience Break: 100)","1087.5% ATK/MATK +75 (Resilience Break: 100)","1200% ATK/MATK +75 (Resilience Break: 100)","1312.5% ATK/MATK +75 (Resilience Break: 100)"]],["CD Decrease Per Cast",["5%","6%","7%","8%","9%","10%"]],["Duration",["20s","20s","20s","20s","20s","20s"]],["CD",["120s","120s","120s","100s","100s","80s"]]],"skillLabel":["Resonance Skill","Physical","Direct DMG","AoE","Increased Damage"]},"3979":{"name":"Man-Eating Furball","dialogue":"skill_aoyi_advanced_texture025","activeSkillName":"Stunt! Abyssal Breath","description":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Summons</style> Elite: Man-Eating Furball to deal <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>.<br>Af