ce Break: 100)","806.25% ATK/MATK +75 (Resilience Break: 100)","862.49% ATK/MATK +75 (Resilience Break: 100)","1031.25% ATK/MATK +75 (Resilience Break: 100)","1087.5% ATK/MATK +75 (Resilience Break: 100)","1143.75% ATK/MATK +75 (Resilience Break: 100)"]],["Shield",["10% Max HP","12% Max HP","14% Max HP","16% Max HP","18% Max HP","20% Max HP"]],["Duration",["15s","15s","15s","15s","15s","15s"]],["CD",["120s","120s","120s","100s","100s","80s"]]],"skillLabel":["Resonance Skill","Physical","Direct DMG","AoE","Shield"]},"3982":{"name":"Lucy","dialogue":"Celestial Spirit Mage!","activeSkillName":"Arcane! Celestial Spirit Mage","description":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Transform into </style>Celestial Spirit Mage - Lucy, replacing your skill set while gaining <linktext=1219><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Ability Conversion</style></linktext>.<br>Passive: Dealing damage converts <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> of the damage dealt into healing for up to <style=\"physical\">10</style> nearby allies (prioritizing teammates).<br>1. <style=\"accent-gn\">Fleuve d'Étoiles</style>: Manifests the Fleuve d'Étoiles and swings it continuously, dealing Light <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> to targets.<br>2. <style=\"accent-gn\">Celestial Guardian</style>: Harnesses the power of Celestial Spirits to grant a shield lasting <style=\"accent-gn\">20s</style> to up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> allies within range (prioritizing teammates). Simultaneously inflicts debuffs on up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> enemies within range, reducing ATK, applying Vulnerability, and reducing Element Resistance for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>.<br>3. <style=\"accent-gn\">Aqua Metria</style>: Draws upon the power of Aquarius to unleash waves forward, dealing Water <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> to targets in their path, with an additional <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> of the damage dealt converted into healing.","activeEffectParams":[["Transformation Cooldown",["20s","20s","20s","20s","20s","20s"