/linktext>. When Crit chance exceeds <style=\"accent-gn\">60%</style>, every extra <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> grants an additional <style=\"accent-gn\">0.88%</style> Crit DMG for skills that consume <linktext=1104><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunder Sigils</style></linktext>.","2200080":"Crit Rate obtained in any way is increased by <style=\"accent-gn\">12%</style>, but Luck chance obtained in any way are reduced by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>.","2200090":"Crit hits of <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attacks</style> grant <style=\"accent-gn\">100</style> <linktext=1167><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blade Intent</style></linktext>.","2200100":"Increases Max <linktext=1104><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunder Sigil</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>.","2200110":"Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">100</style> <linktext=1167><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blade Intent</style></linktext> to gain stacks of <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Reversal Mark</style>. When <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Reversal Mark</style> reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> stacks, casting <linktext=1500><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Iaido Slash</style></linktext> grants the <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Reversal</style> effect and removes all <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Reversal Mark</style> stacks. <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Reversal</style>: Gain a <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> Thunder DMG bonus for <style=\"accent-gn\">15</style>s.","2200120":"Each cast of <linktext=1501><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Flash Strike</style></linktext>, <linktext=1554><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Raijin Dash</style></linktext>, or its enhanced skills grants <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack of <style=\"accent-gn\">Thundrage</style>. When <style=\"accent-gn\">Thundrage</style> reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> stacks, <linktext=1500><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Iaido Slash</style></linktext> evolves into <linktext=1588><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunder Cut</style></linktext>. After casting <linktext=1588><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunder Cut</style></linktext>, <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> stacks of <style=\"accent-gn\">Thundrage</style> are consumed. <style=\"accent-gn\">Thundrage</style> stacks up to <style=\"accent-gn\">8</style> times.","2200130":"Lucky Strike ATK +<style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style>.","2200140":"When <linktext=1500><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Iaido Slash</style></linktext> and its enhanced skill (<linktext=1588><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunder Cut</style></linktext>) deal DMG, there is a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> chance to reset the remaining CD of <linktext=1501><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Flash Strike</style></linktext> and <linktext=1554><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Raijin Dash</style></linktext>. For <style=\"accent-gn\">each</style> <linktext=1104><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunder Sigil</style></linktext> consumed, the chance increases by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>. During <linktext=1504><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Volt Surge</style></linktext>, this chance is doubled.","2200150":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> casts of <linktext=1556><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Overdrive</style></linktext> allows the next <linktext=1500><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Iaido Slash</style></linktext> to generate a <linktext=1099><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Bladewind Domain</style></linktext> in front. Each time <linktext=1099><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Bladewind Domain</style></linktext> deals DMG, reduces the CD of <linktext=1502><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Oblivion Combo</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">1.5</style>s.","2200160":"<linktext=1101><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Moonblades</style></linktext> have a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">60%</style> chance to cast <linktext=1100><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunderstrike</style></linktext> on a Lucky Strike. <linktext=1100><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunderstrike</style></linktext> deals double DMG.","2200170":"Lucky Strikes of <linktext=1101><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Moonblades</style></linktext> grant a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> chance to restore <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <linktext=1104><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunder Sigil</style></linktext>, once per <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> seconds.","2200180":"For <style=\"accent-gn\">12</style> seconds after casting <linktext=1506><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Chaos Breaker</style></linktext>, whenever the Talents Raijin Dash Charge, Moonlight Charge, and Charge Catcher obtain a <linktext=1106><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Charge Seed</style></linktext>, <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> additional Charge Seed is granted.","2200200":"Increases Max <linktext=1101><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Moonblades</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>.","2200210":"Casting <linktext=1503><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thundercut</style></linktext> grants <style=\"accent-gn\">12</style> + Luck% x <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> points of <linktext=1167><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blade Intent</style></linktext>.","2200220":"For every <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> instances of damage dealt, triggers <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Power</style>. <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Power</style>: Thunder DMG +<style=\"accent-gn\">22</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style>s, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> stacks.","2200230":"<linktext=1167><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blade Intent</style></linktext> cap +<style=\"accent-gn\">25</style>. After <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> consecutive <linktext=1503><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thundercuts</style></linktext> in one go, it evolves into the more powerful <linktext=1098><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thundercleave</style></linktext>, which deals higher DMG.","2200240":"During <linktext=1505><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Stormflash</style></linktext>, doubles <linktext=1101><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Moonblades</style></linktext>' Attack SPD.","2200250":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attacks</style> inflict <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Curse</style> on the target upon dealing DMG. <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Curse</style>: Each stack of <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Curse</style> increases the target's DMG taken from you by <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style>s, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">4</style> times.","2200260":"Deals <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> more DMG to enemies with <style=\"accent-gn\">80%</style> HP or above.","2200280":"Defeating an enemy triggers <linktext=1103><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunderburst</style></linktext>, once every <style=\"accent-gn\">3s</style>.","2200300":"For <style=\"accent-gn\">each</style> enemy within <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style>m, you gain <style=\"accent-gn\">3%</style> Armor Penetration, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">15%</style>. This effect is doubled against Elite or stronger enemies.","2200310":"When <linktext=1104><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunder Sigils</style></linktext> are at <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> or higher, <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style> hits <style=\"accent-gn\">twice</style> times consecutively.","2200320":"Further enhances the ability to use <linktext=1500><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Iaido Slash</style></linktext>. When the number of <linktext=1104><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunder Sigils</style></linktext> consumed by <linktext=1500><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Iaido Slash</style></linktext> and its enhanced skill (<linktext=1588><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunder Cut</style></linktext>) equals the current maximum <linktext=1104><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunder Sigil</style></linktext> count, increases the DMG of <linktext=1500><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Iaido Slash</style></linktext> and its enhanced skill (<linktext=1588><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunder Cut</style></linktext>) by <style=\"accent-gn\">12%</style> and grants <linktext=1102><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Super Armor</style></linktext> during the cast. <i><style=\"text_third_gray\"><size=20>Consume as many Thunder Sigils as possible to deliver a powerful blow to the target with Iaido Slash. High Crit and Mastery allow Iaido Slash to deal greater DMG and more hits. Under certain conditions, Iaido Slash no longer needs to be channeled.</size></style></i>","2200330":"Casting <linktext=1503><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thundercut</style></linktext> guarantees <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> <linktext=1106><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Charge Seed</style></linktext>.","2200340":"Triggers Sharp Strike when casting <linktext=1500><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Iaido Slash</style></linktext> and its enhanced skill (<linktext=1588><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunder Cut</style></linktext>). Sharp Strike: Increases Crit Rate of <linktext=1501><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Flash Strike</style></linktext> and its enhanced skill (<linktext=1584><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Dracoflash</style></linktext>) by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>. If <linktext=1501><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Flash Strike</style></linktext> and its enhanced skill (<linktext=1584><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Dracoflash</style></linktext>) deals Crit DMG <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> time, gains <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <linktext=1104><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunder Sigil</style></linktext>. This effect is removed after the use of <linktext=1501><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Flash Strike</style></linktext> and its enhanced skill (<linktext=1584><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Dracoflash</style></linktext>) or after <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>.","2200350":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Each</style> additional <linktext=1104><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunder Sigil</style></linktext> consumed by a skill increases its DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">3%</style>.","2200360":"The final strike of <linktext=1502><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Oblivion Combo</style></linktext> is empowered into <linktext=1105><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Ultimate Slash</style></linktext>.","2200370":"Each <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Haste provides an additional <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Attack SPD.","2200380":"Increases Max <linktext=1104><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunder Sigil</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>.","2200390":"When <style=\"accent-gn\">Agility</style> reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">500</style> points, Crit DMG and Luck Damage +<style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style>.","2200400":"For each <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <linktext=1104><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunder Sigil</style></linktext> consumed by <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style>, gain an additional <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> points of <linktext=1167><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blade Intent</style></linktext>. For every consumption of Blade Intent, grants 20% DMG Reduction for 5s.","2200410":"For every <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> <linktext=1104><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunder Sigils</style></linktext> consumed, the remaining CD of <linktext=1504><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Volt Surge</style></linktext> -<style=\"accent-gn\">0.5s</style>.","2200420":"When consuming <linktext=1104><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunder Sigils</style></linktext>, there is a chance to return <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <linktext=1104><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunder Sigil</style></linktext>, and for each additional <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <linktext=1104><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunder Sigil</style></linktext> consumed, the return chance +<style=\"accent-gn\">9%</style>.","2200430":"Activate <linktext=1504><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Volt Surge</style></linktext>. <linktext=1501><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Flash Strike</style></linktext> and <linktext=1554><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Raijin Dash</style></linktext> evolve into <linktext=1584><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Dracoflash</style></linktext> and <linktext=1585><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Phantom Slash</style></linktext>.","2200440":"<linktext=1554><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Raijin Dash</style></linktext> and its enhanced skill (<linktext=1585><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Phantom Slash</style></linktext>) ignore the target's Armor. <linktext=1554><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Raijin Dash</style></linktext> and its enhanced skill (<linktext=1585><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Phantom Slash</style></linktext>) deal <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> more damage per additional <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> enemy hit.","2200450":"Increases the critical rate of <linktext=1500><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Iaido Slash</style></linktext> and <linktext=1588><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunder Cut</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">12%</style>.","2200460":"Crit Rate obtained in any way is increased by <style=\"accent-gn\">12%</style>, but Luck chance obtained in any way are reduced by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>.","2200470":"When <linktext=1167><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blade Intent</style></linktext> is at least <style=\"accent-gn\">100</style>, <linktext=1501><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Flash Strike</style></linktext>, <linktext=1554><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Raijin Dash</style></linktext>, and their enhanced skills (<linktext=1584><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Dracoflash</style></linktext>, <linktext=1585><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Phantom Slash</style></linktext>) +<style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> Crit and +<style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> Thunder DMG. When <linktext=1167><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blade Intent</style></linktext> is at least <style=\"accent-gn\">100</style>, greatly increases <linktext=1501><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Flash Strike</style></linktext>'s and <linktext=1554><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Raijin Dash</style></linktext>'s casting speed.","2200480":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Each</style> additional <linktext=1104><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunder Sigil</style></linktext> consumed by <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> or <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attacks</style> increases your Thunder DMG dealt by <style=\"accent-gn\">1.5%</style> when they deal DMG.","2200490":"Each use of <linktext=1584><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Dracoflash</style></linktext> or <linktext=1585><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Phantom Slash</style></linktext> grants <style=\"accent-gn\">4</style> stacks of <style=\"accent-gn\">Thundrage</style>, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">8</style> stacks.","2200500":"Reduces the CD of <linktext=1556><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Overdrive</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style>.","2200510":"When <linktext=1500><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Iaido Slash</style></linktext> deals Crit DMG, if the <linktext=1167><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blade Intent</style></linktext> exceeds <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style>, launches <linktext=1100><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunderstrike</style></linktext> (which can only be triggered once per use of <linktext=1500><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Iaido Slash</style></linktext>).","2200520":"Increases Max <linktext=1104><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunder Sigil</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>.","2200530":"When dealing Crit DMG, <linktext=1500><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Iaido Slash</style></linktext> and its enhanced skill (<linktext=1588><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunder Cut</style></linktext>) nullifies <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> of the targets' Armor.","2200540":"Crit DMG <style=\"accent-gn\">+10%</style>","2200550":"<linktext=1500><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Iaido Slash</style></linktext> reduces the Armor of the target hit by <style=\"accent-gn\">6%</style>. The effect lasts <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style> and stacks up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> times.","2200560":"Mastery <style=\"accent-gn\">+6%</style>","2200570":"Reduces the <linktext=1586><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Charge Seeds</style></linktext> that <linktext=1106><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Storm Scythe</style></linktext> consumes by <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style>.","2200580":"Each <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Haste increases the REG SPD of <linktext=1167><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blade Intent</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style>.","2200600":"Casting <linktext=1586><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Storm Scythe</style></linktext> <style=\"accent-gn\">7</style> times triggers <linktext=1587><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Divine Sickle</style></linktext>. <linktext=1587><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Divine Sickle</style></linktext> is guaranteed to Crit. When Luck is between <style=\"accent-gn\">28%</style> and <style=\"accent-gn\">45%</style>, <linktext=1587><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Divine Sickle</style></linktext>'s Final DMG increases by <style=\"accent-gn\">150%</style>, but requires <style=\"accent-gn\">14</style> casts of <linktext=1586><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Storm Scythe</style></linktext> to trigger. When Luck chance is above <style=\"accent-gn\">45%</style>, Final DMG increases by <style=\"accent-gn\">275%</style>, but requires <style=\"accent-gn\">21</style> casts of <linktext=1586><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Storm Scythe</style></linktext> to trigger.","2200610":"If Luck chance exceeds <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style>, <linktext=1101><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Moonblades</style></linktext> trigger a Lucky Strike to gain <linktext=1106><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Charge Seed</style></linktext>. Otherwise, when <linktext=1101><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Moonblades</style></linktext> deal DMG, it has a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style> chance to gain <linktext=1106><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Charge Seed</style></linktext>.","2200620":"Increases Max <linktext=1167><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blade Intent</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">75</style>.","2200630":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> times <linktext=1100><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunderstrike</style></linktext> is triggered, the CD of <linktext=1505><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Stormflash</style></linktext> is reduced by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.7s</style>.","2200640":"When <linktext=1505><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Stormflash</style></linktext> is activated, <linktext=1507><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Moonstrike</style></linktext> evolves into <linktext=1506><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Chaos Breaker</style></linktext>.","2200650":"Increases the DMG dealt by <linktext=1100><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunderstrike</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style>. Each <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Luck grants <linktext=1100><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunderstrike</style></linktext> <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> more DMG dealt.","2200660":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Each</style> enemy defeated grants <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <linktext=1106><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Charge Seed</style></linktext> (effective within a team).","2200670":"Increases the Thunder DMG <linktext=1100><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunderstrike</style></linktext> deals by <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>, yet <linktext=1100><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunderstrike</style></linktext> never deals Crit DMG.","2200680":"When <linktext=1167><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blade Intent</style></linktext> is at least <style=\"accent-gn\">50</style>, <linktext=1507><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Moonstrike</style></linktext> and its enhanced skill (<linktext=1506><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Chaos Breaker</style></linktext>) are guaranteed to land a Crit.","2200690":"Increases Max <linktext=1104><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunder Sigil</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>. During <linktext=1505><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Stormflash</style></linktext>, each trigger of <linktext=1586><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Storm Scythe</style></linktext> extends its duration by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5s</style>, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>.","2200700":"Doubles Max <linktext=1167><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blade Intent</style></linktext>.","2200710":"When <linktext=1503><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thundercut</style></linktext> triggers a Lucky Strike, grants <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <linktext=1106><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Charge Seed</style></linktext>.","2200720":"<linktext=1101><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Moonblades</style></linktext> additionally deal <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> instance of Whirling DMG every <style=\"accent-gn\">6s</style>. Each <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style> Haste reduces its CD by <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style>.","2200730":"During <linktext=1505><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Stormflash</style></linktext>, <linktext=1586><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Storm Scythe</style></linktext> will activate twice in succession.","2200740":"During <linktext=1504><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Volt Surge</style></linktext>, the return chance of Thunder Sigil Rewind doubles, but the damage bonus of <style=\"accent-gn\">non-derivative</style> skills that consume <linktext=1104><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thunder Sigil</style></linktext> is reduced from <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style> to <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style>.","2201010":"<linktext=1597><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Stone Fist</style></linktext> restores <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style> max HP. For every <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> extra enemy hit, restores an additional <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style> max HP (up to a total of <style=\"accent-gn\">15%</style>. Excess healing is converted into an equivalent Shield.","2201020":"For <style=\"accent-gn\">8</style>s after you cast <linktext=1536><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Cracking Echo</style></linktext>, each <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack</style> pulls a target between <style=\"accent-gn\">8</style> and <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style> meters away toward you. The same target cannot be pulled again within <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style>s.","2201030":"Increases Armor by <style=\"accent-gn\">7,000</style>. Every <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> points of <style=\"accent-gn\">Strength</style> provide <style=\"accent-gn\">3.6</style> Armor.","2201040":"You gain the <linktext=1122><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Suppress</style></linktext> Expertise effect.","2201050":"When dealing DMG, <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attacks</style> have a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> chance to trigger <linktext=1123><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Weakness Strike</style></linktext> once.","2201060":"<linktext=1123><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Weakness Strike</style></linktext>'s fixed trigger chance +<style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>.","2201080":"Successful <linktext=1170><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Block</style></linktext> restores <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> of your HP and <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Rage</style>. This can only occur once <style=\"accent-gn\">per</style> second. Triggering <linktext=1126><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Lucky Block</style></linktext> restores <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style> of your HP and <style=\"accent-gn\">4</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Rage</style>. This can only occur once <style=\"accent-gn\">per</style> second.","2201090":"A successful <linktext=1170><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Block</style></linktext> triggers a <linktext=1125><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Countercrush</style></linktext>, once <style=\"accent-gn\">per</style> second. On a <linktext=1126><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Lucky Block</style></linktext>, randomly triggers <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> to <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> <linktext=1125><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Countercrush</style></linktext>, once <style=\"accent-gn\">per</style> second.","2201140":"Increases Max HP by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>.","2201150":"During <linktext=1543><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Brave Bastion</style></linktext>, you can <linktext=1170><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Block</style> </linktext><style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style>.","2201160":"A successful hit with <linktext=1540><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Shield Bash</style></linktext> reduces the target's DMG dealt to you by <style=\"accent-gn\">3%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style>s, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> times.","2201170":"While shielded, use <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack</style> midair to slam down, detonating the shield and dealing damage equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> max HP to nearby enemies.","2201180":"Increases the effectiveness of Shield granted by <linktext=1540><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Shield Bash</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style>.","2201190":"During <linktext=1542><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Stoneform</style></linktext>, every <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Rage</style> gained triggers <linktext=1168><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sandy Shelter</style></linktext>.","2201200":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attacks</style> have a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style> chance to trigger <linktext=1127><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Shield Combo</style></linktext> upon dealing DMG. Each <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Mastery grants an extra <style=\"accent-gn\">0.2%</style> chance.","2201210":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Each</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Sand Crystal</style> consumed reduces the CD of <linktext=1542><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Stoneform</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>s.","2201220":"While shielded, <style=\"magic\">MATK Reduction</style> +<style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>. Each <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> of Mastery increases this effect by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5%</style>, up to a maximum of <style=\"accent-gn\">40%</style>.","2201240":"During <linktext=1541><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sandshroud</style></linktext>, adding a shield to yourself via <linktext=1540><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Shield Bash</style></linktext> triggers <linktext=1128><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Shield Echo</style></linktext>.","2201250":"When dealing DMG, <linktext=1539><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Granite Fury</style></linktext> has a <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> chance to allow your next <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack</style> to evolve into <linktext=1169><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rageblow</style></linktext>. Each <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style> Luck adds <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> chance. After casting <linktext=1169><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rageblow</style></linktext>, increases <linktext=1170><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Block</style></linktext> DMG Reduction by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>.","2201270":"When HP falls below <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style>, triggers <linktext=1129><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Survival Instinct</style></linktext>, once every <style=\"accent-gn\">60</style>s.","2201280":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Each</style> enemy within <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> meters increases your <linktext=1170><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Block</style></linktext> chance by <style=\"accent-gn\">3%</style>, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">15%</style>. (Doubles the effect against Elite or stronger enemies.) Remains unchanged when Earthfort Spec is active. If <style=\"accent-gn\">Block Spec</style> is activated, the effect becomes: <style=\"accent-gn\">Every</style> enemy within <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> meters increases <linktext=1170><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Block</style></linktext> DMG Reduction by <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style>, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style>. (Doubles the effect against Elite or stronger enemies.)","2201290":"When <linktext=1135><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Enraged</style></linktext>, you gain <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> bonus Armor, decreasing by <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style> per second.","2201300":"Each enemy within <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> meters enhances the effectiveness of <linktext=1122><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Suppress</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">3%</style>, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">15%</style>. This effect is doubled against Elite or stronger enemies.","2201310":"Consuming <style=\"accent-gn\">Rage</style> has a chance to enter <linktext=1135><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Enraged</style></linktext> state for <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>. The more <style=\"accent-gn\">Rage</style> you consume, the higher the chance. <style=\"accent-gn\">Each</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Rage</style> increases the chance by <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style>.","2201330":"Further enhances the ability to use <linktext=1540><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Shield Bash</style></linktext>. <style=\"accent-gn\">Each</style> additional enemy hit increases the damage dealt by <linktext=1540><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Shield Bash</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style>, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">150%</style>. When attacked, increases All-Element Resistance by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.6%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">4s</style>, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> times. Each <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Mastery increases this effect by <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style>. <i><style=\"text_third_gray\"><size=20>Maintain shield uptime whenever possible. Besides reducing incoming damage, the shield also applies certain effects when active.</size></style></i>","2201340":"<linktext=1536><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Cracking Echo</style></linktext> generates a <linktext=1137><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sandfield</style></linktext> that lasts for <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style>s.","2201350":"When <linktext=1169><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rageblow</style></linktext> deals DMG, it reduces the CD of <linktext=1543><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Brave Bastion</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style>s. Casting <linktext=1543><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Brave Bastion</style></linktext> immediately restores <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> Max HP. Any excess healing is converted into a shield that lasts 10s.","2201360":"During <linktext=1543><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Brave Bastion</style></linktext>, casting <linktext=1538><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Countercrush</style></linktext> or <linktext=1539><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Granite Fury</style></linktext> triggers <linktext=1136><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sand Crystal Shock</style></linktext>.","2201370":"A successful <linktext=1170><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Block</style></linktext> grants a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> chance for your next <linktext=1539><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Granite Fury</style></linktext> cast to consume no <style=\"accent-gn\">Sand Crystals</style>. This effect can occur up to once every <style=\"accent-gn\">3s</style>.","2201380":"While <linktext=1135><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Enraged</style></linktext>, Max HP +<style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style>.","2201390":"While <linktext=1135><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Enraged</style></linktext>, <linktext=1122><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Suppress</style></linktext> effect +<style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>.","2201400":"When <style=\"accent-gn\">Strength</style> reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">500</style>, extends the duration of <linktext=1135><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Enraged</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> second.","2201410":"For each <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Sand Crystal</style> consumed, restore <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> of Max HP.","2201420":"While <linktext=1135><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Enraged</style></linktext>, Attack Speed +<style=\"accent-gn\">8%</style>.","2201430":"The charge count of <linktext=1544><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rage Burst</style></linktext> +<style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>. While <linktext=1135><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Enraged</style></linktext>, <linktext=1544><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rage Burst</style></linktext> and <linktext=1134><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Terra Sunder</style></linktext> become instant cast.","2201440":"Increases <linktext=1537><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Star Shatter</style></linktext> and <linktext=1594><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Starfall</style></linktext> DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style>, and guarantees <linktext=1135><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Enraged</style></linktext> status.","2201450":"Throughout the duration of <linktext=1541><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sandshroud</style></linktext>, being attacked reduces the attack speed of enemy targets within a <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> meter radius by <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">3s</style>. throughout the duration of <linktext=1541><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sandshroud</style></linktext>, Armor of allies within an <style=\"accent-gn\">8</style> meter radius +<style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>.","2201460":"Upon the triggering of <linktext=1123><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Weakness Strike</style></linktext>, gains <linktext=1124><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Amplified Earthfort</style></linktext>.","2201470":"During <linktext=1542><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Stoneform</style></linktext>, reduces all DMG taken by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>.","2201480":"Enhances Shield effectiveness by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>. During <linktext=1541><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sandshroud</style></linktext>, additionally enhances Shield effectiveness by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>.","2201490":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Each</style> successful hit of <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> or <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style> increases <style=\"accent-gn\">Strength</style> by <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> in <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>. The effect stacks up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> times. With <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> stacks, increases <style=\"accent-gn\">Strength</style> by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">8s</style>. During this effect, the next <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> heals you for <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> of the DMG dealt, yet no additional <style=\"accent-gn\">Strength</style> stacks can be gained.","2201500":"For every <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Sand Crystals</style> consumed, <linktext=1537><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Star Shatter</style></linktext> evolves into <linktext=1594><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Starfall</style></linktext>.","2201510":"Casting <linktext=1594><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Starfall</style></linktext> grants <style=\"accent-gn\">Rock Master</style>. <style=\"accent-gn\">Rock Master</style>: For <style=\"accent-gn\">15s</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack</style> evolves into <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <linktext=1595><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rupture</style></linktext>, and <linktext=1544><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rage Burst</style></linktext> evolves into <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <linktext=1134><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Terra Sunder</style></linktext>. When <style=\"accent-gn\">Rock Master</style> activates, grants <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> Rock Bonus for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>.","2201520":"When <linktext=1537><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Star Shatter</style></linktext> or <linktext=1594><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Starfall</style></linktext> defeats a target, <linktext=1537><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Star Shatter </style></linktext>immediately recovers <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> charge.","2201530":"While <linktext=1135><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Enraged</style></linktext>, <linktext=1595><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rupture</style></linktext> is bound to trigger <linktext=1123><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Weakness Strike</style></linktext>.","2201540":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">50</style> times damage is taken, the next <linktext=1540><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Shield Bash</style></linktext> deals additional fixed damage equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> HP + <style=\"accent-gn\">300%</style> of current shield amount (shield amount cannot exceed <style=\"accent-gn\">150%</style> Max HP). Can trigger at most once every <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style>s. Every <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style> of Mastery reduces the required times of damage taken by <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>. Every <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> of Versatility reduces the trigger interval by <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> (up to <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>).","2201550":"Casting <linktext=1542><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Stoneform​</style></linktext> grants <style=\"accent-gn\">Rock Master</style>: For <style=\"accent-gn\">15s</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack</style> evolves into <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <linktext=1595><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rupture</style></linktext>, and <linktext=1544><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rage Burst</style></linktext> evolves into <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style><linktext=1134> <style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Terra Sunder</style></linktext>.","2201560":"While in combat, overhealing is converted into a shield (total shield cannot exceed <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> of Max HP).","2201570":"Armor +<style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style>. Each attack of <linktext=1134><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Terra Sunder</style></linktext> deals an additional instance of <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to the target, equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> Armor.","2201580":"When you take DMG, <linktext=1126><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Lucky Block</style></linktext> reduces DMG taken by <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style>, lasting for <style=\"accent-gn\">8</style>s, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> times.","2201590":"<linktext=1539><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Granite Fury</style></linktext> DMG enhances <linktext=1126><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Lucky Block</style></linktext> DMG Reduction by <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">8s</style>. Stacks up to <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> times.","2201600":"Successfully <linktext=1170><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blocking</style></linktext> has a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> chance to gain <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Sand Crystal</style>. If it was a <linktext=1126><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Lucky Block</style></linktext>, gain an additional <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Sand Crystal</style>.<linktext=1170><style=\"ItemQuality_5\"></style></linktext>","2201610":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> casts of <linktext=1539><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">​Granite Fury​</style></linktext> grant <style=\"accent-gn\">Rock Heart</style>. <style=\"accent-gn\">Rock Heart</style>: For <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>, <linktext=1539><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">​Granite Fury​</style></linktext> evolves into <linktext=1597><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Stone Fist</style></linktext>. When <style=\"accent-gn\">Rock Heart</style> activates, grants <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> Rock Bonus for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>. Casting <linktext=1597><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Stone Fist</style></linktext> guarantees <linktext=1135><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Enraged</style></linktext>.","2201620":"After casting <linktext=1597><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Stone Fist</style></linktext>, for the next <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>, summons <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <linktext=1131><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Granite</style></linktext> every <style=\"accent-gn\">2s</style>.","2201630":"For every <style=\"accent-gn\">50</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Rage</style> generated, summons <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <linktext=1131><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Granite</style></linktext>.","2201640":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">50</style> times damage is taken, the next <linktext=1539><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Granite Fury</style></linktext> deals additional fixed damage equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">7,000%</style> of Armor. Can trigger at most once every <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style>s. Every <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style> Mastery reduces the required times of damage taken by <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>. Every <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Luck reduces the trigger interval by <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> (up to <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>).","2201650":"While <linktext=1543><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Brave Bastion</style></linktext> is active, taking DMG doubles <linktext=1125><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Countercrush</style></linktext> DMG.","2201660":"<linktext=1539><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Granite Fury</style></linktext> consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Sand Crystal</style>.","2201670":"When <linktext=1131><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Granite</style></linktext> deals DMG, there is a chance, of which equals Luck Chance, to summon <style=\"accent-gn\">an additional</style> <linktext=1131><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Granite</style></linktext>.","2201680":"When <linktext=1131><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Granite</style></linktext> hits a target, it reduces all DMG taken by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> for the next <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>.","2201690":"Summoning <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style> <linktext=1131><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Granites</style></linktext> grants <style=\"accent-gn\">Rock Heart</style>: For <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>, <linktext=1539><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Granite Fury</style></linktext> evolves into <linktext=1597><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Stone Fist</style></linktext>.","2201700":"For <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style> after casting <linktext=1536><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Cracking Echo</style></linktext>, trigger <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <linktext=1125><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Countercrush</style></linktext> every <style=\"accent-gn\">2s</style>.","2201710":"Luck Chance +<style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style>. <linktext=1125><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Countercrush</style></linktext> Crit +<style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>.","2201720":"Mastery +<style=\"accent-gn\">6,250</style>. During <linktext=1543><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Brave Bastion</style></linktext>, Mastery +<style=\"accent-gn\">8%</style>.","2201730":"While <linktext=1135><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Enraged</style></linktext>, increases Luck Chance by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>.","2202020":"Increases <style=\"accent-gn\">Energy</style> REG SPD by <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style>.","2202030":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> points of <style=\"accent-gn\">Intellect</style> grants <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> MATK.","2202040":"Applies <linktext=1107><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Inspiration</style></linktext> to yourself and allies within <style=\"accent-gn\">30</style> meters.","2202050":"Casting a <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style> grants <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <linktext=1108><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Regen Bud</style></linktext>. Initial cap of <linktext=1108><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Regen Buds</style></linktext>: <style=\"accent-gn\">4</style>. When an <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> or <style=\"accent-gn\">Ultimate</style> generates healing, <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> <linktext=1108><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Regen Buds</style></linktext> are consumed to throw a <linktext=1115><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Nourishing Seed</style></linktext>, triggering up to once <style=\"accent-gn\">per</style> second. When an <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> or <style=\"accent-gn\">Ultimate</style> deals DMG, <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> <linktext=1108><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Regen Buds</style></linktext> are consumed to shoot a <linktext=1116><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wild Seed</style></linktext>, once <style=\"accent-gn\">per</style> second.","2202060":"Increases Max <linktext=1108><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Regen Bud</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">4</style>.","2202080":"When <linktext=1529><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Feral Seed</style></linktext> deals DMG, it increases <linktext=1530>ATK by <style=\"accent-gn\">Mastery % x Luck %</style></linktext> for the next <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style>s.","2202090":"When a <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style>, or <style=\"accent-gn\">Ultimate</style> generates Healing, there is a <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> to trigger <linktext=1109><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Healing Chain</style></linktext>. For every <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style> Luck, the chance +<style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style>.","2202100":"<linktext=1526><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wild Bloom</style></linktext> now holds up to <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> charges. <linktext=1526><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wild Bloom</style></linktext>'s <style=\"accent-gn\">Energy</style> cost -<style=\"accent-gn\">15%</style>.","2202110":"Further enhances the ability to use <linktext=1526><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wild Bloom</style></linktext>. <linktext=1526><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wild Bloom</style></linktext>, <linktext=1532><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Regen Pulse</style></linktext>, and <linktext=1535><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">​Nature Ward​</style></linktext> grant <style=\"accent-gn\">Symbiotic Mark</style> to allies. <style=\"accent-gn\">Symbiotic Mark</style>: Lasts for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>. All of the caster's DMG will heal allies with <style=\"accent-gn\">Symbiotic Mark</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">45%</style> of the DMG dealt. Increases the final DMG of Lucky Strikes by <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>. When overhealing a target with <style=\"accent-gn\">Symbiotic Mark</style>, if the overheal reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> of their Max HP, the excess healing is converted into a regeneration effect lasting for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>. This effect can trigger only once every <style=\"accent-gn\">30s</style>. <style=\"accent-gn\">Healing of Stillness</style>: If the caster deals no DMG to enemies for <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>, each hit of the caster's <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack</style> will heal up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> allies (party members prioritized), with the 4-hit combo restoring <style=\"accent-gn\">12.6%</style> Max HP in total. After using an Ultimate, Basic Attacks immediately start healing, but this effect is disabled upon dealing DMG to enemies. <i><style=\"text_third_gray\"><size=20>Capable of converting attacks into healing. Lucky Strikes from attacks trigger various healing effects, enhancing healing while increasing DMG dealt.</size></style></i>","2202120":"When <linktext=1526><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wild Bloom</style></linktext> heals a target, it also applies <linktext=1111><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Nature Shield</style></linktext> to them. Targets with <linktext=1111><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Nature Shield</style></linktext> restore HP when hit, with the amount equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> of your ATK. This effect can occur up to once <style=\"accent-gn\">per</style> second.","2202130":"After casting <linktext=1593><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Stag Charge</style></linktext>, the number of channels for the next <linktext=1530><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Infusion</style></linktext> +<style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style>.","2202140":"When <linktext=1526><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wild Bloom</style></linktext> deals DMG, reduces the remaining CD of <linktext=1530><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Infusion</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">1s</style>. If the DMG triggers a Lucky Strike, the remaining CD is reduced by <style=\"accent-gn\">3s</style>.","2202160":"While in battle state, standing still for <style=\"accent-gn\">2s</style> creates a <style=\"accent-gn\">Grass Domain</style>. <style=\"accent-gn\">Grass Domain</style>: While inside the <style=\"accent-gn\">Grass Domain</style>, your Haste +<style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>. Upon exiting the <style=\"accent-gn\">Grass Domain</style>, your Movement SPD +<style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5s</style>, and <style=\"accent-gn\">Grass Domain</style> disappears.","2202170":"Casting <linktext=1527><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Life Bloom</style></linktext> grants a <style=\"accent-gn\">40%</style> chance to reduce the remaining CD of <linktext=1533><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blossom Charge</style></linktext> and <linktext=1528><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Nourish</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style>s. Each <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> of Mastery increases this chance by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.4%</style>, up to a maximum of <style=\"accent-gn\">60%</style>. Casting <linktext=1527><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Life Bloom</style></linktext> grants a <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> chance to reduce the remaining CD of <linktext=1583><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Fast Growth</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.2</style>s, triggering at most once every <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style>s. Each <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> of Haste increases the CD reduction by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.1</style>s, up to a maximum of <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5</style>s.","2202180":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> uses of <linktext=1527><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Life Bloom</style></linktext> enhances the next direct healing <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> by <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style>.","2202200":"<linktext=1527><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Life Bloom</style></linktext> has a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> chance to heal <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> additional time.","2202210":"Healing <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise</style> generate <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> more healing, but healing from <linktext=1527><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Life Bloom</style></linktext> -<style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>.","2202220":"Increases the Healing of <linktext=1109><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Healing Chain</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>. For every <style=\"accent-gn\">7%</style> Mastery, <linktext=1109><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Healing Chain</style></linktext> jumps <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> additional time. <linktext=1109><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Healing Chain</style></linktext> restores <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> of an ally's Max HP with each tick.","2202230":"When <linktext=1527><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Life Bloom</style></linktext> generates healing, <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> chance to apply <linktext=1528><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Nourish</style></linktext>.","2202240":"When casting <linktext=1533><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blossom Charge</style></linktext>, <linktext=1534><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Grove Wish</style></linktext>, or <linktext=1532><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Regen Pulse</style></linktext>, <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> chance that the next cast of <linktext=1527><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Life Bloom</style></linktext> within <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style>s consumes no <style=\"accent-gn\">Energy</style>.","2202250":"After triggering a total of <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> <linktext=1115><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Nourishing Seeds</style></linktext> or <linktext=1116><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wild Seeds</style></linktext>, <linktext=1526><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wild Bloom</style></linktext> evolves into <linktext=1593><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Stag Charge</style></linktext>. Casting <linktext=1593><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Stag Charge</style></linktext> instants grants <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> <linktext=1108><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Regen Buds</style></linktext>.","2202260":"When an ally within <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style> meters takes DMG exceeding <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> of their HP, <style=\"accent-gn\">Revival</style> triggers, which can affect the same target up to once every <style=\"accent-gn\">45s</style>. <style=\"accent-gn\">Revival</style>: Restores HP equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> of the DMG taken over <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style>s.","2202270":"When healing an ally with lower than <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> HP, <style=\"accent-gn\">Natural Bloom</style> triggers, instantly restoring HP equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">200%</style> ATK to them. This effect can occur up to once every <style=\"accent-gn\">30s</style>.","2202280":"When an enemy within <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> meters that you are engaged with is defeated (effective within a team), generates a <linktext=1110><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Healing Pulse</style></linktext>. This can only occur once every <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>.","2202290":"When an enemy within <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> meters that you are engaged with is defeated (effective within a team), generates a <linktext=1113><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Healing Orb</style></linktext>. This can only occur once every <style=\"accent-gn\">2s</style>.","2202300":"When an enemy within <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> meters that you are engaged with is defeated (effective within a team), generates an <linktext=1114><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Engram Orb</style></linktext>, which grants <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <linktext=1108><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Regen Bud</style></linktext> upon pickup.","2202310":"<linktext=1107><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Inspiration</style></linktext> provides the target with an additional <style=\"accent-gn\">400</style> Armor.","2202320":"When <linktext=1530><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Infusion</style></linktext>, <linktext=1529><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Feral Seed</style></linktext>, or <linktext=1526><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wild Bloom</style></linktext> deals DMG, <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> chance to reduce the CD of the <style=\"accent-gn\">Ultimate</style> by <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>s, once <style=\"accent-gn\">per</style> second.","2202330":"When <linktext=1116><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wild Seed</style></linktext> deals DMG or <linktext=1115><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Nourishing Seed</style></linktext> generates healing, you gain a <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> Forest DMG bonus for the next <style=\"accent-gn\">8</style>s.","2202350":"Replace <style=\"accent-gn\">Ultimate</style> and <linktext=1531><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Divine Circle Bloom</style></linktext> with <linktext=1551><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Vital Surge</style></linktext>.","2202360":"When <linktext=1116><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wild Seed</style></linktext> hits a target, it inflicts <linktext=1117><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thorn</style></linktext> on them. Forest DMG dealt by players to targets with <linktext=1117><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thorn</style></linktext> +<style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style>.","2202380":"When HP of an ally with <linktext=1107><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Inspiration</style></linktext> drops below <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Blessing</style> triggers. <style=\"accent-gn\">Blessing</style>: Grants a <linktext=1111><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Nature Shield</style></linktext> and reduces the DMG taken by <style=\"accent-gn\">35%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">8s</style>, once every <style=\"accent-gn\">60s</style>.","2202390":"Replace <style=\"accent-gn\">Ultimate</style>, <linktext=1531><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Divine Circle Bloom</style></linktext> with <linktext=1552><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Bloomheal</style></linktext>.","2202400":"When a DMG-type <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> triggers Lucky Strike, next <linktext=1116><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wild Seed</style></linktext> launches <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> more projectile. For every <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> <linktext=1115><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Nourishing Seeds</style></linktext> thrown, next <linktext=1115><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Nourishing Seed</style></linktext> throws <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> more projectile.","2202410":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style> haste provides <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">energy</style> natural recovery efficiency.","2202420":"When dealing damage with <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attacks</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> chance to gain <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <linktext=1108><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Regen Bud</style></linktext>.","2202430":"When <style=\"accent-gn\">Intellect</style> reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">500</style>, versatility +<style=\"accent-gn\">4%</style>.","2202440":"Within <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style> after Casting <linktext=1530><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Infusion</style></linktext>, the damage absorption of the <linktext=1111><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Nature Shield</style></linktext> added by <linktext=1526><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wild Bloom</style></linktext> or <linktext=1535><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Nature Ward</style></linktext> is doubled.","2202450":"If equipped with <linktext=1532><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Regen Pulse</style></linktext> skill, <linktext=1535><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Nature Ward</style></linktext> and <style=\"accent-gn\">Ultimates</style> will trigger <linktext=1532><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Regen Pulse</style></linktext> when their CDs are completed.","2202460":"When active <style=\"accent-gn\">Symbiotic Marks</style> reach <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> or more, <linktext=1529><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">​Feral Seed​</style></linktext> and <linktext=1116><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wild Seed</style></linktext> DMG increases by <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style>.","2202470":"The charge count of <linktext=1535><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Nature Ward</style></linktext> +<style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>. The charge time of <linktext=1535><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Nature Ward</style></linktext> decreases by <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>.","2202480":"Successful hit of <linktext=1529><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Feral Seed</style></linktext> on the targets with <linktext=1117><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thorn</style></linktext> spreads <linktext=1117><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thorn</style></linktext> to other units within <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> meters. Attacking Elite or stronger targets grants <style=\"accent-gn\">8%</style> Forest Bonus.","2202490":"<linktext=1530><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Infusion</style></linktext> and <linktext=1593><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Stag Charge</style></linktext> deal <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> more Final DMG to <linktext=1117><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thorned</style></linktext> targets (each <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> of Mastery grants an additional <style=\"accent-gn\">4%</style>), but the healing conversion of <linktext=1530><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Infusion</style></linktext> and <linktext=1593><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Stag Charge</style></linktext> is halved.","2202500":"When <linktext=1532><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Regen Pulse</style></linktext> is actively used, it spreads <style=\"accent-gn\">twice</style>.","2202510":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Each</style> use or trigger of <linktext=1532><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Regen Pulse</style></linktext>, reduces the CD of <linktext=1535><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Nature Ward</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">2s</style>.","2202520":"<linktext=1532><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Regen Pulse</style></linktext> returns to your position after it reaches the max distance. <linktext=1532><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Regen Pulse</style></linktext> now deals DMG to enemies.","2202530":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Each</style> <linktext=1108><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Regen Bud</style></linktext> gained, reduces the CD of <linktext=1529><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Feral Seed</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> second.","2202540":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Symbiotic Mark</style> increases converted healing by <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style>. Each <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style> Mastery grants an additional <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style>. <style=\"accent-gn\">Symbiotic Mark</style> also grants <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style> Max HP for <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style>s (duration cannot be refreshed when reapplied).","2202550":"Each <linktext=1116><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wild Seed</style></linktext> fired extends the duration of activated <style=\"accent-gn\">Symbiotic Mark</style> by <style=\"accent-gn\">1s</style>.","2202560":"When dealing DMG, <linktext=1530><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Infusion</style></linktext> grants <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack of <style=\"accent-gn\">Pulse Echo</style>. <style=\"accent-gn\">Pulse Echo</style>: Increases DMG dealt of <linktext=1532><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Regen Pulse</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style>, which lasts <style=\"accent-gn\">12s</style> and stacks up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> times.","2202570":"Lucky Strike DMG Multiplier +<style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style>. Every <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Luck grants <style=\"accent-gn\">1.5%</style> Lucky Strike DMG Multiplier.","2202580":"For every <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style> stacks of <style=\"accent-gn\">Pulse Echo</style> gained, the next actively cast <linktext=1532><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Regen Pulse</style></linktext> triggers a <linktext=1533><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blossom Charge</style></linktext> at both the nearest enemy and the Ally with lowest HP.","2202590":"When <linktext=1526><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wild Bloom</style></linktext> or <linktext=1532><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Regen Pulse</style></linktext> deal DMG, grants a chance (equal to the <style=\"accent-gn\">half</style> percentage of Luck) to gain <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <linktext=1108><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Regen Bud</style></linktext>. If the target is affected by <linktext=1117><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Thorn</style></linktext>, doubles the chance.","2202600":"If you're affected with <linktext=1528><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Nourish</style></linktext>, reduces all DMG taken by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>. If the targets are affected by <linktext=1528><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Nourish</style></linktext>, enhances their Healing Received from yourself by <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style>. If the stack of <linktext=1528><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Nourish</style></linktext> is above or equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style>, additionally enhances Healing Received by <style=\"accent-gn\">3%</style>.","2202610":"Doubles the effectiveness of <linktext=1107><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Inspiration</style></linktext>.","2202620":"Using <linktext=1533><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blossom Charge</style></linktext> enhances the next <linktext=1527><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Life Bloom</style></linktext>, skipping the cast and increasing the Healing by <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>.","2202630":"<linktext=1528><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Nourish</style></linktext> can stack up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> times. Each use of <linktext=1527><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Life Bloom</style></linktext> grants the targets with <linktext=1528><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Nourish</style></linktext> <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack of <linktext=1528><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Nourish</style></linktext>.","2202640":"When holding <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> or more <linktext=1108><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Regen Buds</style></linktext>, casting <linktext=1533><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blossom Charge</style></linktext> for damage or healing always triggers a corresponding seed (without costing <linktext=1108><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Regen Buds</style></linktext>) and grants <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <linktext=1108><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Regen Bud</style></linktext>.","2202650":"Casting <linktext=1527><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Life Bloom</style></linktext> increases <linktext=1527><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Life Bloom</style></linktext>'s healing by <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> and its <style=\"accent-gn\">Energy</style> consumed by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">4s</style>. This effect can stack up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> times.","2202660":"During <linktext=1583><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Fast Growth</style></linktext>, increases <style=\"accent-gn\">Energy</style> REG SPD by <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>. Increases <linktext=1534><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Grove Wish</style></linktext>'s Crit by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>","2202670":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">60</style> self-heals from <linktext=1528><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Nourish</style></linktext> grants <linktext=1195><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Transcendence</style></linktext>.","2202680":"Within <style=\"accent-gn\">Grass Domain</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Flower Stalk</style> appeared <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> earlier.","2202690":"Consumes <linktext=1121><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Moonlight Solace</style></linktext> to launch <style=\"accent-gn\">Flower Dance - Tricolor Revelation</style>. <style=\"accent-gn\">Flower Dance - Tricolor Revelation</style>: Grants all effects of <style=\"accent-gn\">Flower Stalks</style>, once every <style=\"accent-gn\">60s</style>.","2202700":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">45s</style>, generates <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Flower Stalk</style> in the following order: <linktext=1119><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Crimson Insight</style></linktext>, <linktext=1120><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Golden Devotion</style></linktext>, and <linktext=1121><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Moonlight Solace</style></linktext>.","2202710":"When a <style=\"accent-gn\">Flower Stalk</style> appears, grants <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <linktext=1108><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Regen Bud</style></linktext> every <style=\"accent-gn\">2s</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>.","2202720":"<linktext=1107><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Inspiration</style></linktext> grants <style=\"accent-gn\">135</style> bonus <style=\"accent-gn\">Intellect</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Strength</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Agility</style>, and <style=\"accent-gn\">Endurance</style>.","2202730":"Increases Max <style=\"accent-gn\">Energy</style> by <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style>. Using <linktext=1533><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blossom Charge</style></linktext> restores <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> lost <style=\"accent-gn\">Energy</style>.","2202740":"Healing <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> restore <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style> more HP to the targets with HP below <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>.","2202750":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> uses of <linktext=1527><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Life Bloom</style></linktext> accelerates the using of <linktext=1534><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Grove Wish</style></linktext> or <linktext=1532><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Regen Pulse</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> and increases their Healing by <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> in <style=\"accent-gn\">15s</style>.","2203010":"Increases Max <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style> by <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style>, extending the duration of <linktext=1138><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Photon Reforge</style></linktext>. Unaffected when Wildpack Spec is active. If Falconry Spec is activated, the effect becomes: Max <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style> -<style=\"accent-gn\">20</style> but <linktext=1138><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Photon Reforge</style></linktext> state can be entered more quickly.","2203020":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> points of <style=\"accent-gn\">Agility</style> provide <style=\"accent-gn\">7</style> points of Haste.","2203030":"Dealing DMG grants a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> chance to apply <style=\"accent-gn\">Vulnerability</style> to the enemy. <style=\"accent-gn\">Vulnerability</style>: Increases the DMG you deal to the target by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>.","2203040":"Tames a <style=\"accent-gn\">Wild Wolf</style> to fight alongside you. <linktext=1601><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Storm Arrow</style></linktext> has a <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> fixed chance to trigger <style=\"accent-gn\">Coordinated Attack</style>. <style=\"accent-gn\">Wild Wolf</style> A <style=\"accent-gn\">Wild Wolf</style> fights alongside you. <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack</style>: Sweeps the enemy, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">60%</style> ATK (which scales with the Level/Tier of your <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack</style>). <style=\"accent-gn\">Coordinated Attack</style>: <style=\"accent-gn\">Wild Wolf</style> leaps to the enemy and bites, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> ATK (which scales with the Level/Tier of your <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack</style>).","2203050":"For every <style=\"accent-gn\">15</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attacks</style> cast, <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style> granted by the next cast of <linktext=1550><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Arrow Rain</style></linktext> +<style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style>.","2203060":"While <linktext=1549><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wildcall</style></linktext> is active, the <style=\"accent-gn\">Wild Wolf</style> is bound to deal Crit DMG on hit.","2203070":"When the <style=\"accent-gn\">Wild Wolf</style> deals Crit DMG, you and your Beast gain <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style> Haste for <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style>s. This effect stacks up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> times. When Haste exceeds <style=\"accent-gn\">35%</style>, every extra <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> of Haste grants <style=\"accent-gn\">0.2%</style> ATK.","2203080":"While in <linktext=1138><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Photon Reforge</style></linktext>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style> drain per second is reduced from <style=\"accent-gn\">25</style> to <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style>, allowing the effect to last longer. Unaffected when Wildpack Spec is active. If Falconry Spec is activated, the effect becomes: <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style> regeneration is increased from <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> to <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> points per second, reducing the time required to enter <linktext=1138><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Photon Reforge</style></linktext>.","2203090":"When <style=\"accent-gn\">Wild Wolf</style> launches a <style=\"accent-gn\">Coordinated Attack</style>, or <linktext=1139><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Tail Sweep</style></linktext>, there is a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> chance to summon a <style=\"accent-gn\">Phantom Direwolf</style> using <linktext=1140><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Pounce and Bite</style></linktext> to attack the current enemy. <linktext=1140><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Pounce and Bite</style></linktext> inflicts <linktext=1141><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Bleed</style></linktext>, and if the target is already suffered from <linktext=1141><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Bleed</style></linktext>, <linktext=1140><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Pounce and Bite</style></linktext> deals Crit DMG.","2203100":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Wild Wolf</style>'s <style=\"accent-gn\">Coordinated Attack</style> has a <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> fixed chance to inflict <linktext=1141><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Bleed</style></linktext>.","2203110":"When <linktext=1601><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Storm Arrow</style></linktext> deals DMG in battle, it has a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> chance to summon a <style=\"accent-gn\">Wild Wolf</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">8</style>s. This effect can occur once every <style=\"accent-gn\">40s</style>.","2203120":"While <linktext=1138><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Photon Reforge</style></linktext> is active, all of the <style=\"accent-gn\">Wild Wolf</style>'s attacks nullify the target's Armor.","2203130":"<linktext=1546><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Luminary Bolt</style></linktext> additionally causes a <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon</style> Explosion, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">1,500%</style> ATK (which scales with the Level/Tier of Ultimate), and also knocks targets airborne and increases the DMG you deal to them by <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>.","2203140":"While <linktext=1138><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Photon Reforge</style></linktext> is active, for <style=\"accent-gn\">each</style> beast on the battlefield, <linktext=1601><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Storm Arrow</style></linktext> fires <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> extra <linktext=1142><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Lightseeker Arrow</style></linktext> (up to <style=\"accent-gn\">4</style> arrows).","2203150":"Extends the duration of <linktext=1555><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Focus</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style>s.","2203160":"Applies <style=\"accent-gn\">Swift</style> to the <style=\"accent-gn\">Falcon</style> when casting <linktext=1143><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Lightning Strike</style></linktext>. <style=\"accent-gn\">Swiftness</style>: Increases Attack SPD by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>. This effect lasts <style=\"accent-gn\">8</style>s and stacks up to <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> times.","2203170":"Reduces Max <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style> by <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style>.","2203180":"For every <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> instances of Crit DMG dealt by <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attacks</style>, the <style=\"accent-gn\">Falcon</style> instantly launches <linktext=1143><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Lightning Strike</style></linktext>.","2203190":"When the <style=\"accent-gn\">Falcon</style> strikes, grants you a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> chance to gain 1 stack of <style=\"accent-gn\">Weak Point Aim</style>. Using <linktext=1557><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Quadraflare</style></linktext> leaves behind a <style=\"accent-gn\">Radiance Rift</style> midair. <style=\"accent-gn\">Radiance Rift</style> fires <linktext=1188><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Photon Arrows</style></linktext> equal to the current number of <style=\"accent-gn\">Weak Point Aim</style> stacks.","2203200":"Increases the Crit of <linktext=1547><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Double Arrow</style></linktext> and <linktext=1557><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Quadraflare</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">7%</style>.","2203210":"The <style=\"accent-gn\">Falcon</style> ignores <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> of the target's Armor.","2203220":"Each <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> critical rate increases Crit DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5%</style>. When <linktext=1547><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Double Arrow</style></linktext> or <linktext=1557><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Quadraflare</style></linktext> deals Crit DMG, <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style> is restored.","2203230":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Every</style> target hit grants <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Light DMG bonus. The bonus lasts <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style>s and can layerup to <style=\"accent-gn\">4</style> times.","2203240":"Companions deal <style=\"accent-gn\">15%</style> more DMG to Elites or stronger enemies.","2203250":"When <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attacks</style> deal DMG, there is a <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style> fixed chance to instantly grant <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style> 1 charge, up to the maximum charge limit.","2203260":"Further enhances <linktext=1601><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Storm Arrow</style></linktext> and the <style=\"accent-gn\">Wild Wolf</style>'s power. <linktext=1601><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Storm Arrow</style></linktext> always deals <style=\"accent-gn\">200%</style> Crit DMG on critical hits. While <linktext=1138><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Photon Reforge</style></linktext> is active, the chance for the <style=\"accent-gn\">Wild Wolf</style> to trigger <style=\"accent-gn\">Coordinated Attack</style> is increased to <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style>. <i><style=\"text_third_gray\"><size=20>The Wild Wolf becomes empowered, and Haste allows both you and the wolf to attack more frequently.</size></style></i>","2203270":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attacks</style> have a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> chance to fire one arrow at each of up to <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> enemies near the target.","2203280":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attacks</style> have a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">15%</style> chance to trigger <linktext=1151><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Split Arrow</style></linktext>, once <style=\"accent-gn\">per</style> second.","2203300":"After you use <linktext=1550><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Arrow Rain</style></linktext>, the <style=\"accent-gn\">Wild Wolf</style> continuously performs <linktext=1139><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Tail Sweep</style></linktext> until the <linktext=1550><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Arrow Rain</style></linktext> ends. <style=\"accent-gn\">Wild Wolf</style>'s <linktext=1139><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Tail Sweep</style></linktext> is bound to deal Crit DMG and to inflict <linktext=1141><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Bleed</style></linktext>.","2203310":"When a <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack</style> or <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style> deals DMG, it has a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> chance to fire an <linktext=1144><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Explosive Arrow</style></linktext>, once every <style=\"accent-gn\">3s</style>.","2203320":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style> Haste provides an additional <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> attack speed.","2203330":"Companion's damage +<style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>.","2203340":"When <style=\"accent-gn\">Agility</style> reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">500</style> points, attack speed +<style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style>.","2203350":"Attack speed +<style=\"accent-gn\">3%</style>.","2203360":"In the state of <linktext=1138><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Photon Reforge</style></linktext>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Wolf</style> Crit DMG +<style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>.","2203370":"Increases Light Bonus by <style=\"accent-gn\">3%</style>. For <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style> after casting <linktext=1580><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Torrent Volley</style></linktext> or its enhanced form <linktext=1602><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Lumi Torrent</style></linktext>, increases Light Bonus by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>.","2203380":"Each time you summon <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Wolf</style> or <style=\"accent-gn\">Phantom Wolf</style>, the remaining CD of <linktext=1550><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Arrow Rain</style></linktext> -<style=\"accent-gn\">0.5s</style>.","2203390":"For each additional <linktext=1141><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Bleed</style></linktext> effect on the target, <style=\"accent-gn\">Wolf</style> deals +<style=\"accent-gn\">3%</style> damage to it.","2203400":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Wild Wolf</style>'s <style=\"accent-gn\">Coordinated Attack</style> or <style=\"accent-gn\">Tail Sweep</style> deals damage (triggers only once even when hitting multiple targets) and reduces the remaining CD of <linktext=1601><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Storm Arrow</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>s.","2203410":"<linktext=1142><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Lightseeker Arrow</style></linktext> has a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> chance to apply <linktext=1141><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Bleed</style></linktext> to the target.","2203420":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Wild Wolf</style> evolves into its <style=\"accent-gn\">Adult Form</style>, increases DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style>, DMG Range by <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>.","2203430":"Casting <linktext=1549><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wildcall</style></linktext> summons a Legendary Companion based on current <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style>: If <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style> is below <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>, summons <linktext=1146><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Legendary Eagle</style></linktext>. If <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style> reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> or more, summons <linktext=1147><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Legendary Boar</style></linktext>. <linktext=1549><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wildcall</style></linktext> now holds up to <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> charges.","2203440":"While in <linktext=1138><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Photon Reforge</style></linktext> state, <linktext=1580><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Torrent Volley</style></linktext> continuously charges. After <style=\"accent-gn\">30s</style> of charging, <linktext=1580><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Torrent Volley</style></linktext> evolves into <linktext=1602><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Lumi Torrent</style></linktext>. Upon casting <linktext=1602><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Lumi Torrent</style></linktext>, immediately gain full <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style>.","2203450":"For <style=\"accent-gn\">each</style> <linktext=1142><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Lightseeker Arrow</style></linktext> fired, reduces the remaining CD of <linktext=1549><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wildcall</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.4</style>s (when Haste exceeds <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style>, each extra <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Haste reduces an additional <style=\"accent-gn\">0.005</style>s, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">0.8</style>s).","2203460":"Each <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Mastery grants <style=\"accent-gn\">6%</style> <linktext=1141><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Bleed</style></linktext> DMG.","2203470":"While <linktext=1138><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Photon Reforge</style></linktext> is active, reduces <linktext=1601><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Storm Arrow</style></linktext> CD by <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>.","2203480":"<linktext=1550><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Arrow Rain</style></linktext> and <linktext=1142><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Lightseeker Arrow</style></linktext> are bound to deal Crit DMG.","2203490":"Increases Max <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style> by <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style>.","2203500":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Wild Wolf</style> deals additionally <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> DMG to targets with current HP less than or equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">35%</style>.","2203510":"Casting <linktext=1549><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wildcall</style></linktext> again within <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style> of its initial cast commands all beasts on the field to immediately cast <linktext=1145><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Stomp</style></linktext>.","2203520":"When the caster and the <style=\"accent-gn\">Falcon</style> deal Crit DMG, inflicts <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack of <linktext=1148><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Steel Beak</style></linktext> to the target. Every <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> stacks of <linktext=1148><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Steel Beak</style></linktext> trigger <linktext=1143><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Lightning Strike</style></linktext>, up to once every <style=\"accent-gn\">3s</style>.","2203530":"Triggering <style=\"accent-gn\">Implosion</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> times summons a <linktext=1150><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Phantom Falcon</style></linktext> to charge at the target. For each additional target hit by the <linktext=1150><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Phantom Falcon</style></linktext>, its DMG increases by <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style>, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">200%</style>.","2203540":"Throughout the duration of <linktext=1555><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Focus</style></linktext>, gains <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5%</style> Crit and <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Crit DMG every <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5s</style>, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">15</style> times.","2203550":"When a <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style> deals Crit DMG, reduces the remaining CD of <linktext=1548><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blast Shot</style></linktext> and <linktext=1582><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Powerdraw</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> second.","2203560":"Increases the Crit DMG of <linktext=1547><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Double Arrow</style></linktext> and <linktext=1557><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Quadraflare</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">15%</style>.","2203570":"When <linktext=1581><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Radiance Barrage</style></linktext> hits a target, it applies <style=\"accent-gn\">Light Energy Stasis</style> to them. <style=\"accent-gn\">Light Energy Stasis</style>: movement speed -<style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style>. Being hit by <linktext=1582><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Powerdraw</style></linktext> is bound to deal Crit DMG. Lasts for <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>.","2203580":"The <style=\"accent-gn\">Falcon</style> ignores <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> of the target's Armor, and <style=\"accent-gn\">40%</style> when dealing Crit DMG.","2203590":"When <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style> is above <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>, casting <linktext=1581><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Radiance Barrage</style></linktext> counts as <linktext=1138><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Photon Reforge</style></linktext>.","2203600":"While <linktext=1555><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Focus</style></linktext> is active, <linktext=1581><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Radiance Barrage</style></linktext> summons <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <linktext=1149><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Celestial Eagle</style></linktext> at the target's location. Now, each <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> of Haste increases the CD Boost of Focus by <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style>.","2203610":"When an arrow fired from <style=\"accent-gn\">Radiance Rift</style> deals DMG for <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> time, increases the DMG of the next <linktext=1548><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blast Shot</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style>, up to a maximum of <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style>.","2203620":"When <linktext=1143><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Lightning Strike</style></linktext> hits a target, it triggers <style=\"accent-gn\">Light Prism</style>. <style=\"accent-gn\">Light Prism</style>: Deals area damage equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> ATK to up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> surrounding enemy targets, and additionally applies <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> stacks of <linktext=1148><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Steel Beak</style></linktext>.","2203630":"Increases <linktext=1143><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Lightning Strike</style></linktext> DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style>.","2203640":"<linktext=1582><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Powerdraw</style></linktext> CD -<style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>. When <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style> is above <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>, casting <linktext=1582><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Powerdraw</style></linktext> counts as <linktext=1138><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Photon Reforge</style></linktext>.","2203650":"When <linktext=1582><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Powerdraw</style></linktext> hits a target, it applies <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> stacks of <linktext=1148><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Steel Beak</style></linktext>. If it deals Crit DMG, it applies <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> stacks of <linktext=1148><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Steel Beak</style></linktext>.","2203660":"When <linktext=1149><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Celestial Eagle</style></linktext> hits a target, it prevents the target's <linktext=1148><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Steel Beak</style></linktext> from naturally decaying.","2203670":"<linktext=1548><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blast Shot</style></linktext> Upon detonation, inflicts <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> stacks of <linktext=1148><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Steel Beak</style></linktext> on all targets hit.","2204010":"Max <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Energy</style> +<style=\"accent-gn\">10</style>. <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style> DMG +<style=\"accent-gn\">12%</style>.","2204020":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> points of <style=\"accent-gn\">Intellect</style> grants <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> MATK.","2204030":"When a <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style> deals DMG, it has a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style> chance to <linktext=1171><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frozen</style></linktext> the target.","2204040":"Summons <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> permanent <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Crystal Cores</style> that float beside you. <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Crystal Core</style> When <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attacks</style> deal DMG, <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Crystal Cores</style> have a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> chance to fire <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Arrows</style>. <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Arrow</style>: Each arrow deals <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">28%</style> ATK to the target and grants <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <linktext=1161><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Crystal</style></linktext> (up to <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> <linktext=1161><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Crystals</style></linktext> can be stored).","2204050":"<linktext=1161><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Crystal</style></linktext> cap +<style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>.","2204060":"While casting <linktext=1509><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frostbeam</style></linktext>, you can channel <linktext=1508><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Tidepool</style></linktext> and <linktext=1558><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Maelstrom</style></linktext>.","2204070":"When <linktext=1509><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frostbeam</style></linktext> deals DMG, it has a <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> fixed chance to make <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Crystal Core</style> fire an <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Arrow</style>. Up to 1 <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Arrow</style> can be fired every <style=\"accent-gn\">0</style>.<style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>. <style=\"accent-gn\">The final DMG of the Ice Arrow</style> is doubled (this also affects DMG triggered by the Frost Explosion talent).","2204080":"When <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Arrows</style> fired by <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Crystal Cores</style> deal a Crit, they deal an additional instance of <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">28%</style> ATK. This DMG can trigger Lucky Strike.","2204090":"Max <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Energy</style> +<style=\"accent-gn\">40</style>.","2204100":"Increases <linktext=1558><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Maelstrom</style></linktext>'s <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Energy</style> recovery rate by <style=\"accent-gn\">200%</style>.","2204110":"When <linktext=1514><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frozen Gale</style></linktext> hits a target (only triggers once when hitting multiple targets), it consumes all <linktext=1161><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Crystals</style></linktext> to summon <linktext=1162><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Icy Bolt</style></linktext>, with the number of <linktext=1162><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Icy Bolt</style></linktext> equal to the consumed <linktext=1161><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Crystals</style></linktext>. <linktext=1162><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Icy Bolt</style></linktext> deals DMG, restores <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Energy</style>, and reduces the <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Energy</style> cost of skills by <style=\"accent-gn\">3%</style> for the next <style=\"accent-gn\">15s</style>, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">6</style> times.","2204130":"For every <style=\"accent-gn\">25</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Energy</style> consumed, the CD of <linktext=1510><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Crystal Veil</style></linktext> -<style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>s.","2204140":"When <linktext=1512><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Lance</style></linktext> that consumes <linktext=1161><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Crystals</style></linktext> deals DMG, there is a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">21%</style> chance to summon <linktext=1165><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Comet</style></linktext>.","2204150":"When <linktext=1512><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Lance</style></linktext> triggers both a Crit and a Lucky Strike, <linktext=1511><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Meteor Storm</style></linktext>'s CD is immediately reset. If <linktext=1511><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Meteor Storm</style></linktext> is already off cooldown, <linktext=1511><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">it</style></linktext> will be automatically cast (but this <linktext=1511><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Meteor Storm</style></linktext> will deal half damage). This effect can trigger up to 3 times within 1.5s (affected by Attack Speed).","2204160":"Within <style=\"accent-gn\">8s</style> after casting <linktext=1513><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blizzard</style></linktext>, <linktext=1512><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Lance</style></linktext> can fire an additional <linktext=1512><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Lance</style></linktext> at another target near the original one.","2204170":"When <linktext=1510><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Crystal Veil</style></linktext> deals DMG, it has a fixed chance to reduce the CD of <linktext=1513><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blizzard</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>s. The chance equals half percentage of your Luck.","2204180":"When <linktext=1511><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Meteor Storm</style></linktext> deals DMG, it causes <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Crystal Cores</style> to fire <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Arrows</style>. This effect can trigger up to once per <linktext=1511><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Meteor Storm</style></linktext> cast.","2204190":"Consuming <style=\"accent-gn\">15</style> <linktext=1161><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Crystals</style></linktext> enhances the next <linktext=1513><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blizzard</style></linktext>. <linktext=1513><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blizzard</style></linktext>: Bypasses the casting time and increases DMG dealt by <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style>, and trigger Lucky Strike.","2204200":"For every <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> casts of <linktext=1512><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Lance</style></linktext>, a <linktext=1164><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Piercing Ice Lance</style></linktext> is launched forward.","2204210":"Ice skills deal <style=\"accent-gn\">8%</style> more DMG to Elites and stronger targets.","2204220":"Dealing DMG triggers <style=\"accent-gn\">Trickle</style>. <style=\"accent-gn\">Trickle</style>: Grants a <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Ice damage bonus for <style=\"accent-gn\">6</style>s, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> times.","2204230":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">50</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Energy</style> consumed grants <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <linktext=1161><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Crystal</style></linktext>. Max <linktext=1161><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Crystal</style></linktext> +<style=\"accent-gn\">3</style>. Each possessed <linktext=1161><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Crystal</style></linktext> increases <linktext=1509><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frostbeam</style></linktext> DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style>.","2204240":"When an <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> or <style=\"accent-gn\">Ultimate</style> lands a Lucky Strike, it has a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> chance to trigger <linktext=1163><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Shock</style></linktext>, once every <style=\"accent-gn\">3s</style>.","2204250":"When an <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> or <style=\"accent-gn\">Ultimate</style> deals DMG to a target with <linktext=1171><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frozen</style></linktext>, it triggers <linktext=1163><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Shock</style></linktext>, once <style=\"accent-gn\">per</style> second.","2204260":"Each additional target hit by an <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> or <style=\"accent-gn\">Ultimate</style> grants a <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style> bonus to your highest stat among Mastery, Haste, Crit, or Luck for <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style>s. Hitting more than 5 additional targets still only counts as <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style>.","2204270":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">35</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Energy</style> consumed reduces the remaining CD of <linktext=1511><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Meteor Storm</style></linktext> and <linktext=1514><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frozen Gale</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">1.3s</style>.","2204280":"Max <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Energy</style> +<style=\"accent-gn\">25</style>. Every <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Haste increases <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Energy</style>'s auto REG SPD by <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style>.","2204290":"When <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Arrow</style> cast with <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Crystal Core</style> deals DMG, restores <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Energy</style>. In the <linktext=1515><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Permafrost</style></linktext> status, the recovery doubles.","2204300":"Further enhances <linktext=1512><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Lance</style></linktext>. When <linktext=1512><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Lance</style></linktext> deals Crit DMG, there is a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> chance for <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Crystal Cores</style> to fire <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Arrows</style>. <i><style=\"text_third_gray\"><size=20>Time your use of Ice Energy to chant and launch Frost Lance. Crit and Luck increase the chance to skip chanting and significantly boost the lance's DMG.</size></style></i>","2204310":"The area of <linktext=1516><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Glacier Hymn</style></linktext> -<style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>. While within the domain, you gain a <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style> Ice bonus.","2204320":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">50</style> hits by <linktext=1509><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frostbeam</style></linktext> trigger a <linktext=1166><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Cold Pulse</style></linktext>. For each additional enemy hit, increases <linktext=1166><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Cold Pulse</style></linktext> DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style>, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">500%</style>.","2204330":"When <style=\"accent-gn\">Intellect</style> reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">300</style>, skill CD -<style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>.","2204340":"Boost the highest stat among the following <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> stats: Crit, Haste, Luck, Mastery, and Versatility by <style=\"accent-gn\">3.5%</style> as a final value.","2204350":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Energy</style> cap +<style=\"accent-gn\">40</style>. <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style> damage +<style=\"accent-gn\">4%</style>.","2204360":"When <style=\"accent-gn\">Intellect</style> reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">500</style>, gain <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style> Ice bonus.","2204370":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style> <linktext=1161><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Crystals</style></linktext> consumed grants <style=\"accent-gn\">Endless Cold</style> effect. <style=\"accent-gn\">Endless Cold</style>: For <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>, increases <linktext=1511><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Meteor Storm</style></linktext> DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">150%</style>, and removes its CD and <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Energy</style> cost. During this period, <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Arrows</style> triggered by <linktext=1511><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Meteor Storm</style></linktext> cannot produce <linktext=1161><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Crystal</style></linktext>. When <style=\"accent-gn\">Endless Cold</style> is triggered during <linktext=1515><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Permafrost</style></linktext>, enter the <style=\"accent-gn\">Endless Cold</style> state after the effect of <linktext=1515><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Permafrost</style></linktext> ends. If the number of <linktext=1161><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Crystals</style></linktext> consumed during this period exceeds <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style>, proportionally increase the final damage dealt by <linktext=1511><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Meteor Storm</style></linktext> (up to <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style>).","2204380":"During <linktext=1512><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Permafrost</style></linktext>, <linktext=1515><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Lance</style></linktext> fires <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> consecutive shots.","2204390":"When <linktext=1511><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Meteor Storm</style></linktext> deals damage, <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> chance to apply <linktext=1171><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frozen</style></linktext> to the target. Throughout the duration of <linktext=1515><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Permafrost</style></linktext>, when <linktext=1512><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Lance</style></linktext> and <linktext=1511><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Meteor Storm</style></linktext> critically hit, extends the duration of <linktext=1515><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Permafrost</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5s</style>, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style> of extension.","2204400":"When consuming <linktext=1161><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Crystal</style></linktext> to cast <linktext=1512><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Lance</style></linktext>, refunds <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> of the <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Energy</style> consumed after the cast. When casting <linktext=1512><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Lance</style></linktext> without consuming <linktext=1161><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Crystal</style></linktext>, an additional <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> of the <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Energy</style> consumed is deducted after the cast.","2204410":"<linktext=1512><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Lances</style></linktext> that consume <linktext=1161><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Crystal</style></linktext> deal <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> more DMG.","2204420":"<linktext=1512><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Lance</style></linktext> deals <style=\"accent-gn\">70%</style> more DMG. <linktext=1512><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Lance</style></linktext> costs <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> more time to use.","2204430":"<linktext=1511><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Meteor Storm</style></linktext> hit count +<style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>. <linktext=1511><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Meteor Storm</style></linktext> gains <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> Ice Bonus.","2204440":"<linktext=1512><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Lance</style></linktext> deals <style=\"accent-gn\">1.5%</style> more Crit DMG. The effect lasts <style=\"accent-gn\">6s</style> and stacks up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> times.","2204450":"Increases Max <linktext=1161><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Crystal</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>. During <linktext=1515><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Permafrost</style></linktext>, Ice ATK increases by <style=\"accent-gn\">150</style>. When <linktext=1515><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Permafrost</style></linktext> ends, your <linktext=1161><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Crystal</style></linktext> resets to the amount you had before the activation of <linktext=1515><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Permafrost</style></linktext>.","2204460":"<linktext=1512><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Lance</style></linktext> deals <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> more DMG to targets with HP less than <style=\"accent-gn\">35%</style>","2204470":"During <linktext=1515><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Permafrost</style></linktext>, increases Crit DMG dealt by <style=\"accent-gn\">15%</style>. During <linktext=1515><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Permafrost</style></linktext>, increases allies' critical rate by <style=\"accent-gn\">3%</style>.","2204480":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">265</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Intellect</style> grants <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5%</style> bonus Crit DMG.","2204490":"Increases the critical rate of <linktext=1513><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blizzard</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</st