gy</style> is above <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>, deals <style=\"accent-gn\">8%</style> more Ice damage.","2204570":"When <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Energy</style> is below <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>, enhances the recovery rate of <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Energy</style> by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>.","2204580":"During <linktext=1515><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Permafrost</style></linktext>, <linktext=1509><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frostbeam</style></linktext> fires <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> additional <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Arrows</style> generated by <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Crystal Core</style>.","2204590":"During <linktext=1515><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Permafrost</style></linktext>, each <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Arrow</style> triggered by <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Crystal Core</style> extends the duration of <linktext=1515><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Permafrost</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5s</style>, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>.","2204600":"When dealing DMG, <linktext=1509><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frostbeam</style></linktext> has a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> chance to grant <linktext=1161><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Crystal</style></linktext>. If Max <linktext=1161><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Crystal</style></linktext> is reached, grants <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style> bonus Ice damage dealt instead for <style=\"accent-gn\">3s</style>.","2204610":"<linktext=1509><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frostbeam</style></linktext> deals <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style> more Ice damage. <linktext=1509><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frostbeam</style></linktext> deals <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style> more Ice damage to the main target.","2204620":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> hits of <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> allows <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Crystal Core</style> to fire <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Arrow</style> (triggers up to once every <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5</style>s).","2204630":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">50</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Intellect</style> grants <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> Max <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Energy</style>, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">100</style> from this source.","2204640":"Increases Haste by <style=\"accent-gn\">2500</style>. During <linktext=1515><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Permafrost</style></linktext>, Casting SPD increases by <style=\"accent-gn\">15%</style>.","2204650":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Arrows</style> from <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Crystal Core</style> are guaranteed to Crit. <style=\"accent-gn\">Increases the Crit DMG of Ice Arrows</style> from <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Crystal Core</style> by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>.","2204660":"When dealing DMG, <linktext=1509><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frostbeam</style></linktext> gains a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> chance to double <style=\"accent-gn\">Mastery</style> for 3s (which can only be triggers once on multiple hits).","2204670":"Max <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Energy</style> +<style=\"accent-gn\">40</style>.","2204680":"Increases <style=\"accent-gn\">Intellect</style> by <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style>.","2205010":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">50</style> points of <style=\"accent-gn\">Courage</style> consumed reduces the CD of <linktext=1523><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Spiral Thrust</style></linktext>, <linktext=1522><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Breach Pursuit</style></linktext>, and <linktext=1524><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Falcon Toss</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>s.","2205020":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">8</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Strength</style> grants <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> ATK.","2205030":"Dealing DMG grants a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> chance to apply <style=\"accent-gn\">Vulnerability</style> to the enemy. <style=\"accent-gn\">Vulnerability</style>: Increases the DMG you deal to the target by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>.","2205040":"Dealing DMG with <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attacks</style> grants <linktext=1152><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sharp</style></linktext>.","2205050":"<linktext=1152><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sharp</style></linktext> cap +<style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>.","2205060":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise</style> and <style=\"accent-gn\">Ultimates</style> deal <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> more DMG to targets inflicted with <linktext=1153><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rend</style></linktext>, and when hitting <linktext=1153><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rend</style></linktext> targets, deal <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> additional hit of <style=\"accent-gn\">75%</style> DMG.","2205070":"When <linktext=1517><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Gale Thrust</style></linktext> deals DMG, apply <linktext=1153><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rend</style></linktext> to targets.","2205080":"<linktext=1517><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Gale Thrust</style></linktext> is enhanced, increasing hit counts by <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style>. Reduces <linktext=1517><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Gale Thrust</style>'s </linktext><style=\"accent-gn\">Courage</style> consumption by <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style>.","2205090":"<linktext=1152><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sharp</style></linktext> cap +<style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>.","2205100":"When <linktext=1518><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Valor Cyclone</style></linktext> deals DMG, it has a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">7%</style> chance to evolve <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attacks</style> into <linktext=1592><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Swift Blade</style></linktext>.","2205110":"Additional <style=\"accent-gn\">Courage</style> recovery: Recovers <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> extra point of <style=\"accent-gn\">Courage</style> per second for every <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> stacks of <linktext=1152><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sharp</style></linktext>.","2205120":"During the casting of <linktext=1518><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Valor Cyclone</style></linktext>, for every <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style> points of <style=\"accent-gn\">Courage</style> consumed, increase the DMG of <linktext=1518><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Valor Cyclone</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">4%</style>, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style>.","2205130":"After every <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> casts of <linktext=1591><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Drake Cannon</style></linktext>, your <linktext=1523><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Spiral Thrust</style></linktext> evolves into <linktext=1590><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Vortex Strike</style></linktext>.","2205140":"While <linktext=1157><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Chasing Step</style></linktext> is active, <linktext=1519><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Instant Edge</style></linktext> and <linktext=1521><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sharp Impact</style></linktext> have their Crit Chance doubled. Additionally, for <linktext=1519><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Instant Edge</style></linktext> and <linktext=1521><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sharp Impact</style></linktext>, every <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> excess Crit is converted into <style=\"accent-gn\">3%</style> Crit DMG for the respective skill.","2205150":"When <linktext=1520><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Skyfall</style></linktext> lands a Lucky Strike, it triggers <linktext=1156><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Spear Thrust</style></linktext>, once every <style=\"accent-gn\">2s</style>. Dealing DMG with <linktext=1156><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Spear Thrust</style></linktext> restores <style=\"accent-gn\">8</style> points of <style=\"accent-gn\">Courage</style>. This effect triggers only once, even if multiple targets are hit.","2205160":"Casting <linktext=1521><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sharp Impact</style></linktext> grants <linktext=1187><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wind Fury</style></linktext>.","2205170":"<linktext=1152><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sharp</style></linktext> cap +<style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>.","2205180":"<linktext=1521><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sharp Impact</style></linktext> and its enhanced skill (<linktext=1159><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Typhoon: Sharp Impact</style></linktext>) increase the <style=\"accent-gn\">Courage</style> restored by the next <linktext=1553><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">​Galeform​</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>. Casting <linktext=1521><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sharp Impact</style></linktext> immediately grants <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> <linktext=1152><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sharp</style></linktext>, and casting its enhanced skill <linktext=1159><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Typhoon: Sharp Impact</style></linktext> immediately grants <style=\"accent-gn\">6</style> <linktext=1152><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sharp</style></linktext>.","2205190":"<linktext=1152><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sharp</style></linktext> cap +<style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>.","2205200":"During <linktext=1187><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wind Fury</style></linktext>, DMG dealt by <linktext=1519><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Instant Edge</style></linktext> and <linktext=1589><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Azure Sever</style></linktext> triggers <linktext=1158><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Tornado</style></linktext> (triggered at most once when hitting multiple targets).","2205210":"When <linktext=1520><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Skyfall</style></linktext> or <linktext=1524><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Falcon Toss</style></linktext> deals a Crit or Lucky Strike, they trigger <linktext=1157><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Chasing Step</style></linktext>. When <linktext=1520><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Skyfall</style></linktext> or <linktext=1524><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Falcon Toss</style></linktext> trigger a Crit and Lucky Strike simultaneously, they grant <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> stacks of <linktext=1157><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Chasing Step</style></linktext>.","2205220":"As the battle goes on, grants continuously increasing ATK. Every <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style>s, ATK +<style=\"accent-gn\">2.5%</style>, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>. Cleared after battle.","2205230":"Increases <linktext=1152><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sharp</style></linktext> effect by <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style>, and for <style=\"accent-gn\">each</style> enemy within <style=\"accent-gn\">12m</style>, additionally increases by <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style>, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">3%</style>.","2205240":"In combat, for every <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> enemy target defeated (party-wide effect), ATK +<style=\"accent-gn\">65</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">30</style>s, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">650</style>.","2205250":"When <linktext=1153><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rend</style></linktext> deals DMG, it has a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> chance to grant <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> points of <style=\"accent-gn\">Courage</style>.","2205260":"When <linktext=1553><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Galeform</style></linktext> ends, it applies the <linktext=1179><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Tempestrike</style></linktext>. Every <style=\"accent-gn\">50</style> points of <style=\"accent-gn\">Courage</style> or <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> points of <style=\"accent-gn\">Sharp</style> consumed during <linktext=1553><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Galeform</style></linktext> extends the duration of <linktext=1179><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Tempestrike</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>s.","2205270":"Consuming <style=\"accent-gn\">Courage</style> increases Haste by <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> and Speed by <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style>s, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> times.","2205280":"Increases Max <style=\"accent-gn\">Courage</style> by <style=\"accent-gn\">30</style>.","2205300":"Further enhances <linktext=1517><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Gale Thrust</style></linktext>. Casting <linktext=1517><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Gale Thrust</style></linktext> grants a <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> fixed chance to cause <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attacks</style> to evolve into <linktext=1592><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Swift Blade</style></linktext>, with an additional <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style> chance <style=\"accent-gn\">per</style> stack of <linktext=1152><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sharp</style></linktext>. <i><style=\"text_third_gray\"><size=20>Maximize Courage gain and expenditure to reduce the CD of Expertise skills. Haste increases Courage generation and the casting speed of core Expertise skills.</size></style></i>","2205320":"When <linktext=1524><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Falcon Toss</style></linktext> and its enhanced skill (<linktext=1589><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Azure Sever</style></linktext>), or <linktext=1519><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Instant Edge</style></linktext> hits <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> target, the DMG gains a <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> Wind bonus.","2205330":"Each <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Haste provides an additional <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Attack Speed.","2205340":"<linktext=1152><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sharp</style></linktext> cap +<style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>.","2205350":"When <style=\"accent-gn\">Strength</style> reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">300</style> points, <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> damage +<style=\"accent-gn\">7%</style>.","2205360":"When <style=\"accent-gn\">Strength</style> reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">500</style> points, the additional ATK from <linktext=1152><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sharp</style></linktext> increases to <style=\"accent-gn\">6%</style>.","2205370":"Within <style=\"accent-gn\">15s</style> after Casting the <style=\"accent-gn\">Ultimate</style>, Casting <linktext=1522><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Breach Pursuit</style></linktext> will not start CD. This effect is removed after the duration ends or after Casting <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> times <linktext=1522><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Breach Pursuit</style></linktext>.","2205380":"When <linktext=1517><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Gale Thrust</style></linktext> deals DMG, it has a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> chance to grant <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack of <style=\"accent-gn\">Wind Spiral</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style>s, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> times. <style=\"accent-gn\">Wind Spiral</style>: When casting <linktext=1523><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Spiral Thrust</style></linktext> or <linktext=1518><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Valor Cyclone</style></linktext>, it triggers a Spiral Explosion, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">Wind Spiral</style> stacks x <style=\"accent-gn\">200%</style> ATK to nearby enemies. Each <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> of Mastery increases this DMG multiplier by <style=\"accent-gn\">7%</style>, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">560%</style>. This DMG cannot Crit, and decreases by <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style> for each additional target hit, down to a minimum of <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style>. Triggering this clears all <style=\"accent-gn\">Wind Spiral</style> stacks.","2205390":"When <linktext=1152><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sharp</style></linktext> reaches full amount and the caster is in combat, enters <linktext=1155><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Vigor Spike</style></linktext> state, effective up to once every <style=\"accent-gn\">30s</style> (affected by CD Boost stats).","2205400":"After casting <linktext=1523><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Spiral Thrust</style></linktext> or <linktext=1522><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Breach Pursuit</style></linktext> or <linktext=1518><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Valor Cyclone</style></linktext>, the next <linktext=1517><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Gale Thrust</style></linktext> will not consume <style=\"accent-gn\">Courage</style>. This effect is removed after leaving combat.","2205410":"When <style=\"accent-gn\">Courage</style> is below or equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>, reduces the <style=\"accent-gn\">Energy</style> <linktext=1518><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Valor Cyclone</style></linktext> consumes by <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style>. When <style=\"accent-gn\">Courage</style> is above <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>, increases the DMG <linktext=1518><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Valor Cyclone</style></linktext> deals by <style=\"accent-gn\">12%</style>.","2205420":"Using <linktext=1592><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Swift Blade</style></linktext> grants it a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> chance to evolve <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack</style> into <linktext=1591><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Drake Cannon</style></linktext> in <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>. Each failure to evolve increases the chance by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> until success.","2205430":"When <linktext=1518><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Valor Cyclone</style></linktext> deals DMG, it has a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> chance to inflict <linktext=1154><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rupture</style></linktext>.","2205440":"<linktext=1523><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Spiral Thrust</style></linktext> and <linktext=1590><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Vortex Strike</style></linktext> deals <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> more DMG to the targets with <linktext=1153><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rend</style></linktext>.","2205450":"During <linktext=1518><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Valor Cyclone</style></linktext>, gains <linktext=1102><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Super Armor</style></linktext> and reduces DMG taken by <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style>. When <linktext=1518><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Valor Cyclone</style></linktext> deals DMG, restores HP equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> ATK.","2205460":"Each <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Haste accelerates the REG SPD of <style=\"accent-gn\">Courage</style> by <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style>.","2205470":"Skills that consume <style=\"accent-gn\">Courage</style> (<linktext=1523><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Spiral Thrust</style></linktext> and its enhanced skills, <linktext=1518><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Valor Cyclone</style></linktext>, <linktext=1524><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Falcon Toss</style></linktext> and its enhanced skills, <linktext=1517><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Gale Thrust</style></linktext>) gain <style=\"accent-gn\">6%</style> Wind Bonus.","2205480":"When <linktext=1518><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Valor Cyclone</style></linktext> deals DMG, increases <linktext=1591><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Drake Cannon</style></linktext> and <linktext=1590><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Vortex Strike</style></linktext> Crit Chance by <style=\"accent-gn\">7%</style>, and Crit DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style>. The effect lasts <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style> and stacks up to <style=\"accent-gn\">7</style> times.","2205490":"When <linktext=1518><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Valor Cyclone</style></linktext> deals DMG, reduces the CD of Ultimate by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5s</style> (which can only be triggers <style=\"accent-gn\">once</style> on multiple hits).","2205500":"Using <linktext=1590><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Vortex Strike</style></linktext>, increases Haste by <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>.","2205510":"The Crit chance of <linktext=1591><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">​Drake Cannon​</style></linktext> and <linktext=1590><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">​Vortex Strike​</style></linktext> is doubled. Increases the Crit DMG of <linktext=1591><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Drake Cannon</style></linktext> and <linktext=1590><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Vortex Strike</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">8%</style>. Each <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Haste grants <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5%</style> Crit DMG for <linktext=1591><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Drake Cannon​</style></linktext> and <linktext=1590><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">​Vortex Strike​</style></linktext>.","2205520":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">22</style> triggers of <linktext=1518><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Valor Cyclone</style></linktext> allows <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack</style> to evolve into <linktext=1591><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Drake Cannon</style></linktext> in <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>.","2205530":"Increases the charge of <linktext=1524><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Falcon Toss</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>. Reduces <style=\"accent-gn\">Courage</style> consumed by <linktext=1524><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Falcon Toss</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>.","2205540":"Enhances the effectiveness of <linktext=1187><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wind Fury</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>. When <linktext=1519><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Instant Edge</style></linktext> consumes <linktext=1157><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Chasing Step</style></linktext>, doubles the charge efficiency of <linktext=1521><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sharp Impact</style></linktext>.","2205550":"<linktext=1156><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Spear Thrust</style></linktext> reduces the CD of <linktext=1524><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Falcon Toss</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">2s</style> (which can only be triggers once on multiple hits).","2205560":"During <linktext=1187><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wind Fury</style></linktext>, <linktext=1524><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Falcon Toss</style></linktext> evolves into <linktext=1589><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Azure Sever</style></linktext> <style=\"accent-gn\">once</style>.","2205570":"<linktext=1152><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sharp</style></linktext> cap +<style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>.","2205580":"When dealing DMG, <linktext=1520><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Skyfall</style></linktext> gains a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">15%</style> chance to grant <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack of <linktext=1152><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sharp</style></linktext>.","2205590":"<linktext=1157><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Chasing Step</style></linktext> consumed increases <style=\"accent-gn\">Strength</style> by <style=\"accent-gn\">15%</style>. The effect lasts <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style> and stacks up to <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> times.","2205600":"During <linktext=1553><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Galeform</style></linktext>, increases the DMG dealt by <linktext=1519><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Instant Edge</style></linktext> and <linktext=1520><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Skyfall</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style>.","2205610":"<linktext=1521><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sharp Impact</style></linktext> is enhanced, evolving into <linktext=1159><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Typhoon: Sharp Impact</style></linktext>.","2205620":"<linktext=1519><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Instant Edge</style></linktext> consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> more <linktext=1152><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sharp</style></linktext>. Increases the DMG dealt by <linktext=1519><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Instant Edge</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">90%</style>.","2205630":"Increases the DMG dealt by <linktext=1158><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Tornado</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style>. Increases the DMG dealt by <linktext=1156><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Spear Thrust</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style>.","2205640":"When <linktext=1519><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Instant Edge</style></linktext> consumes <linktext=1157><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Chasing Step</style></linktext>, grants <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack of <linktext=1152><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sharp</style></linktext>.","2205650":"<linktext=1519><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Instant Edge</style></linktext> has a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style> chance to trigger one extra instance of DMG (if Lucky Strike chance exceeds <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style>, that becomes the new trigger chance). This extra DMG equals <linktext=1519><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Instant Edge</style></linktext> DMG x current Lucky Strike DMG multiplier%, and is affected by all relevant <linktext=1519><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Instant Edge</style></linktext> DMG bonuses.","2205660":"When dealing Crit DMG, <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> ignore the targets' <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> Armor.","2205670":"If <linktext=1152><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sharp</style></linktext> isn't at Max stacks, increases the DMG dealt by <linktext=1520><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Skyfall</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style>.","2205680":"For each <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack of <linktext=1152><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sharp</style></linktext> consumed, gains <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> points of <style=\"accent-gn\">Courage</style>. Increases Lucky Strike final DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>.","2206010":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Holy Sigil</style> consumed grants a <linktext=1172><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Radiant Shield</style></linktext> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">45%</style> ATK (depending on Adventurer Level, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">90%</style>).","2206020":"When casting a skill that consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style>, there is a <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> fixed chance for <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attacks</style> to evolve into <linktext=1598><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Condemn</style></linktext>.","2206030":"When using a Skill that consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">Holy Sigils</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> chance for your next <style=\"accent-gn\">Holy Sigil</style>-consuming skill to consume no <style=\"accent-gn\">Holy Sigils</style>. The effect lasts for <style=\"accent-gn\">8</style>s or until a <style=\"accent-gn\">Holy Sigil</style>-consuming skill is cast.","2206040":"Casting <linktext=1564><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Judgment</style></linktext> generates a <linktext=1560><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Divine Circle</style></linktext>, with a CD of <style=\"accent-gn\">30</style>s. <style=\"accent-gn\">Each</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Holy Sigil</style> consumed reduces the remaining CD by <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>s.","2206050":"For every <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style> consumed, gains <linktext=1172><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Radiant Shield</style></linktext> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">45%</style> ATK (this ratio is affected by Adventurer Level, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">90%</style>).","2206060":"Each <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Haste increases the recovery speed of <style=\"accent-gn\">Holy Sigil</style> by <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style>. Recovery time = Initial recovery time / (<style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> + recovery speed bonus).","2206070":"Increases Armor by <style=\"accent-gn\">7,000</style>. Every <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> points of <style=\"accent-gn\">Strength</style> provide <style=\"accent-gn\">3.6</style> Armor.","2206080":"While inside a <linktext=1560><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Divine Circle</style></linktext>, your <linktext=1598><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Condemn</style></linktext> is enhanced, thrusting a blade of light forward and dealing double DMG.","2206090":"Further enhances your ability to use <linktext=1561><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Valor Bash</style></linktext>. <linktext=1561><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Valor Bash</style></linktext> is accompanied by <linktext=1174><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Radiant Impact</style></linktext>. <i><style=\"text_third_gray\"><size=20>Try to maintain the Armor bonus from Valor Bash, and trigger Inferno Reckon through high Crits to gain more Photon Energy. Sufficient Photon Energy means continuous self-healing under the blessing of Judgment and Scorching Judgment.</size></style></i>","2206100":"When a skill that consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">Holy Sigil</style> critically hits, gain an additional <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style>. Crit DMG of skills that consume <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style> +<style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style>.","2206110":"When <linktext=1177><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Divine Strike</style></linktext> Crits, there's a <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> fixed chance to automatically cast <linktext=1564><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Judgment</style></linktext> on the target (this <linktext=1564><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Judgment</style></linktext> cannot trigger <linktext=1177><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Divine Strike</style></linktext>).","2206120":"While within the <linktext=1560><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Divine Circle</style></linktext>, the Armor effect provided by <linktext=1561><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Valor Bash</style></linktext> +<style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style>.","2206130":"Casting <linktext=1562><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Shield Toss</style></linktext> immediately grants a <linktext=1172><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Radiant Shield</style></linktext> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">55%</style> Armor (affected by Versatility and Element bonuses). The charge count of <linktext=1562><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Shield Toss</style></linktext> +<style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>.","2206140":"For every <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Holy Sigils</style> consumed, the remaining CD of <linktext=1565><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Aegis Ward</style></linktext> -<style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> second.","2206150":"Each time <linktext=1562><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Shield Toss</style></linktext> deals DMG, gain a <linktext=1172><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Radiant Shield</style></linktext> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">13.75%</style> Armor (affected by Versatility and Element bonuses).","2206160":"During <linktext=1565><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Aegis Ward</style></linktext>, <linktext=1170><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Block</style></linktext> chance is increased to <style=\"accent-gn\">1.5</style> times. When attacked, reduces <linktext=1565><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Aegis Ward</style></linktext>'s remaining CD by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5s</style>. This effect can only trigger once <style=\"accent-gn\">per</style> second.","2206170":"After every <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> casts of <linktext=1564><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Judgment</style></linktext>, the next <linktext=1564><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Judgment</style></linktext> is enhanced into <style=\"accent-gn\">Scorching Judgment</style>. <style=\"accent-gn\">Scorching Judgment</style>: Summon a holy greatsword to descend upon the target area for <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>, healing yourself (Healing equal to that of <linktext=1564><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Judgment</style></linktext>) while dealing damage over time to nearby enemies and inflicting <style=\"accent-gn\">Scorch</style>, totally dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">600%</style> ATK (scales with <linktext=1564><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Judgment</style></linktext> level/rank). <style=\"accent-gn\">Scorch</style>: Reduces damage taken from the target by <style=\"accent-gn\">3%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>. Stacks up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> times. Grants <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> stacks of <style=\"accent-gn\">Scorch</style> on Crit.","2206180":"Using <style=\"accent-gn\">Ultimate Skill</style> creates a <style=\"accent-gn\">Holy Barrier</style>, shielding nearby allies from DMG. The <style=\"accent-gn\">Holy Barrier</style> lasts for <style=\"accent-gn\">15s</style> or until it absorbs Total DMG equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">150%</style> Max HP +<style=\"accent-gn\">3000%</style> Armor.","2206200":"<linktext=1175><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Lightforged Barrier</style></linktext> cap +<style=\"accent-gn\">2</style>.","2206210":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style> cap +<style=\"accent-gn\">20</style>. When you have at least <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> stacks of <linktext=1175><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Lightforged Barrier</style></linktext>, <linktext=1564><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Judgment</style></linktext> consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> less <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style>.","2206220":"The recovery rate of <style=\"accent-gn\">Holy Sigils</style> from Haste +<style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style>.","2206230":"Each time <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack of <linktext=1175><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Lightforged Barrier</style></linktext> is consumed or deducted, <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> chance to obtain <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Holy Sigil</style>.","2206240":"When <linktext=1559><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sacred Blade</style></linktext> hits an enemy target, it applies a <linktext=1199><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Holy Mark</style></linktext> to the target. <linktext=1566><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Vanguard Strike</style></linktext> can spread this <linktext=1199><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Holy Mark</style></linktext> to hit enemy targets.","2206250":"When <linktext=1175><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Lightforged Barrier</style></linktext> has <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> or fewer stacks, taking DMG no longer reduces its stacks. When <linktext=1175><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Lightforged Barrier</style></linktext> has more than <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> stacks, taking DMG has a <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> fixed chance not to reduce its stacks.","2206260":"When casting <linktext=1568><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Radiance</style></linktext>, it automatically releases <linktext=1564><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Judgment</style></linktext> to up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> nearby enemy targets.","2206270":"During <linktext=1567><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Zeal Crusade</style></linktext>, <style=\"accent-gn\">each</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Holy Sigil</style> consumed grants <linktext=1567><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Zeal Crusade</style></linktext> <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack of charge. When the charge reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> stacks, <linktext=1567><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Zeal Crusade</style></linktext> bursts outward, dealing DMG equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">6%</style> max HP.","2206280":"For <style=\"accent-gn\">each</style> enemy inside <linktext=1560><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Divine Circle</style></linktext>, increases <linktext=1560><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Divine Circle</style></linktext> DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style> and <linktext=1560><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Divine Circle</style></linktext> Healing by <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style> (caps at <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> enemies).","2206290":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">50</style> times damage is taken, the next <linktext=1564><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Judgment</style></linktext> deals additional fixed damage equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">200%</style> Max HP. Can trigger at most once every <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style>s. Every <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style> of Mastery reduces the required times of damage taken by <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>. Every <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> of Haste reduces the trigger interval by <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> (up to <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>).","2206300":"While within the <linktext=1560><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Divine Circle</style></linktext>, your Healing Received +<style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>.","2206310":"When your HP percentage is higher than your target's, DMG taken from that target -<style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style>. When your HP percentage is lower than your target's, <linktext=1564><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Judgment</style></linktext> deals <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> more DMG.","2206320":"Throughout the duration of <linktext=1172><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Radiant Shield</style></linktext>, <linktext=1170><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Block</style></linktext> chance +<style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>.","2206330":"After casting an <style=\"accent-gn\">Ultimate</style>, all allies' Max HP is increased by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style> (this effect does not stack).","2206340":"When <style=\"accent-gn\">Strength</style> reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">500</style> points, Max HP +<style=\"accent-gn\">12%</style>.","2206350":"When <linktext=1598><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Condemn</style></linktext> deals damage, it immediately cools down <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Holy Sigil</style> (prioritizing the <style=\"accent-gn\">Holy Sigil</style> with the longest remaining CD).","2206360":"When a <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> critically heals, gain a <style=\"accent-gn\">15%</style> healing bonus.","2206370":"Hold <linktext=1561><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Valor Bash</style></linktext> to charge, then dash forward a short distance.","2206380":"Each time <linktext=1600><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Inferno Reckon</style></linktext> or <linktext=1563><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Reckoning</style></linktext> deals Crit DMG to <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> enemy target, <linktext=1170><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Block</style></linktext> chance +<style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style>, lasting for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> times.","2206390":"During <linktext=1565><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Aegis Ward</style></linktext>, when an <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> deals Crit DMG, there's a <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> fixed chance to instantly reset <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Holy Sigil</style> CD (prioritizing <style=\"accent-gn\">Holy Sigil</style> with the longest remaining CD). This effect triggers only once when multiple targets are hit.","2206400":"When <linktext=1562><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Shield Toss</style></linktext> or <linktext=1564><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Judgment</style></linktext> deals DMG, <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> chance to trigger <linktext=1177><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Divine Strike</style></linktext>. If Crit DMG is dealt, the chance increases to <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>.","2206410":"While <linktext=1565><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Aegis Ward</style></linktext> is active, the chance of <linktext=1177><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Divine Strike</style></linktext> is doubled. Every <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> times <linktext=1177><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Divine Strike</style></linktext> is triggered, the duration of <linktext=1565><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Aegis Ward</style></linktext> is extended by <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> second.","2206420":"When <linktext=1561><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Valor Bash</style></linktext> deals Crit DMG, gain <style=\"accent-gn\">Blazing</style>. Casting <linktext=1565><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Aegis Ward</style></linktext> guarantees <style=\"accent-gn\">Blazing</style>. <style=\"accent-gn\">Scorching Heat</style>: For the next <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>, <linktext=1563><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Reckoning</style></linktext> evolves into <linktext=1600><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Inferno Reckon</style></linktext>.","2206430":"While having <linktext=1172><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Radiant Shield</style></linktext>, gains <style=\"accent-gn\">12%</style> healing bonus.","2206440":"While having <linktext=1172><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Radiant Shield</style></linktext>, gain <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style> Light bonus.","2206450":"For <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style> after casting <linktext=1562><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Shield Toss</style></linktext>, increases <linktext=1170><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Block Chance</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">15%</style>.","2206460":"<linktext=1561><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Valor Bash</style></linktext> heals for <style=\"accent-gn\">120%</style> ATK when it deals DMG, and increases DMG dealt by <style=\"accent-gn\">8%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">8s</style>.","2206470":"Increases <linktext=1564><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Judgment</style></linktext> Healing by <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style>.","2206480":"When <linktext=1177><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Divine Strike</style></linktext> deals DMG, increases <style=\"accent-gn\">Strength</style> by <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> times.","2206490":"While <linktext=1565><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Aegis Ward</style></linktext> is active, each <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Mastery grants <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5%</style> MATK Reduction, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style>.","2206500":"Increases <linktext=1567><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Zeal Crusade</style></linktext> DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>.","2206510":"Increases critical rate by <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style>.","2206520":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style> and damaging <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise</style> are enhanced based on missing HP. For every <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> HP lost, increases their DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style>.","2206530":"Increases <linktext=1567><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Zeal Crusade</style></linktext> range by <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style>. While <linktext=1567><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Zeal Crusade</style></linktext> is active, the effect of <style=\"accent-gn\">Bold Fearless</style> is doubled.","2206540":"When <linktext=1559><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sacred Blade</style></linktext> or <linktext=1564><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Judgment</style></linktext> deals DMG, there is a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style> chance to cause <linktext=1566><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Vanguard Strike</style></linktext> to evolve into <linktext=1176><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Vanguard Hunt</style></linktext>. <linktext=1176><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Vanguard Hunt</style></linktext>: Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">240%</style> ATK to the target, restores <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style> of your max HP, and gains <style=\"accent-gn\">Bold Fearless</style>. <style=\"accent-gn\">Bold Fearless</style>: Increases Haste by <style=\"accent-gn\">3%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> times.","2206550":"<linktext=1176><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Vanguard Hunt</style></linktext> can grant <linktext=1198><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Radiant Core</style></linktext>. Gaining <linktext=1198><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Radiant Core</style></linktext> again reduces its burst time by <style=\"accent-gn\">2s</style>.","2206560":"While <linktext=1567><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Zeal Crusade</style></linktext> is active, <linktext=1566><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Vanguard Strike</style></linktext> evolves into <linktext=1176><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Vanguard Hunt</style></linktext>.","2206570":"After <linktext=1198><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Radiant Core</style></linktext> explosion, <linktext=1559><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sacred Blade</style></linktext> DMG +<style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">20s</style>. Holds up to <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> charges, casting <linktext=1559><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sacred Blade</style></linktext> consumes one charge.","2206580":"For every <style=\"accent-gn\">15</style> points of <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style> consumed, the remaining CD of <linktext=1567><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Zeal Crusade</style></linktext> -<style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> second.","2206590":"When <linktext=1564><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Judgment</style></linktext> deals DMG, the target takes double DMG from <linktext=1199><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Holy Mark</style></linktext> for the next <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>.","2206600":"When in the <linktext=1560><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Divine Circle</style></linktext>, reduces all DMG taken by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>. For <style=\"accent-gn\">each</style> enemy within <style=\"accent-gn\">10m</style>, ATK Reduction increases by <style=\"accent-gn\">1.5%</style> (up to <style=\"accent-gn\">9%</style>), and MATK Reduction increases by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.75%</style> (up to <style=\"accent-gn\">4.5%</style>).","2206610":"For each <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack of <linktext=1175><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Lightforged Barrier</style></linktext> you possess, <linktext=1564><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Judgment</style></linktext> gains <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style> healing bonus. When <linktext=1175><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Lightforged Barrier</style></linktext>≥<style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> stacks, DMG Reduction +<style=\"accent-gn\">8%</style>.","2206620":"DMG dealt by <linktext=1176><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Vanguard Hunt</style></linktext> and <linktext=1559><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sacred Blade</style></linktext> to targets with <linktext=1199><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Holy Mark</style></linktext> increases by <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style>.","2206630":"When your accumulated overhealing reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> of your Max HP, gains <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack of <linktext=1175><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Lightforged Barrier</style></linktext>.","2206640":"While having <linktext=1172><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Radiant Shield</style></linktext>, gains <style=\"accent-gn\">12%</style> healing bonus.","2206650":"While having <linktext=1172><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Radiant shield</style></linktext>, gain <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style> Light bonus.","2206660":"Each time <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack of <linktext=1175><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Lightforged Barrier</style></linktext> is consumed or deducted, reduces the remaining CD of <linktext=1568><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Radiance</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> second.","2206670":"<linktext=1560><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Divine Circle</style></linktext> now has a halo effect, <linktext=3005><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">stunning</style></linktext> enemy targets for <style=\"accent-gn\">3s</style> the first time it deals DMG.","2206680":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">50</style> times damage is taken, the next <linktext=1564><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Judgment</style></linktext> deals additional fixed damage equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">5000%</style> of Armor. Can trigger at most once every <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style>s. Every <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style> Mastery reduces the required times of damage taken by <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>. Every <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Crit reduces the trigger interval by <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> (up to <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>).","2207010":"When <linktext=1133><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Melody</style></linktext> is active, there is a <style=\"accent-gn\">15%</style> fixed chance per second to gain <style=\"accent-gn\">Passion Surge</style>. <style=\"accent-gn\">Passion Surge</style>: <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style> costs zero <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>. Removed after <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style> is cast.","2207020":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style> max limit +<style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>.","2207030":"When <linktext=1133><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Melody</style></linktext> is activated, the trigger chance for <style=\"accent-gn\">Passion Surge</style> +an extra <style=\"accent-gn\">3%</style> every <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> second (up to <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style>). <style=\"accent-gn\">Passion Surge</style>: <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style> costs zero <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>. Removed after <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style> is cast.","2207040":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> points of <style=\"accent-gn\">Intellect</style> grants <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> MATK.","2207050":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style> costs <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> less <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style>.","2207060":"<linktext=1133><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Melody</style></linktext> heals ally targets below <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> HP with <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> bonus effect.","2207070":"After using <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style>s, the next <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack</style> hit triggers <linktext=1190><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Flame Pillar Blast</style></linktext>.","2207080":"<linktext=1190><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Flame Pillar Blast</style></linktext> becomes a two-hit combo.","2207090":"While in <linktext=1603><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rhapsody of Flame</style></linktext>, increases all Luck Chance acquired by any means by <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> and increases DMG Reduction by <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style>. <style=\"accent-gn\">Healing of Stillness</style>: If you deal no DMG to enemies for <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>, each hit of your <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack</style> will heal up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> allies (party members prioritized), with the full 4-hit combo restoring <style=\"accent-gn\">15.75%</style> of their max HP in total. After casting an Ultimate, Basic Attacks immediately start healing, and <linktext=1615><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Fierce Strike</style></linktext> can trigger the 4th hit healing effect, but this is disabled upon dealing DMG to enemies. <i><style=\"text_third_gray\"><size=20>Maintaining Heroic Melody and Rhapsody of Flame is crucial. Heroic Melody enhances healing while consecutive Fierce Strikes accelerate Harmonic Anthem casting frequency.</size></style></i>","2207100":"Gains <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Soundwave Energy</style> whenever <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style>s or <linktext=1604><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Amplified Beat</style></linktext> trigger a Lucky Strike.","2207110":"<linktext=1603><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rhapsody of Flame</style></linktext> always appears in its most powerful form. While in <linktext=1603><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rhapsody of Flame</style></linktext>, ATK increases by <style=\"accent-gn\">Haste % x 0.6</style>.","2207120":"Increases Resilience Break Efficiency of self and Allies within <style=\"accent-gn\">30</style> meters by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>. This effect cannot stack. After activating <linktext=1614><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Heroic Melody</style></linktext>, you and Allies within <style=\"accent-gn\">30</style> meters have an resilience break efficiency +<style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> and deal <style=\"accent-gn\">15%</style> more DMG to Resilience Broken targets. This effect cannot stack.","2207130":"Gain <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Soundwave Energy</style> each time you deal DMG equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> times ATK. <style=\"accent-gn\">Soundwave Energy</style> stores up to <style=\"accent-gn\">50</style>. Skills consuming <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style> trigger <linktext=1191><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Scorching Impact</style></linktext> when dealing DMG, consuming all <style=\"accent-gn\">Soundwave Energy</style>. Each <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Soundwave Energy</style> increases <linktext=1191><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Scorching Impact</style></linktext> DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">16%</style>.","2207140":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack</style> deals an extra instance of DMG. For every <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Soundwave Energy</style> obtained, creates a <linktext=1192><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Note</style></linktext> for the ally with the lowest HP.","2207150":"Stores excess Healing (up to <style=\"accent-gn\">500%</style> of Max HP). After activating <linktext=1614><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Heroic Melody</style></linktext>, consumes stored Healing to recover allies' HP every <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> second, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">15%</style> of Max HP per second.","2207160":"During <linktext=1603><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rhapsody of Flame</style></linktext>, <linktext=1604><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Amplified Beat</style></linktext> gains <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> additional attack. <linktext=1604><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Amplified Beat</style></linktext>'s DMG -<style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style>.","2207170":"When <linktext=1605><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Harmonic Anthem</style></linktext> or <linktext=1615><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Fierce Strike</style></linktext> triggers a Lucky Strike, limited to a single activation when striking multiple targets, immediately resets <linktext=1603><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rhapsody of Flame</style></linktext>'s CD and allows <linktext=1603><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rhapsody of Flame</style></linktext> not to consume <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>, this effect is nullified upon casting <linktext=1603><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rhapsody of Flame</style></linktext>.","2207180":"Replaces <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style> with <linktext=1609><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Healing Beat</style></linktext>. While <linktext=1606><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Healing Melody</style></linktext> is active, reduces the remaining CD of <linktext=1607><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Fivefold Crescendo</style></linktext> and <linktext=1608><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Passion Burst</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> second <style=\"accent-gn\">per</style> second. <i><style=\"text_third_gray\"><size=20>Precisely placing the speaker ensures it echoes your Expertise whenever they are cast.</size></style></i>","2207190":"When <linktext=1609><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Healing Beat</style></linktext> or <linktext=1608><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Passion Burst</style></linktext> applies Crit Healing or deals Crit DMG (triggers only once when hitting multiple targets), gains <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style>.","2207200":"<linktext=1609><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Healing Beat</style></linktext> provides an additional equal Healing to targets under the influence of <linktext=1606><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Healing Melody</style></linktext>.","2207210":"Increases Crit Healing by <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style>.","2207220":"<linktext=1609><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Healing Beat</style></linktext> Crit Rate +<style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>. <linktext=1609><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Healing Beat</style> </linktext>Healing +<style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>.","2207230":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Crit Rate grants <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> trigger chance for <linktext=1193><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Encore Strings</style></linktext>.","2207240":"For each <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style> consumed, enhances <linktext=1608><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Passion Burst</style></linktext> to <linktext=1617><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Passion Fury</style></linktext> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>.","2207250":"While <linktext=1606><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Healing Melody</style></linktext> is active, grants allies appropriate buffs (<style=\"accent-gn\">Strength</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Intellect</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Agility</style>) equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">8%</style> of <style=\"accent-gn\">Intellect</style>. (Buffs from different Beat Performers cannot stack. Only one with the highest value applies.)","2207260":"For <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style></linktext> after using <linktext=1608><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Passion Burst</style></linktext> or its enhanced form (<linktext=1617><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Passion Fury</style>), doubles the buffs that <linktext=1606><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Healing Melody</style></linktext> provides to allies. While channeling <linktext=1617><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Passion Fury</style></linktext>, DMG Reduction +<style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>. The duration of the doubled stat buffs is refreshed and extended by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.4</style>s for every <style=\"accent-gn\">0.2</style>s channeled.","2207270":"Increases Fire Bonus by <style=\"accent-gn\">8%</style> when attacking Elite or higher targets.","2207280":"During <linktext=1610><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Center Stage</style></linktext>, triggering <linktext=1193><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Encore Strings</style></linktext> has a <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> fixed chance to grant <style=\"accent-gn\">Passion Surge</style>. <style=\"accent-gn\">Passion Surge</style>: <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style> costs zero <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>. Removed after <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style> is cast.","2207290":"Defeating an enemy has a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> chance to grant you <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style>.","2207300":"Replace <style=\"accent-gn\">Ultimate </style><linktext=1611><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rock the Stage</style></linktext> with <linktext=1612><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Infinite Rhapsody</style></linktext>.","2207310":"Replace <style=\"accent-gn\">Ultimate </style><linktext=1611><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rock the Stage</style></linktext> with <linktext=1613><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Concert Circuit</style></linktext>.","2207320":"When <linktext=1193><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Encore Strings</style></linktext> triggers, it activates a second time on the same target.","2207330":"When <style=\"accent-gn\">Intellect</style> reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">500</style>, the <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Energy</style> cap +<style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style>.","2207340":"Increases Max HP by <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> and activates <style=\"accent-gn\">Dissonance Spec</style> with its original effect intact. If Concerto Spec is activated, its effect is adjusted to replace <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack</style> with <linktext=1618><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Resonant Strings</style></linktext>.","2207350":"<linktext=1133><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Melody</style></linktext> Healing +<style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style>. Each <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Haste increases the REG SPD of <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style> by <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style>.","2207360":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Energy</style> REG SPD +<style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>.","2207370":"While <linktext=1614><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Heroic Melody</style></linktext> is active, grants <linktext=1102><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Super Armor</style></linktext>, increases DMG Reduction by <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style>, and boosts Movement Speed by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>. <linktext=1614>While <style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Heroic Melody</style></linktext> is active, grants Tenacity Chord. Each stack of Tenacity Chord additionally increases Max HP by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5%</style> (up to <style=\"accent-gn\">2.5%</style> Max HP) for <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style>s (duration cannot be refreshed once <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> stacks are reached).","2207380":"Hitting a target with <linktext=1615><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Fierce Strike</style></linktext> recovers <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Energy</style>. <style=\"accent-gn\">Each</style> additional target hit provides <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> extra <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Energy</style>, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> total.","2207390":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Luck grants <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5%</style> Lucky Strike DMG Multiplier. After activating <linktext=1614><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Heroic Melody</style></linktext>, doubles its conversion efficiency.","2207400":"When a <linktext=1192><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Note</style></linktext> forms, there's a <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> fixed chance to create an extra <linktext=1192><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Note</style></linktext> for a different target.","2207410":"When <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise</style> deal DMG (only triggers once when hitting multiple targets), additionally heal targets with <linktext=1192><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Note</style></linktext>.","2207420":"Converted healing from DMG +<style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> for targets affected by <linktext=1192><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Note</style></linktext>.","2207430":"When <linktext=1614><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Heroic Melody</style></linktext> is active, <linktext=1603><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rhapsody of Flame</style></linktext> will erupt, dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">350%</style> ATK every <style=\"accent-gn\">3s</style> to targets it touches (DMG interval affected by Haste). This DMG can trigger Lucky Strike. While in <linktext=1603><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rhapsody of Flame</style></linktext>, each hit of <linktext=1605><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Harmonic Anthem</style></linktext> also heals <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> ally with the lowest HP for <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> of the DMG dealt (this value scales proportionally when hitting multiple targets).","2207440":"When you use an <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style>, <linktext=1603><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rhapsody of Flame</style></linktext> will erupt with Rhythm, dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">700%</style> of ATK and granting <linktext=1192><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Note</style></linktext> to allies it touches.","2207450":"Within <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style> of casting <linktext=1616><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Encore</style></linktext>, each use of <linktext=1603><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rhapsody of Flame</style></linktext> caused targets affected by <linktext=1616><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Encore</style></linktext> to trigger <linktext=1193><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Encore Strings</style></linktext>.","2207460":"Permanently benefits from <linktext=1616><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Encore</style></linktext> effect. For every <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> triggers of <linktext=1193><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Encore Strings</style></linktext>, the next <linktext=1604><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Amplified Beat</style></linktext> and <linktext=1605><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Harmonic Anthem</style></linktext> deal <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> more DMG.","2207470":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Luck Chance grants <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> trigger chance for <linktext=1193><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Encore Strings</style></linktext>.","2207480":"Triggering <linktext=1193><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Encore Strings</style></linktext> to deal DMG or healing grants <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Energy</style>. If the <linktext=1193><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Encore Strings</style></linktext> triggers Lucky Strike, grants <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> additional <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Energy</style>.","2207490":"After you use <linktext=1610><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Center Stage</style></linktext>, the number of enhanced skills increases from <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> to <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style>.","2207500":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Each</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style> consumed reduces the CD of <linktext=1610><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Center Stage</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> second.","2207510":"Casting <linktext=1610><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Center Stage</style></linktext> immediately extends <linktext=1614><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Heroic Melody</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>.","2207520":"Upon casting <linktext=1610><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Center Stage</style></linktext>, grants <style=\"accent-gn\">15</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Soundwave Energy</style>, and doubles all the <style=\"accent-gn\">Soundwave Energy</style> gained in the next <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>.","2207530":"<linktext=1607><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Fivefold Crescendo</style></linktext> deals Crit DMG or healing (only triggers once for multiple targets), grants <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Energy</style>. When <linktext=1606><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Healing Melody</style></linktext> lands a Crit Hit, grants <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Energy</style>(only triggers once for multiple targets).","2207540":"The speaker releases a <linktext=1197><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Flame Shock</style></linktext> every <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>.","2207550":"<linktext=1608><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Passion Burst</style></linktext> and its enhanced version (<linktext=1617><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Passion Fury</style></linktext>) deal <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style> more DMG <style=\"accent-gn\">per</style> additional target hit, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style>.","2207560":"When <linktext=1608><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Passion Burst</style></linktext> and its enhanced version (<linktext=1617><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Passion Fury</style></linktext>) hit the speaker, it immediately releases a <linktext=1197><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Flame Shock</style></linktext>.","2207570":"While <linktext=1606><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Healing Melody</style></linktext> is active, <linktext=1607><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Fivefold Crescendo</style></linktext> also deals DMG, with its total DMG scaling equal to its healing multiplier. <linktext=1606><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">While Healing Melody</style></linktext> is active, reduces the caster's DMG taken by <style=\"accent-gn\">(10% + Haste % x 0.4) (max -30%)</style>.","2207580":"Increases the DMG dealt and healing of skills triggered by the speaker by <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style>.","2207590":"<linktext=1606><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Healing Melody</style></linktext> gains <style=\"accent-gn\">7%</style> Healing Strength for every <style=\"accent-gn\">second</style> it remains active, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> times. <linktext=1606><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Healing Melody</style></linktext> additionally restores a fixed amount equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">0.3%</style> of the target's Max HP when healing.","2207600":"Increases Crit Rate by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> against enemies above <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> HP. Increases Crit Rate by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> against enemies below <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> HP.","2207610":"Enhances Healing by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> for targets affected by <linktext=1606><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Healing Melody</style></linktext>.","2207620":"<style=\"accent-gn\">7%</style> of DMG dealt and <style=\"accent-gn\">15%</style> of healing done is stored as Rhythm. Within <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style> after you cast <linktext=1610><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Center Stage</style></linktext>, the use of <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise</style> and <linktext=1609><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Healing Beat</style></linktext> consumes Rhythm to grant up to <style=\"accent-gn\">40%</style> bonus healing. The cap for Rhythm storage is <style=\"accent-gn\">30</style> times MATK.","2207630":"Within <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style> after you cast <linktext=1616><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Encore</style></linktext>, each use of <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> triggers <linktext=1193><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Encore Strings</style></linktext> for targets affected by <linktext=1616><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Encore</style></linktext>.","2207640":"Permanently benefits from <linktext=1616><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Encore</style></linktext> effect. <style=\"accent-gn\">Each</style> trigger of <linktext=1193><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Encore Strings</style></linktext> reduces the remaining CD of <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise</style> by <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> second.","2207650":"For <style=\"accent-gn\">15s</style> after actively casting <linktext=1616><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Encore</style></linktext>, the stat bonuses provided by <linktext=1606><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Healing Melody</style></linktext> are +<style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style>.","2207660":"The charges of <linktext=1610><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Center Stage</style></linktext> increase by <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>.","2207670":"After you use <linktext=1610><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Center Stage</style></linktext>, the number of enhanced skills increases from <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> to <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style>.","2207680":"After casting <linktext=1610><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Center Stage</style></linktext>, summon a wave of <linktext=1173><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sonic Surge</style></linktext>.","2208010":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">8</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Strength</style> grants <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> ATK.","2208020":"Each <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Haste provides an additional <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Attack SPD.","2208030":"When <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attacks</style> or <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attacks</style> deal damage, grants <linktext=1211><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Infernal Combo</style></linktext> (triggers only once when hitting multiple targets).","2208040":"Gain adaptive effects when <linktext=1211><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Infernal Combo</style></linktext> reaches max stacks: <style=\"accent-gn\">Formless Spec</style>: ATK +<style=\"accent-gn\">8%</style>. <style=\"accent-gn\">Crimson Spec</style>: <style=\"accent-gn\">Crimson Recovery</style> effect +<style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>.","2208050":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style> hits cause the target to take +<style=\"accent-gn\">2.5%</style> DMG. The effect lasts <style=\"accent-gn\">8</style>s and stacks up to <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> times.","2208060":"When <style=\"accent-gn\">Strength</style> reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">500</style> points, <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> damage +<style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style>.","2208070":"Each stack of <linktext=1211><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Infernal Combo</style></linktext> grants effects based on the relationship between Luck Chance and Crit Chance: When Luck Chance is greater than or equal to Crit Chance, each stack of <linktext=1211><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Infernal Combo</style></linktext> grants <style=\"accent-gn\">1.6%</style> Lucky Strike Multiplier. When Crit Chance is greater than Luck Chance, each stack of <linktext=1211><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Infernal Combo</style></linktext> grants <style=\"accent-gn\">1.2%</style> Crit DMG.","2208080":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Flame Soul</style> cap +<style=\"accent-gn\">50</style>. Every <style=\"accent-gn\">50</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Flame Soul</style> gained triggers <linktext=1211><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Infernal Combo</style></linktext>.","2208090":"When <style=\"accent-gn\">Strength</style> reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">300</style> points, the effect of the talent <linktext=1211><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Infernal Combo</style></linktext> is increased by <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>.","2208100":"Grants the <linktext=1218><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Flame Suppression</style></linktext> specialization effect.","2208110":"While in the <linktext=1211><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Infernal Combo</style></linktext> state, the <linktext=1218><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Flame Suppression</style></linktext> effect is increased by <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>.","2208120":"Enhances Crimson Flame Pursuit based on the target's lost HP: When the target's HP is below <style=\"accent-gn\">80%</style>, enhances the base effect by <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style>. The lower the target's HP, the higher the bonus, up to a maximum enhancement of <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> when the target's HP drops to <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style>.","2208130":"By using different <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attacks</style> and <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skills</style>, the <style=\"accent-gn\">Formless</style> level can be raised from E to S (a total of <style=\"accent-gn\">6</style> levels). During its <style=\"accent-gn\">8</style>s duration, each <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> level grants <linktext=1622><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blazing Assault</style></linktext>, <linktext=1623><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rage Cleave</style></linktext>, and <linktext=1624><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Axe Wind</style></linktext> a <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style> CD Speed increase. <i><style=\"text_third_gray\"><size=20>Trigger Formless effects to accelerate CDs, chain Blazing Assault to boost Expertise Skill DMG, and combine with the core Formless Flame Slash mechanic to deal massive combo DMG.</size></style></i>","2208140":"After casting <linktext=1622><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blazing Assault</style></linktext>, the next <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> deals +<style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> Final DMG, but its Crit Chance is halved.","2208150":"After gaining <style=\"accent-gn\">Formless</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">6</style> times or activating <linktext=1625><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wasteland's End</style></linktext>, <linktext=1619><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blazing Ascension</style></linktext> evolves into <linktext=1620><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Soaring Flame</style></linktext>. Gains <linktext=1620><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blaze</style></linktext> after casting <linktext=1212><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Soaring Flame</style></linktext>.","2208160":"When <style=\"accent-gn\">Formless</style> is obtained, the remaining CD of the skill with the longest current CD among <linktext=1622><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blazing Assault</style></linktext>, <linktext=1623><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rage Cleave</style></linktext>, and <linktext=1624><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Axe Wind</style></linktext> is reduced by <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>.<style=\"accent-gn\">5</style>s.","2208170":"In <linktext=1212><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blaze</style></linktext> state, <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skills</style> inflict <linktext=1213><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Burn</style></linktext> when they hit a target.","2208180":"When a target is inflicted with <linktext=1213><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Burn</style></linktext>, there is a <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> fixed chance to accumulate <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack of <style=\"accent-gn\">Wildfire</style> that lasts for <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style>s. When <style=\"accent-gn\">Wildfire</style> reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">12</style> stacks, it triggers <linktext=1214><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Explosion</style></linktext> and clears <style=\"accent-gn\">Wildfire</style> stacks.","2208190":"<linktext=1213><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Burn</style></linktext> can trigger Lucky Strike. Based on the target's current <linktext=1213><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Burn</style></linktext> stacks, increases <linktext=1214><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Explosion</style></linktext> damage. Each additional <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack of <linktext=1213><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Burn</style></linktext> increases <linktext=1214><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Explosion</style></linktext> damage by <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style>.","2208200":"During <linktext=1625><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wasteland's End</style></linktext>, triggering a Lucky Strike with <linktext=1623><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rage Cleave</style></linktext> or <linktext=1624><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Axe Wind</style></linktext> reduces the charge time of <linktext=1622><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blazing Assault</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>s.","2208210":"Each <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> level of the <style=\"accent-gn\">Formless</style> effect increases Lucky Strike DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style>.","2208220":"Each <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> level of the <style=\"accent-gn\">Formless</style> effect grants <style=\"accent-gn\">2.5%</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Strength</style>.","2208230":"<linktext=1622><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blazing Assault</style></linktext> restores <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style> of lost <style=\"accent-gn\">Flame Soul</style>. When <style=\"accent-gn\">Formless</style> is at S level, enhances recovery effect to <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>.","2208240":"<linktext=1624><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Axe Wind</style></linktext> applies <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> stacks of <linktext=1213><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Burn</style></linktext> to hit targets. At S <style=\"accent-gn\">Formless</style> level, targets hit by <linktext=1624><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Axe Wind</style></linktext> accumulate <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack of <style=\"accent-gn\">Wildfire</style> that lasts for <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style>s. When <style=\"accent-gn\">Wildfire</style> reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">12</style> stacks, it triggers <linktext=1214><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Explosion</style></linktext> and clears <style=\"accent-gn\">Wildfire</style> stacks.","2208250":"In the <style=\"accent-gn\">Formless</style> S-Rank state, each cast of <linktext=1623><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rage Cleave</style></linktext> summons <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <linktext=1215><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Hellfire Meteor</style></linktext> at the primary target's location.","2208260":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Mastery grants <style=\"accent-gn\">0.2%</style> Fire Bonus.","2208270":"Gains <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style> Fire Bonus for <style=\"accent-gn\">15</style>s after casting Ultimate.","2208280":"<linktext=1623><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rage Cleave</style></linktext>, <linktext=1622><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blazing Assault</style></linktext>, and <linktext=1624><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Axe Wind</style></linktext> can trigger <linktext=1216><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Formless Flame Slash</style></linktext>.","2208290":"Every </linktext><style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Luck increases the trigger chance of <linktext=1216><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Formless Flame Slash</style> stages <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> to <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.2%</style>/<style=\"accent-gn\">0.1%</style>/<style=\"accent-gn\">0.05%</style> respectively, but the Crit Rate of <linktext=1216><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Formless Flame Slash</style></linktext> is halved.","2208300":"For every <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> hits an <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> deals to the main target, it grants a buff that increases the Lucky Strike Multiplier by <style=\"accent-gn\">27%</style> and reduces Lucky Strike Crit Rate by <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> for the next <style=\"accent-gn\">8s</style>. This effect stacks up to <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> times.","2208310":"<linktext=1216><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Formless Flame Slash</style></linktext> can trigger Lucky Strike. Lucky Strike DMG Multiplier +<style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style>. Every <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Luck grants <style=\"accent-gn\">0</style>.<style=\"accent-gn\">8%</style> Lucky Strike DMG Multiplier.","2208320":"<linktext=1216><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Formless Flame Slash</style></linktext> Luck Chance +<style=\"accent-gn\">8%</style>.","2208330":"<linktext=1216><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Formless Flame Slash</style></linktext> gains <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style> Fire Bonus.","2208340":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attacks</style>, <linktext=1619><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blazing Ascension</style></linktext>, and <linktext=1620><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Soaring Flame</style></linktext> can trigger <linktext=1216><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Formless Flame Slash</style></linktext>.","2208350":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skills</style> ignore <style=\"accent-gn\">35%</style> of the target's Armor.","2208360":"Each <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> level of the <style=\"accent-gn\">Formless</style> effect provides <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style> <linktext=1216><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Formless Flame Slash</style></linktext> DMG.","2208370":"During <linktext=1625><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wasteland's End</style></linktext>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> DMG +<style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style>.","2208380":"When <style=\"accent-gn\">Formless</style> is obtained, the remaining CD of <linktext=1625><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wasteland's End</style></linktext> is reduced by <style=\"accent-gn\">0</style>.<style=\"accent-gn\">5</style>s or its duration is extended by <style=\"accent-gn\">0</style>.<style=\"accent-gn\">5</style>s (total extended duration cannot exceed <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style>s).","2208390":"Fire Bonus +<style=\"accent-gn\">8%</style> when attacking Elite or higher targets.","2208400":"For each additional target hit by an <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style>, DMG dealt +<style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">60%</style>.","2208410":"When killing a target, <style=\"accent-gn\">Flame Soul</style> +<style=\"accent-gn\">5</style>.","2208420":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> DMG increases Fire ATK by <style=\"accent-gn\">22</style> for the next <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style>s. Stacks up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> times.","2208440":"For every <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Crimson Soul Gauge</style> charged, immediately gains a buff: Increases ATK bonuses from all sources by <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style>s. This effect can stack up to <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> times.","2208450":"For every <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> Max HP or <style=\"accent-gn\">Crimson Soul Gauge</style> lost, a stack of a buff is immediately gained: Crit Chance from all sources is increased by <style=\"accent-gn\">2.5%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style>s. This effect can stack up to <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> times.","2208460":"While within <style=\"accent-gn\">Crimson Earth</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Flame Soul</style> recovery efficiency +<style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style>. While within <style=\"accent-gn\">Crimson Earth</style>, <linktext=1626><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wildfire Dance</style></linktext> DMG +<style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>.","2208470":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Attack SPD increases the <style=\"accent-gn\">Crimson Recovery</style> effect by <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> while within <style=\"accent-gn\">Crimson Earth</style>.","2208480":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> casts of <linktext=1627><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Unbound Meteor</style></linktext> cause <linktext=1627><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Unbound Meteor</style></linktext> to evolve into <linktext=1628><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Falling Hellfire</style></linktext>.","2208490":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Haste grants <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5%</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> CD Boost.","2208500":"<linktext=1627><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Unbound Meteor</style></linktext> and its enhanced skill (<linktext=1628><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Falling Hellfire</style></linktext>) gain <style=\"accent-gn\">15%</style> Fire Bonus. This is increased by an additional <style=\"accent-gn\">15%</style> within <style=\"accent-gn\">Crimson Earth</style>.","2208510":"Casting <linktext=1630><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Flowing Splendor Slash</style></linktext>, <linktext=1627><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Unbound Meteor</style></linktext>, and its enhanced skill (<linktext=1628><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Falling Hellfire</style></linktext>) consumes up to <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> stacks of <linktext=1211><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Infernal Combo</style></linktext>. Each stack of <linktext=1211><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Infernal Combo</style></linktext> grants that skill a <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> Fire Bonus.","2208520":"Crit DMG +<style=\"accent-gn\">8%</style>.","2208530":"While <linktext=1629><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Endless Hellfire</style></linktext> is active, the <style=\"accent-gn\">Crimson Recovery</style> effect is doubled and the final consumption of the <style=\"accent-gn\">Crimson Soul Gauge</style> is reduced by half.","2208540":"For every <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Attack SPD exceeding <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">0.2%</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> DMG is provided.","2208550":"After casting <linktext=1630><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Flowing Splendor Slash</style></linktext>, <linktext=1626><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wildfire Dance</style></linktext> DMG is increased by<style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style>s. <linktext=1630><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Flowing Splendor Slash</style></linktext> charge count +<style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>.","2208560":"When <linktext=1621><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frenzied Slash</style></linktext> deals DMG, there is a <style=\"accent-gn\">15%</style> fixed chance to grant <linktext=1630><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Flowing Splendor Slash</style></linktext> <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> charge and cause its next cast to consume no <style=\"accent-gn\">Flame Soul</style>.","2208570":"Activating <linktext=1629><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Endless Hellfire</style></linktext> immediately grants <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> stacks of <linktext=1211><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Infernal Combo</style></linktext>, which are not consumed while it is active. <linktext=1629>While <style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Endless Hellfire</style></linktext> is active, <style=\"accent-gn\">Strength</style> +<style=\"accent-gn\">15%</style>.","2208580":"When <style=\"accent-gn\">Crimson Soul Gauge</style> is charged above <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>, Fire ATK +<style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>.","2208590":"When dealing Crit DMG, ignores <style=\"accent-gn\">22%</style> of the target's Armor.","2208600":"<linktext=1628><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Falling Hellfire</style></linktext> is enhanced into a continuous three-hit strike form. Every <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Crimson Soul Gauge</style> increases <linktext=1628><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Falling Hellfire</style></linktext> DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style>.","2208610":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Mastery grants <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Crimson Recovery</style> final effect.","2208620":"After <linktext=1626><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wildfire Dance</style></linktext> deals Crit DMG <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> times (hits on multiple targets count as one), it triggers a <style=\"accent-gn\">Final Slash</style> that deals <style=\"accent-gn\">500%</style> ATK as <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to enemies. <linktext=1626>Each Crit DMG instance dealt by <style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wildfire Dance</style></linktext> grants the <style=\"accent-gn\">Final Slash</style> a <style=\"accent-gn\">3%</style> Final DMG Bonus (up to a maximum of <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style>).","2208630":"<linktext=1626><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wildfire Dance</style></linktext> can trigger <linktext=1216><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Formless Flame Slash</style></linktext>, but can no longer trigger Lucky Strikes. <linktext=1216>The damage multiplier of <style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Formless Flame Slash</style></linktext> is adjusted to the skill multiplier that triggered it * (<style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> + Crit%).","2208640":"Each time <linktext=1626><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wildfire Dance</style></linktext> deals DMG <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> time, it grants the next <linktext=1627><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Unbound Meteor</style></linktext>, <linktext=1628><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Falling Hellfire</style></linktext>, or <linktext=1630><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Flowing Splendor Slash</style></linktext> a <style=\"accent-gn\">2.5%</style> Final DMG Bonus (up to a maximum of <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style>). Casting any of these skills clears this bonus.","2208650":"When <linktext=1626><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wildfire Dance</style></linktext> deals DMG, there is a fixed chance of <style=\"accent-gn\">12%</style> + Haste% / <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style>.<style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> to gain <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack of <style=\"accent-gn\">Crimson Bloodline</style>. When <style=\"accent-gn\">Crimson Bloodline</style> reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">7</style> stacks, it triggers <linktext=1217><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Great Crimson Lotus</style></linktext> and clears all <style=\"accent-gn\">Crimson Bloodline</style> stacks.","2208660":"<linktext=1626><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wildfire Dance</style></linktext> Attack SPD +<style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style>.","2208670":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">15%</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Crimson Soul Gauge</style> charged reduces the remaining CD of <linktext=1629><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Endless Hellfire</style></linktext> by <style=\"accent-