on-<style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack</style> Class Skills, your next Class Skill will trigger <linktext=1201><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Phantom Execution</style></linktext> (up to once every <style=\"accent-gn\">15s</style>.","3002220":"<linktext=1201><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Phantom Execution</style></linktext>: The Crit Chance obtained in any way increases by <style=\"accent-gn\">6%</style>.","3002230":"For <style=\"accent-gn\">each</style> instance your Class Skills deal a Crit, increases <linktext=1201><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Phantom Execution</style></linktext> Illusion-Breaking DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">6%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">8</style>s, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> times.","3002240":"When <linktext=1201><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Phantom Execution</style></linktext> hits a single target, grants one of the following 3 effects at random (cannot stack): <style=\"accent-gn\">Time-Slit - Illusion</style>: Increases main attributes by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>. <style=\"accent-gn\">Time-Slit - Dream</style>: Reduces the CD of <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style> and <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skills</style> by <style=\"accent-gn\">22%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">7s</style>. <style=\"accent-gn\">Time-Slit - Slumber</style>: Increases Illusion-Breaking DMG of <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skills</style> by <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">15s</style>.","3002250":"Defeating an enemy instantly refreshes <linktext=1201><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Phantom Execution</style></linktext> CD.","3002260":"<linktext=1201><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Phantom Execution</style></linktext> jumps to <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> nearby targets, with Illusion-Breaking DMG reduced by <style=\"accent-gn\">35%</style> per jump.","3002270":"<linktext=1201><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Phantom Execution</style></linktext> unleashes an extra burst, but that burst's Illusion-Breaking DMG 