03030":"Taking lethal DMG triggers <linktext=1207><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Near Death</style></linktext> for <style=\"accent-gn\">1s</style>, up to once every <style=\"accent-gn\">45s</style>.","3003040":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Oblivion Dream</style> range increases to <style=\"accent-gn\">10m</style>.","3003050":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Oblivion Dream</style> erupts upon combat entering, increasing the main stats of allies within range by <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">8s</style>. It erupts again every <style=\"accent-gn\">15s</style>.","3003060":"Against enemies or allies within <style=\"accent-gn\">Oblivion Dream</style>, gains <style=\"accent-gn\">3%</style> All-Element Bonus.","3003070":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Oblivion Dream</style> grants allies within range <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style> Illusion-Breaking DMG Reduction. If there are <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> or more enemies within range, Illusion-Breaking DMG Reduction additionally increases by <style=\"accent-gn\">3%</style>.","3003080":"Deals <style=\"accent-gn\">6%</style> more Illusion-Breaking DMG to targets affected by <style=\"accent-gn\">Oblivion Dream</style>.","3003210":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>, the next damage you deal will trigger <linktext=1208><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Shattered Illusion</style></linktext>. Each <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Mastery grants it <style=\"accent-gn\">0.65%</style> Element Bonus.","3003220":"When hit, you have a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> chance to trigger <linktext=1208><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Shattered Illusion</style></linktext> (up to once every <style=\"accent-gn\">3s</style>).","3003230":"<linktext=1208><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Shattered Illusion</style></linktext> always triggers Crit.","3003240":"<linktext=1208><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Shattered Illusion</style></linktext> Illusion-Breaking DMG increases by <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> for each <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> additional enemy hit, up to 