s only one target, it triggers twice. Explosion Illusion-Breaking DMG<style=\"accent-gn\">+{p1}</style>","3060140":"For every 50 hits Wildfire Dance deals to the primary target, gain Enhancement: Great Crimson Lotus Illusion-Breaking DMG<style=\"accent-gn\">+{p1}</style> for 5s","3060150":"For every 7 hits Wildfire Dance deals to the primary target, unleashes a Flowing Splendor Slash. Flowing Splendor Slash Illusion-Breaking DMG<style=\"accent-gn\">+{p1}</style>","3060400":"When Illusion Energy reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">{*Decision.unmarknormal(1)*}</style> points, Formless Flame Slash is guaranteed to Crit for 10s, and its Crit DMG is always counted as <style=\"accent-gn\">{p3}</style>.","3060410":"When Illusion Energy reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">{*Decision.unmarknormal(1)*}</style> points, the next Axe Wind has its resource consumption reduced by 50%, range increased by 2m, and Illusion DMG increased by <style=\"accent-gn\">{p3}</style>.","3060420":"When Illusion Energy reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">{*Decision.unmarknormal(1)*}</style> points, Formless Flame Slash Final DMG +<style=\"accent-gn\">{p3}</style> for 10s.","3060430":"When Illusion Energy reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">{*Decision.unmarknormal(1)*}</style> points, triggers Great Crimson Lotus; Great Crimson Lotus's Illusion DMG is increased by <style=\"accent-gn\">{p3}</style>. Can trigger at most once within {*Decision.unmarktime(2)*}.","3060440":"When Illusion Energy reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">{*Decision.unmarknormal(1)*}</style> points, Wildfire Dance Final DMG +<style=\"accent-gn\">{p3}</style> for 10s.","3060450":"When Illusion Energy reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">{*Decision.unmarknormal(1)*}</style> points, the remaining CD of the Ultimate is reduced by 0.5s. Can trigger at most once within {*Decision.unmarktime(2)*}.","3200002":"Gains permanent Super Armor. When HP drops to <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style>, gains <style=\"accent-gn\">{p1}</style> All Element DMG Reduction.","3200004":"Special Attack DMG and healing <style=\"accent-gn\">+{p1}</style>","3200005":"Expertise Skill DMG and healing <style=\"accent-gn\">+{p1}</style>","3200008":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">{*Decision.unmarktime(1)*}</style>, the next Attack DMG taken is bound to be parried.","3200009":"When a Lucky Strike is launched, the Lucky Effect may be activated: Fires an arrow at the target, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">{p1} </style>ATK (CD: <style=\"accent-gn\">0.1s</style>).","3200020":"After you take <style=\"accent-gn\">{*Decision.unmarknormal(1)*}</style> hits, your Armor increases <style=\"accent-gn\">{*Decision.unmarknormal(2)*}</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">15s</style>","3200025":"When a Lucky Strike is launched, the Lucky Effect may be activated: Fires a poisoned sting at the target, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">{p1}</style> ATK (CD: <style=\"accent-gn\">0.1s</style>)","3200026":"Damage taken from Goblin race -<style=\"accent-gn\">{p1}</style>, while DMG dealt to non-Goblin race targets +<style=\"accent-gn\">{p1}</style>.","3200032":"Ultimate Skill CD speed <style=\"accent-gn\">+{p1}</style>","3200033":"Expertise Skill DMG and healing <style=\"accent-gn\">+{p1}</style>","3200034":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>, your next hit includes an additional <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">{p3}</style> ATK. Each time you grant healing, increases your next such damage by <style=\"accent-gn\">{p1}</style>, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">+{p2}</style> (this damage cannot trigger Crit)","3200035":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>, your Crit DMG varies between <style=\"accent-gn\">+{p1} and +{p2}</style>","3200036":"DMG <style=\"accent-gn\">+{p1}</style>, Final DMG Reduction <style=\"accent-gn\">+{p2}</style>.","3200037":"Casting Class Skills reduces the CD of the current Resonance Skill's active effect by <style=\"accent-gn\">{*Decision.unmarktime(1)*}</style> (triggers up to once every <style=\"accent-gn\">1s</style>).","3200038":"Current Spec's Strength/Intellect/Agility <style=\"accent-gn\">+{p1}</style>, Healing <style=\"accent-gn\">+{p2}</style>.","3200039":"Ultimate DMG <style=\"accent-gn\">+{p1}</style>.","3200101":"Block <style=\"accent-gn\">+{*Decision.unmarknormal(1)*}</style> (Scales with season level, <style=\"accent-gn\">+{*Decision.unmarknormal(2)*}</style> per level, and the base value plus level value cannot exceed <style=\"accent-gn\">{*Decision.unmarknormal(3)*}</style>)","3200102":"Haste <style=\"accent-gn\">+{*Decision.unmarknormal(1)*}</style> (Scales with season level, <style=\"accent-gn\">+{*Decision.unmarknormal(2)*}</style> per level, and the base value plus level value cannot exceed <style=\"accent-gn\">{*Decision.unmarknormal(3)*}</style>)","3200103":"Mastery <style=\"accent-gn\">+{*Decision.unmarknormal(1)*}</style> (Scales with season level, <style=\"accent-gn\">+{*Decision.unmarknormal(2)*}</style> per level, and the base value plus level value cannot exceed <style=\"accent-gn\">{*Decision.unmarknormal(3)*}</style>)","3200104":"Versatility <style=\"accent-gn\">+{*Decision.unmarknormal(1)*}</style> (Scales with season level, <style=\"accent-gn\">+{*Decision.unmarknormal(2)*}</style> per level, and the base value plus level value cannot exceed <style=\"accent-gn\">{*Decision.unmarknormal(3)*}</style>)","3200105":"Versatility <style=\"accent-gn\">+{*Decision.unmarknormal(1)*}</style> (Scales with season level, <style=\"accent-gn\">+{*Decision.unmarknormal(2)*}</style> per level, and the base value plus level value cannot exceed <style=\"accent-gn\">{*Decision.unmarknormal(3)*}</style>)","3200106":"Mastery <style=\"accent-gn\">+{*Decision.unmarknormal(1)*}</style> (Scales with season level, <style=\"accent-gn\">+{*Decision.unmarknormal(2)*}</style> per level, and the base value plus level value cannot exceed <style=\"accent-gn\">{*Decision.unmarknormal(3)*}</style>)","3200107":"Haste <style=\"accent-gn\">+{*Decision.unmarknormal(1)*}</style> (Scales with season level, <style=\"accent-gn\">+{*Decision.unmarknormal(2)*}</style> per level, and the base value plus level value cannot exceed <style=\"accent-gn\">{*Decision.unmarknormal(3)*}</style>)","3210010":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">{*Decision.unmarktime(1)*}</style>, adds a Frost Explosion to the next attack, dealing Ice <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> ATK, and freezing the target, while also causing a strong Resilience Break effect.","3210020":"When a Lucky Strike is launched, the Lucky Effect may be activated: Launches a meteor strike, dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">{p1}</style> ATK (CD: <style=\"accent-gn\">0.3s</style>). Tier 5: <style=\"accent-gn\">Each</style> time a meteor is summoned, immediately reduces the CD of this skill by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5s</style>. Triggers at most <style=\"accent-gn\">once</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">per second</style>.","3210030":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>, unleashes a lightning strike on a random nearby target, dealing <style=\"magic\">Thunder</style> <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">{p1}</style> ATK. Taking DMG reduces the lightning trigger interval by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5s</style>. Each trigger reduces the CD of this skill by <style=\"accent-gn\">{*Decision.unmarktime(2)*}</style>, and targets hit deal <style=\"accent-gn\">{p3}</style> less DMG to you for <style=\"accent-gn\">3s</style>.","3210040":"Dealing DMG <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> times in a row within <style=\"accent-gn\">3s</style> grants a buff that increases ATK by <style=\"accent-gn\">{p1}</style>, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> times, lasting for <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>.","3210050":"When a Lucky Strike is launched, the Lucky Effect may be activated: Applies a burn effect to the target, dealing Fire <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">{p1}ATK</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>.","3210060":"When a Class Skill or Resonance Skill lands a Crit Hit, it triggers an additional Earth Splitter that deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">{p1}</style> ATK, dealing Crit DMG (Trigger at most <style=\"accent-gn\">once</style> every <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>).","3210070":"Each time an Expertise Skill is cast, Expertise Skill elemental DMG +<style=\"accent-gn\">{p1}</style>, stacks up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> times, lasts for <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>.","3210080":"When a Lucky Strike is launched, the Lucky Effect may be activated: Performs a Thunderstrike, dealing Thunder <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">{p1}</style> ATK (CD: <style=\"accent-gn\">0.1s</style>).","3210090":"When dealing DMG, gains a <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> chance to invoke Tidal Force, reducing the CD of this skill by <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style> and enhancing your weapon, causing your next skill to deal additional <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">{p1}</style> ATK (CD: <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>)","3210100":"When healing is done, there is a <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> chance to grant a Shield equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">{p1}</style> of ATK. When the shield expires, it releases a gust of wind, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">{p2}</style> of ATK.","3210110":"Each cast of Expertise Skill grants 1 stack of Heavy Slash, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">{*Decision.unmarknormal(1)*} stacks. (All stacks are consumed when casting an active skill, increasing its DMG.)</style>","3210120":"After each Special Attack cast, Companion ATK <style=\"accent-gn\">+{p1}</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> times.","3210130":"Strength/Intellect/Agility <style=\"accent-gn\">+{p1}</style> Every <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style> after combat entering, randomly gains one effect: 1. Strength/Intellect/Agility <style=\"accent-gn\">+{p2}</style> 2. Versatility <style=\"accent-gn\">+{*Decision.unmarknormal(4)*}</style> 3. Mastery <style=\"accent-gn\">+{*Decision.unmarknormal(4)*}</style> 4. Haste <style=\"accent-gn\">+{*Decision.unmarknormal(4)*}</style> 5. All-Element DMG <style=\"accent-gn\">+{p3}</style>","3210140":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">15s</style>, gains Absolute Luck: Luck <style=\"accent-gn\">+{*Decision.unmarknormal(2)*}</style>, Lucky Strike DMG and Healing multiplier <style=\"accent-gn\">+{p1}</style>. Removed after <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> casts of damage-type Expertise Skills","3210150":"Reduces your total damage dealt by <style=\"accent-gn\">80%</style> Each time you cast a non-Basic Attack Class Skill, reduces the CD of this skill by <style=\"accent-gn\">{*Decision.unmarktime(1)*}</style>, and gains <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack of Blade Intent","3210160":"When a Lucky Strike is landed, the Luck Effect may be activated: Triggers an explosion at the target, dealing Light <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">{p1}</style> ATK (CD: <style=\"accent-gn\">0.1s</style>)","3210170":"When a Lucky Strike is landed, the Luck Effect may be activated: Triggers an explosion at the target, randomly dealing <style=\"accent-gn\">1 to 3</style> instances of Fire-Element <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">{p1}</style> ATK (CD: <style=\"accent-gn\">0.1s</style>)","3210180":"Crit DMG +<style=\"accent-gn\">{p1}</style>. Landing a Crit has a chance to further increase Crit DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">{p2}</style> (chance equals Crit Rate; triggers at most once every <style=\"accent-gn\">0.1s</style>), up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> stacks, lasting <style=\"accent-gn\">2s</style>.","3210190":"Expertise Skill DMG increased by <style=\"accent-gn\">{p1}</style> of ATK. Grants 1 additional stack for every <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> Haste, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">7</style> stacks, lasting <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>.","3210200":"Casting a Class Skill different from the previous one (excluding Basic Attacks) grants a <style=\"accent-gn\">{p1}</style> Elemental Bonus, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> times. Casting the same skill resets the stacks. At max stacks, stacks can no longer be gained or lost for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>, and are cleared when the duration ends.","3210210":"Casting a healing skill deals <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">{p1}</style> of ATK to nearby enemies (each time a healing skill is cast, this damage effect is increased by <style=\"accent-gn\">{p2}</style>, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> times for <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>).","3210220":"When HP is above <style=\"accent-gn\">{p1}</style>, grants Invigorated: Super Armor and immunity to <linktext=3020><style=\"accent-gn\">status effects</style></linktext> . Upon taking lethal DMG, grants Survival Instinct: HP will not fall below <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">{*Decision.unmarktime(2)*}</style>, and restores <style=\"accent-gn\">{p3}</style> HP per second (triggers at most once every <style=\"accent-gn\">{*Decision.unmarktime(4)*}</style>).","3210230":"For every <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> instances of DMG dealt by Class Skills (each attack counts only once), the next DMG instance additionally deals AoE Adaptive <style=\"physical\">Attack/Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">{p1}</style> of ATK.","3210240":"When damage triggers a Lucky Strike, it may activate a \"Luck effect\": Causes an explosion at the target's location, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">{p1}</style> of ATK (CD: <style=\"accent-gn\">0.1s</style>). Each successful trigger increases the Elemental DMG of this Luck effect by <style=\"accent-gn\">{p2}</style>, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> times, lasting <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5s</style>.","3401095":"DMG taken <style=\"accent-gn\">+10%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>.","3401096":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> ATK and allows your next <style=\"accent-gn\">Overdrive</style> to gain <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> extra <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Sigil</style>.","3401097":"Greatly accelerates the using of <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>. Effect ends after you launch a <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style>.","3401098":"A hidden technique from <style=\"accent-gn\">Thundercut</style>. Performs a rapid rising slash, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">300%</style> ATK (which scales with the Level/Tier of <style=\"accent-gn\">Flurry Slash</style>). Once Attack Speed reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style>|<style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>|<style=\"accent-gn\">80%</style>, your attack count +<style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>|<style=\"accent-gn\">2</style>|<style=\"accent-gn\">3</style>.","3401099":"Each wave deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> ATK. Starts with <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> wave. Gains <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> extra wave for every <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> Mastery, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">4</style> waves.","3401100":"Luck Effect: Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">80%</style> ATK to the enemy.","3401101":"Spins continuously for <style=\"accent-gn\">35s</style>, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> ATK every <style=\"accent-gn\">2s</style> (which scales with the Level/Tier of Scythe Wheel).","3401102":"Cannot be knocked back, knocked airborne, or knocked down.","3401103":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> ATK to enemies within <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> meters.","3401104":"When using a Skill that consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Sigils</style>, each additional <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Sigil</style> consumed increases the Skill's DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style>.","3401105":"Deals massive DMG based on the number of <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Sigils</style> consumed in the past <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>. <style=\"accent-gn\">Each</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Sigil</style> consumed deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">150%</style> ATK, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">15,000%</style>.","3401106":"Can accumulate up to <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Charge Seed</style>s. When casting <style=\"accent-gn\">Thundercut</style>, consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">15</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Charge Seed</style>s to trigger <style=\"accent-gn\">Storm Scythe</style>, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to surrounding targets.","3401107":"Grants the blessed target <style=\"accent-gn\">135</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Intellect</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Strength</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Agility</style>, and <style=\"accent-gn\">Endurance</style>, as well as <style=\"accent-gn\">1.5%</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Crit</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Haste</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Luck</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Mastery</style>, and <style=\"accent-gn\">Versatility</style>.","3401108":"When a Healing <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> or <style=\"accent-gn\">Ultimate</style> restores HP, it consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Regen Buds</style> and throws a <style=\"accent-gn\">Nourishing Seed</style>, once every <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> second. When a DMG <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> or <style=\"accent-gn\">Ultimate</style> deals DMG, it consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Regen Buds</style> and fires a <style=\"accent-gn\">Wild Seed</style>, once <style=\"accent-gn\">per</style> second.","3401109":"The Healing Chain bounces between allies, restoring HP equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">40%</style> ATK per bounce. Starts with <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> bounces.","3401110":"Spreads outward up to <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style> meters, restoring HP equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">150%</style> ATK to all allies hit.","3401111":"Grants an ally a <style=\"accent-gn\">Shield</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">150%</style> ATK for <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>.","3401113":"Automatically restores HP equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">60%</style> ATK to allies within <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> meters.","3401114":"When within <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> meters of the <style=\"accent-gn\">Engram Orb</style>, gains <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Regen Bud</style>. The <style=\"accent-gn\">Engram Orb</style> lasts up to <style=\"accent-gn\">3s</style>.","3401115":"When it hits the ground, restores HP equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">40%</style> ATK to all allies.","3401116":"Explodes upon contact with an enemy, dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> ATK.","3401117":"Deals <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> ATK per second to the enemy for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>.","3401119":"The next <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> used has its CD -<style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>.","3401120":"After the next cast of a <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style>, increases your Healing by <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>.","3401121":"The next <style=\"accent-gn\">Life Bloom</style> grants the target a <style=\"accent-gn\">Shield</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">8s</style>, absorbing DMG equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">200%</style> ATK. Targets with the <style=\"accent-gn\">Shield</style> take <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> less DMG from all sources.","3401122":"When taking DMG and your HP percentage is higher than the attacker's, reduces the DMG the attacker deals to you by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>. When dealing DMG and your HP percentage is higher than the target's, increases the DMG you deal to them by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>.","3401123":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> ATK to an enemy and grants <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Sand Crystal</style>.","3401124":"Enhances Shield effectiveness by <style=\"accent-gn\">15%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>.","3401125":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> ATK to enemies within <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> meters, ignores <style=\"accent-gn\">Block</style>, and generates significant Threat.","3401126":"When performing a <style=\"accent-gn\">Block</style>, gains a chance to trigger <style=\"accent-gn\">Lucky Block</style> based on Luck percentage.","3401127":"For the next <style=\"accent-gn\">7s</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Shield Bash</style> becomes a two-hit combo and costs no <style=\"accent-gn\">Rage</style> or <style=\"accent-gn\">Sand Crystals</style>, while also granting a <style=\"accent-gn\">Shield</style> to yourself. The effect ends after <style=\"accent-gn\">Shield Bash</style> is used.","3401128":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">300%</style> ATK to enemies within <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> meters. For the next <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>, recover <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Rage</style> every <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> second. This effect cannot stack.","3401129":"Reduces DMG taken by <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> and increases Healing Received by <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>.","3401130":"Restores <style=\"accent-gn\">3%</style> of Max <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Energy</style> per second (scales with Mastery and Haste), lasting for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>.","3401131":"Strikes the nearest <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> enemy target, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">70%</style> ATK.","3401132":"Moves forcibly into melee range to strike the target.","3401133":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Heroic Melody</style> or <style=\"accent-gn\">Healing Melody</style>","3401134":"An enhanced version of <style=\"accent-gn\">Rageburst</style> that summons giant rocks around you, which then explode to deal <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">750%</style> ATK (which scales with the Level/Tier of <style=\"accent-gn\">Rage Burst</style>. It does not consume <style=\"accent-gn\">Sand Crystals</style>.","3401135":"DMG dealt <style=\"accent-gn\">+20%</style>, Move SPd <style=\"accent-gn\">+10%</style>, and gains <style=\"accent-gn\">Super Armor</style>.","3401136":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">300%</style> ATK to enemies within <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> meters.","3401137":"Within the zone, reduces your <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> taken by <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>, and <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> of the DMG taken by Allies (up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style>) is redirected to you.","3401138":"When <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style> is full, using a <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style> allows you to enter <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Reforge</style>. In this state, <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attacks</style> and certain <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise</style> are enhanced. <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Reforge</style> gradually depletes, and the state ends when it reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">0</style>.","3401139":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">80%</style> ATK to enemies within <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> meters. For each additional enemy hit, increases the DMG dealt by <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> (which scales with the Level/Tier of <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack</style>, up to +<style=\"accent-gn\">120%</style>).","3401140":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> ATK to an enemy and inflicts <style=\"accent-gn\">Bleed</style>.","3401141":"The effect lasts <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> ATK per second. If applied again from the same source before the previous <style=\"accent-gn\">Bleed</style> ends, it deals all remaining DMG of the previous <style=\"accent-gn\">Bleed</style> immediately.","3401142":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> ATK to the enemy.","3401143":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">350%</style> ATK to the enemy.","3401144":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> ATK to enemies within <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> meters.","3401145":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">250%</style> ATK to the enemies within range.","3401146":"Flaps wings in place, increasing Photon Energy gain rate by <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> for the next <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style>s.","3401147":"Lets out a fierce howl, increasing Light bonus by <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>.","3401148":"When <style=\"accent-gn\">Steel Beak</style> stacks reach <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> or more, each additional <style=\"accent-gn\">Steel Beak</style> stack gained has a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> chance to trigger <style=\"accent-gn\">Implosion</style>, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">200%</style> ATK to enemy targets. <style=\"accent-gn\">Steel Beak</style> loses <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack <style=\"accent-gn\">per</style> second.","3401149":"Creates a storm with a <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style>-meter radius, dealing <style=\"accent-gn\">80%</style> ATK as <style=\"magic\">Attack DMG</style> ignoring Armor to targets marked with <style=\"accent-gn\">Steel Beak</style> inside the storm every <style=\"accent-gn\">0</style>.<style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>. After <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Celestial Eagle</style> dives to the ground, dealing <style=\"accent-gn\">500%</style> ATK as <style=\"magic\">Attack DMG</style> ignoring Armor.","3401150":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> ATK to enemy targets, followed by an additional instance of <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">300%</style> ATK to enemies within 5m.","3401151":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">35%</style> ATK to the enemy (which scales with the Level/Tier of <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack</style>).","3401152":"ATK <style=\"accent-gn\">+5%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>.","3401153":"Target loses HP equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style> ATK per second for <style=\"accent-gn\">8s</style>.","3401154":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Rend</style> DMG <style=\"accent-gn\">+100%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>.","3401155":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Strength</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">+30%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">12s</style>.","3401156":"Luck Effect: Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">150%</style> ATK.","3401157":"DMG of <style=\"accent-gn\">Instant Edge</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">+30%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>. It stacks up to <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> times and 1 stack is consumed after the use of <style=\"accent-gn\">Instant Edge</style>.","3401158":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">350%</style> ATK to the enemies within range.","3401159":"An enhanced version of <style=\"accent-gn\">Sharp Impact</style>. Leaps into the air, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">800%</style> ATK in total to the target and surrounding enemies (which scales with the Level/Tier of <style=\"accent-gn\">Sharp Impact</style>)","3401160":"When Ice Meteor deals DMG, <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Crystal Core</style> fires <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Arrow</style>, granting 1 <style=\"accent-gn\">Frost Crystal</style>.","3401161":"Grants extra effects to certain skills.","3401162":"Deals <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> ATK to the target.","3401163":"Deals <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> ATK to enemies within <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> meters.","3401164":"Throws a <style=\"accent-gn\">Frost Lance</style> that pierces targets, dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">250%</style> ATK.","3401165":"Luck Effect: Summon a <style=\"accent-gn\">Frost Comet</style> from the sky, dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">200%</style> ATK to the enemy.","3401166":"Unleashes a powerful pulse from the Frost Ray, dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">500%</style> ATK to enemies it hits.","3401167":"Gains <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Blade Intent</style> per second. Starts with a Max of <style=\"accent-gn\">100</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Blade Intent</style>. When <style=\"accent-gn\">Blade Intent</style> reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">100</style>, greatly accelerates the using of <style=\"accent-gn\">Iaido Slash</style>. Using <style=\"accent-gn\">Iaido Slash</style> consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">100</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Blade Intent</style>. <style=\"accent-gn\">Blade Intent</style> can also be used as a resource for <style=\"accent-gn\">Thundercut</style>.","3401168":"Enhances <style=\"accent-gn\">Shield</style> effectiveness by <style=\"accent-gn\">3%</style>. The effect lasts <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style> and stacks up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> times.","3401169":"Jumps and deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">400%</style> ATK to enemies within range. Always triggers <style=\"accent-gn\">Weakness Strike</style> (which scales with the Level/Tier of <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack</style>).","3401170":"Grants a chance to <style=\"accent-gn\">block</style> <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> and to reduce it by <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style>.","3401171":"Immobilizes the target and increases Ice DMG taken by <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>. The effect breaks upon taking DMG. Rapidly applying this effect within a short duration will reduce its total duration. Does not affect bosses.","3401172":"Infuses the Shield with light, absorbing <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> of incoming DMG. The effect can stack absorption and reset duration when the Skill is reused. Max absorption cannot exceed <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> of Max HP.","3401173":"Restores HP equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> ATK for allies every <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5s</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>","3401174":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">150%</style> ATK to the enemy.","3401175":"Each stack increases Max HP by <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style>, and <style=\"accent-gn\">Lightforged Barrier</style> stacks up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> times. Any incoming DMG consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack. The effect lasts <style=\"accent-gn\">25s</style> or until all stacks are consumed. Duration resets each time a new stack is gained.","3401176":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">240%</style> ATK to target, which scales with the Level/Tier of <style=\"accent-gn\">Vanguard Strike</style>. When <style=\"accent-gn\">Vanguard Hunt</style> deals DMG, restores <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style> of Max HP and grants <style=\"accent-gn\">Bold Fearless</style>.","3401177":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> ATK and reduces the target's movement speed by <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style>.","3401178":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Melody</style> (Desc)","3401179":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Strength</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">+12%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">8s</style>.","3401180":"Fires a string note at a nearby enemy/ally, dealing DMG/healing equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> of the Beat Performer's MATK.","3401181":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Intellect</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">+5%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">6s</style>.","3401182":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> *stacks of ATK per second for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>.","3401183":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Note</style> (Desc)","3401184":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Soundwave Surge</style>","3401185":"Applies healing to nearby friendly targets, equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> of the Beat Performer's MATK.","3401186":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Sound Barrier</style>","3401187":"Increases DMG dealt by <style=\"accent-gn\">15%</style> and Attack SPD by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">15s</style>.","3401188":"Deals <style=\"accent-gn\">80%</style> ATK <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to enemy targets.","3401189":"Deals <style=\"accent-gn\">300%</style> ATK <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> to enemy targets around self.","3401190":"Deals <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">60%</style> ATK to the enemies within range (which scales with the Level/Tier of <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack</style>).","3401191":"Unleashes a fiery shockwave within a <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style>m radius, dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">350%</style> ATK to enemies hit.","3401192":"Restores HP equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">70%</style> ATK in total within <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>, stacks up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> times. When applied at <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> stacks, it immediately triggers the remaining healing of the previous <style=\"accent-gn\">Note</style>.","3401193":"Each time a damage or healing <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> is cast, there is a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> chance to trigger <style=\"accent-gn\">Encore Strings</style> once, either dealing DMG to the current target or healing the ally with the lowest HP (Party Members Prioritized).","3401194":"Moves and channels for 6s, continuously casting Passion Burst forward.","3401195":"Instantly gains <style=\"accent-gn\">100</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Energy</style> and resets the CD of all healing <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise</style> immediately. Increases MATK by <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>.","3401196":"Raises the Shield and charges forward, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">200%</style> ATK to any enemies hit.","3401197":"Deals <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> ATK to the enemies within range.","3401198":"After <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>, unleashes a burst of Holy <style=\"accent-gn\">Energy</style> around, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">500%</style> of ATK and restoring <style=\"accent-gn\">15%</style> of Max HP.","3401199":"The target takes DMG equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> ATK every second for the next <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>. During this time, each time the target deals DMG to you, there is a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> chance to restore HP equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5%</style> of your Max HP.","3401200":"Luck Effect: Deals Adaptive DMG equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">1375%</style> ATK to enemies within <style=\"accent-gn\">3m</style>, but cannot Crit.","3401201":"Deals Adaptive DMG equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">850%</style> ATK to the enemies within <style=\"accent-gn\">3m</style>, and the Crit DMG reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">500%</style>.","3401202":"Deals Adaptive DMG equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">165%</style> ATK to the enemies within <style=\"accent-gn\">3m</style>.","3401203":"ATK +<style=\"accent-gn\">18</style> per stack (up to +<style=\"accent-gn\">50</style>, scaling with season level).","3401204":"Increases Main Stats by <style=\"accent-gn\">630</style> (up to <style=\"accent-gn\">1,470</style>, scaling with season level). Cannot gain Vestige during the duration.","3401205":"Reduces ATK by <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style>, increases Illusion-Breaking DMG taken by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>, and reduces Movement Speed by <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> (cannot stack).","3401206":"Deals Adaptive DMG equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">200%</style> ATK to enemies within <style=\"accent-gn\">5m</style> and <linktext=3005><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Stuns</style></linktext> them for <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>.<style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>.","3401207":"Immune to death.","3401208":"Deals Adaptive DMG equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">330%</style> Armor to the enemies within <style=\"accent-gn\">5m</style>.","3401209":"Max HP +<style=\"accent-gn\">3%</style>, Mastery +<style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style>, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> stacks.","3401211":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> Attack SPD +<style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style>s, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> times.","3401212":"Grants <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> Fire Bonus for <style=\"accent-gn\">8</style>s.","3401213":"Deals <style=\"accent-gn\">35% × stack count</style> ATK as <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> every <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style>s for <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style>s, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> times. When <style=\"accent-gn\">Burn</style> reaches max stacks, any newly applied <style=\"accent-gn\">Burn</style> immediately deals <style=\"accent-gn\">35%</style> ATK as <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>.","3401214":"Deals <style=\"accent-gn\">800%</style> ATK as <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to enemies in range, and grants <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Flame Soul</style>.","3401215":"Deals <style=\"accent-gn\">500%</style> ATK as <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to enemy targets.","3401216":"Each hit has a chance to add extra stages based on the current skill multiplier * (<style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> + Mastery%): Formless Flame Slash<style=\"accent-gn\"> Stage 1</style> Chance: <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style>. Formless Flame Slash<style=\"accent-gn\"> Stage 2</style> Chance: <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>. Formless Flame Slash<style=\"accent-gn\"> Stage 3</style> Chance: <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style>.","3401217":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">800%</style> of ATK to enemies within range.","3401218":"When taking DMG, if own HP percentage is higher than the attacker's, DMG taken from that attacker is reduced by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>. When dealing DMG, if own HP percentage is higher than the target's, DMG dealt to that target is increased by <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style>.","3403000":"Interrupts the target's casting and puts the interrupted skill on CD. Does not affect bosses.","3403001":"Prevents the enemy from casting spells. Does not affect bosses. This is a debuff.","3403002":"Prevents the enemy from moving. Does not affect bosses. This is a debuff.","3403003":"Reduces the enemy's Move SPD by <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style>.","3403004":"Reduces the amount of healing the enemy receives. This is a debuff.","3403005":"Prevents the enemy from taking any actions. Does not affect bosses. This is a status effect.","3403006":"Prevents the enemy from taking any actions. The effect is removed upon receiving DMG. Does not affect bosses. This is a status effect.","3403007":"Prevents the enemy from taking any actions. The effect is removed upon receiving DMG. Does not affect bosses. This is a status effect.","3403008":"Prevents the enemy from taking any actions. The effect is removed upon receiving DMG. Does not affect bosses. This is a status effect.","3403009":"Forces the enemy to move into melee range of their current target to attack. Does not affect bosses. This is a status effect.","3403010":"The enemy cowers in place in fear. The effect is removed upon receiving DMG. Does not affect bosses. This is a status effect.","3403011":"Reduces the enemy's Move SPD. Does not affect bosses. This is a debuff.","3403012":"Causes the enemy to continuously lose HP. This is a debuff.","3403013":"Causes the enemy to continuously lose HP. This is a debuff.","3403014":"Causes the enemy to continuously lose HP. This is a debuff.","3403020":"Includes <style=\"accent-gn\">Stun</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Frozen</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Petrified</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Paralyzed</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Dazzle</style>, and <style=\"accent-gn\">Fear</style>.","3403021":"Includes <style=\"accent-gn\">Silenced</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Slowed</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Rooted</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Wounded</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Poisoned</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Bleeding</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Burning</style>."},"statDescs":{"illusionPower":"Against Ember season monsters:<br>When own Illusion-Breaking Strength exceeds the enemy's, for every 150 points of advantage, DMG dealt is increased by 5% (up to 20%) and healing done is increased by 2% (up to 8%, active only in Dungeons and near Field Elites and Bosses).<br>When own Illusion-Breaking Strength is lower than the enemy's, DMG dealt and healing are greatly reduced, and DMG taken is greatly increased.<br><br>Against wild monsters from previous seasons:<br>DMG dealt is increased by 100%.<br><br>The threat level can be judged by the color of the icon above monsters. Monster strength can also be viewed in the Monster Manual and Dungeon Info.","crit":"Increases Crit Rate.<br>When dealing damage, there is a chance to land a Crit, causing that instance of damage to be increased by your Crit DMG.","haste":"Increases Attack SPD and Casting SPD","luck":"Increases the chance to trigger Luck effects.<br>When dealing non-persistent DMG or healing with Class Skills, there is a chance to trigger all Luck effects you possess. <br>Basic Lucky Strike Effect: Triggers an additional instance of DMG or healing at a fixed multiplier, which increases as the Luck chance increases. <br>Luck Boost: Every 1% of Luck increases \"Luck effect\" damage and healing by 1%.","mastery":"Grants different attribute bonuses based on class specialization.","versatility":"Each 1% of Versatility increases the percentage bonus for DMG dealt, healing, and Shield granted by 0.35%, and DMG Reduction by 0.15%.","resist":"Increases chance to block enemy attacks.<br>When taking damage, there is a chance to trigger a Block, reducing that instance of DMG by an amount equal to your Block DMG Reduction.","maxHp":"When the character is attacked, HP will decrease, and when it reaches 0, the character is defeated","atk":"The base value for the skill's Attack DMG and healing amount, which is affected by the target's Armor","matk":"The base value for the skill's Magic DMG and healing amount, which is affected by the target's Resistance","strength":"Increases the ATK of Wind Knight, Heavy Guardian, Shield Knight, and Twin Striker Classes. Increases Armor for all Classes","intellect":"Increases the ATK of Frost Mage, Verdant Oracle, and Beat Performer: Increases the Resistance of all Classes","agility":"Increases the ATK of Stormblade and Marksman. Increases Haste for all Classes","endurance":"Increases the Max HP for all Classes"},"textDescs":{"1001":{"name":"Basic Attack","description":"Various weapon attacks using the attack key"},"1002":{"name":"Basic Attack","description":"Basic attack form of the weapon"},"1003":{"name":"Heavy Attack","description":"Heavy attack generated by holding the attack key"},"1004":{"name":"Plunge Attack","description":"Plunge attack performed by executing a Basic Attack at a certain height above the ground"},"1005":{"name":"Core Skills","description":"The most core and well-known signature skill move of the weapon"},"1006":{"name":"Basic Skills","description":"The most commonly used skill moves of the weapon"},"1007":{"name":"Ultimate","description":"The most powerful ultimate combat secret of the weapon"},"1008":{"name":"Talent Skills","description":"Trait skill learned from talent"},"1009":{"name":"Recovery skill","description":"Skill that can be used when being hit and airborne"},"1010":{"name":"Talent Arcane","description":"Powerful skill styles learned through talent"},"1011":{"name":"Damage","description":"Skill can cause damage"},"1012":{"name":"Ability Damage","description":"Damage generated by the skill move itself"},"1013":{"name":"Trait Damage","description":"Additional damage caused by skill-triggered elemental traits"},"1014":{"name":"Healing","description":"Effects that can restore HP"},"1015":{"name":"Healing","description":"Instantly restores a large amount of HP"},"1016":{"name":"Healing","description":"Continuously restores HP over a period of time"},"1017":{"name":"Buff","description":"An effect that can be beneficial to allies in combat"},"1018":{"name":"Blessing","description":"An effect that enhances combat ability, movement ability, or other abilities for a period of time"},"1019":{"name":"Exaltation","description":"An effect that significantly boosts combat ability for a short period of time"},"1020":{"name":"Inspiration","description":"Combat attributes are greatly enhanced, and if developed under talents, additional effects will be added"},"1021":{"name":"Debuff","description":"In various states that are disadvantageous to one's own combat"},"1022":{"name":"Weakness","description":"A detrimental effect that reduces combat attributes for a period of time"},"1023":{"name":"Vulnerability","description":"A detrimental effect that increases damage taken for a period of time"},"1024":{"name":"Fracture","description":"Increases damage taken for a period of time, with additional effects if developed under certain talents"},"1025":{"name":"Control","description":"In a state where various actions are restricted"},"1026":{"name":"Frozen","description":"In a state where movement and any combat actions are impossible"},"1027":{"name":"Bind","description":"In a state where movement is impossible"},"1028":{"name":"Stun","description":"The affected entity is placed under a disabling state in which movement, combat actions, and item usage are entirely restricted. Rapidly applying this effect within a short duration will reduce its total duration. Does not affect bosses."},"1029":{"name":"Slow","description":"In a state of reduced Speed"},"1030":{"name":"Stagger","description":"Ability to break the <style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Super Armor</style> bar of powerful targets."},"1031":{"name":"Displacement","description":"Skills that help characters move quickly"},"1032":{"name":"Sprint","description":"Continuous displacement type skills"},"1033":{"name":"Blink","description":"Non-continuous displacement type skills"},"1034":{"name":"Survival","description":"Skills that can help the character survive"},"1035":{"name":"Shield","description":"Extra HP <style=\"ItemQuality_5\">shield</style>, which can absorb damage before HP."},"1036":{"name":"Block","description":"A special phase of a skill where damage taken is partially mitigated"},"1037":{"name":"Fire Damage","description":"Deals Fire damage"},"1038":{"name":"Fire","description":"Damage with the power of Fire"},"1039":{"name":"Ignite","description":"A debuff state where Fire damage is taken at intervals over a period of time"},"1040":{"name":"Ice damage","description":"Deal Ice damage"},"1041":{"name":"Ice","description":"Damage with the power of Ice"},"1042":{"name":"Thunder damage","description":"Deal Thunder damage"},"1043":{"name":"Thunder","description":"Damage with the power of Thunder"},"1044":{"name":"Wind damage","description":"Deal Wind damage"},"1045":{"name":"Wind","description":"Damage with the power of Wind"},"1046":{"name":"Rock damage","description":"Deal Rock damage"},"1047":{"name":"Rock","description":"Damage with the power of Rock"},"1048":{"name":"Forest Damage","description":"Deal Forest Damage"},"1049":{"name":"Forest","description":"Damage with the power of Forest"},"1050":{"name":"Light damage","description":"Deal Light damage"},"1051":{"name":"Light","description":"Damage with the power of Light"},"1052":{"name":"Dark damage","description":"Deal Dark damage"},"1053":{"name":"Dark","description":"Damage with the power of Dark"},"1054":{"name":"Assist in Battle","description":"Auxiliary effects that can generate additional attack actions or resist offensive actions"},"1055":{"name":"Coordination","description":"Effects that synchronize attack actions with the battle"},"1056":{"name":"Cooperative Battle","description":"Effects that independently perform attacks to assist in combat"},"1057":{"name":"Charging","description":"A skill release method that requires some time to prepare to achieve stronger power"},"1058":{"name":"Channelling","description":"A skill release method that requires maintaining a casting state to continue the effect"},"1059":{"name":"Enhancement","description":"Skills in a state of being enhanced or producing changes"},"1060":{"name":"Charge","description":"Conditions required to release certain skills, which can be replenished over time or through certain mechanisms"},"1061":{"name":"Imprint","description":"A type of effect that can be triggered under specific conditions, with the trigger probability influenced by attributes"},"1062":{"name":"Suppress","description":"A state when one's own HP is higher than the target's HP, providing damage and DMG Reduction bonuses, with additional effects if developed under certain talents"},"1063":{"name":"Summon","description":"A combat unit with a specific summoner, whose state is influenced by the summoner"},"1064":{"name":"Trap","description":"A summon that produces effects after certain conditions are triggered"},"1065":{"name":"Totem","description":"A summon that remains stationary for a period of time and produces effects around it"},"1066":{"name":"Attendant","description":"A summon that can move and follow the summoner to assist in combat"},"1067":{"name":"Construct","description":"A summoned creature with autonomous behavior and awareness"},"1068":{"name":"Projectile","description":"A skill mechanism that can perform physical motion and produce effects upon hitting"},"1069":{"name":"Bullet","description":"A small-sized, fast-moving projectile"},"1070":{"name":"Missile","description":"A large-sized, moderately fast-moving projectile"},"1071":{"name":"Area Effect","description":"Effective method within a specified range"},"1072":{"name":"Domain","description":"Area effect that can continuously provide beneficial status to oneself or allies"},"1073":{"name":"AoE","description":"Area effect that can continuously cause damage or adverse status to enemies"},"1074":{"name":"Aura","description":"Can continuously provide effects to targets within its own range"},"1075":{"name":"Powerful target","description":"Entities far stronger than Monsters"},"1076":{"name":"Boss","description":"Boss, Wild Boss, and World Boss"},"1077":{"name":"Normal monster","description":"monsters active on the continent, generally with basic combat abilities"},"1078":{"name":"Elite","description":"Outstanding warriors among monsters, generally possessing highly threatening Expertise"},"1079":{"name":"Boss","description":"The absolute strong in the group, can be called a king without exaggeration"},"1080":{"name":"Wild Boss","description":"Powerful monsters found only in special territorial areas on the map"},"1081":{"name":"World Boss","description":"The most powerful monster in dungeon maps"},"1082":{"name":"Healthy","description":"Status where HP is not less than 50% of the HP cap"},"1083":{"name":"Injured","description":"Status where HP is not more than 30% of the HP cap"},"1084":{"name":"Scenario Skill","description":"Additional skills obtained through scenarios or level gameplay"},"1085":{"name":"Radiance","description":"A continuous status granted by refining the \"Radiance\" series gear"},"1086":{"name":"Non-elemental damage","description":"Deal non-elemental damage"},"1087":{"name":"Non-elemental","description":"Damage is non-elemental, not carrying elemental power"},"1088":{"name":"Corrosion","description":"Affected by an unknown source of contamination, causing various adverse effects"},"1089":{"name":"Radiance","description":"A continuous status granted by refining the \"Radiance\" series gear"},"1090":{"name":"Exaltation","description":"Has the effect of increasing damage amount"},"1091":{"name":"Super Armor","description":"Cannot be knocked back, knocked airborne, or knocked down."},"1092":{"name":"Taunt","description":"Forcing enemy monsters to attack themselves"},"1093":{"name":"Thorn","description":"Has the effect of reflecting damage"},"1094":{"name":"Debuff","description":"Effects that directly impact a unit's combat ability, such as reduced Speed, lowered attributes, being controlled, etc."},"1095":{"name":"Vulnerability","description":"DMG taken <style=\"accent-gn\">+10%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>."},"1096":{"name":"Piercing Slash","description":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> ATK and allows your next <style=\"accent-gn\">Overdrive</style> to gain <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> extra <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Sigil</style>."},"1097":{"name":"Zen Moment","description":"Greatly accelerates the using of <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>. Effect ends after you launch a <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style>."},"1098":{"name":"Thundercleave","description":"A hidden technique from <style=\"accent-gn\">Thundercut</style>. Performs a rapid rising slash, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">300%</style> ATK (which scales with the Level/Tier of <style=\"accent-gn\">Flurry Slash</style>). Once Attack Speed reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style>|<style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>|<style=\"accent-gn\">80%</style>, your attack count +<style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>|<style=\"accent-gn\">2</style>|<style=\"accent-gn\">3</style>."},"1099":{"name":"Bladewind Domain","description":"Each wave deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> ATK.<br>Starts with <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> wave. Gains <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> extra wave for every <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> Mastery, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">4</style> waves."},"1100":{"name":"Thunderstrike","description":"Luck Effect: Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">80%</style> ATK to the enemy."},"1101":{"name":"MoonBlades","description":"Spin continuously for <style=\"accent-gn\">35s</style>, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> ATK every <style=\"accent-gn\">2s</style> (which scales with the Level/Tier of Scythe Wheel)."},"1102":{"name":"Super Armor","description":"Cannot be knocked back, knocked airborne, or knocked down."},"1103":{"name":"Thunderburst","description":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> ATK to enemies within <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> meters."},"1104":{"name":"Thunder Sigil","description":"When using a Skill that consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Sigils</style>, each additional <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Sigil</style> consumed increases the Skill's DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style>."},"1105":{"name":"Ultimate Slash","description":"Deals massive DMG based on the number of <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Sigils</style> consumed in the past <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>.<br><style=\"accent-gn\">Each</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Sigil</style> consumed deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> ATK, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">15,000%</style>."},"1106":{"name":"Charge Seed","description":"Can accumulate up to <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Charge Seed</style>s. When casting <style=\"accent-gn\">Thundercut</style>, consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">15</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Charge Seed</style>s to trigger <style=\"accent-gn\">Storm Scythe</style>, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to surrounding targets."},"1107":{"name":"Inspiration","description":"Grants the blessed target <style=\"accent-gn\">100</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Intellect</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Strength</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Agility</style>, and <style=\"accent-gn\">Endurance</style>, as well as <style=\"accent-gn\">1.5%</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Crit</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Haste</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Luck</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Mastery</style>, and <style=\"accent-gn\">Versatility</style>."},"1108":{"name":"Regen Bud","description":"When a Healing <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> or <style=\"accent-gn\">Ultimate</style> restores HP, it consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Regen Buds</style> and throws a <style=\"accent-gn\">Nourishing Seed</style>, once every <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> second.<br>When a DMG <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> or <style=\"accent-gn\">Ultimate</style> deals DMG, it consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Regen Buds</style> and fires a <style=\"accent-gn\">Wild Seed</style>, once <style=\"accent-gn\">per</style> second."},"1109":{"name":"Healing Chain","description":"The Healing Chain bounces between allies, restoring HP equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">40%</style> ATK per bounce. Starts with <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> bounces."},"1110":{"name":"Healing Pulse","description":"Spreads outward up to <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style> meters, restoring HP equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">150%</style> ATK to all allies hit."},"1111":{"name":"Nature Shield","description":"Grants an ally a <style=\"accent-gn\">Shield</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">150%</style> ATK for <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>."},"1113":{"name":"Healing Orb","description":"Automatically restores HP equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">60%</style> ATK to allies within <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> meters."},"1114":{"name":"Engram Orb","description":"When within <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> meters of the <style=\"accent-gn\">Engram Orb</style>, gains <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Regen Bud</style>. The <style=\"accent-gn\">Engram Orb</style> lasts up to <style=\"accent-gn\">3s</style>."},"1115":{"name":"Nourishing Seed","description":"When it hits the ground, restores HP equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">40%</style> ATK to all allies."},"1116":{"name":"Wild Seed","description":"Explodes upon contact with an enemy, dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> ATK."},"1117":{"name":"Thorn","description":"Deals <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> ATK per second to the enemy for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>."},"1119":{"name":"Crimson Insight","description":"The next <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> used has its CD -<style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>."},"1120":{"name":"Golden Devotion","description":"After the next cast of a <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style>, increases your Healing by <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>."},"1121":{"name":"Moonlight Solace","description":"The next <style=\"accent-gn\">Life Bloom</style> grants the target a <style=\"accent-gn\">Shield</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">8s</style>, absorbing DMG equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">200%</style> ATK. Targets with the <style=\"accent-gn\">Shield</style> take <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> less DMG from all sources."},"1122":{"name":"Suppress","description":"When taking DMG and your HP percentage is higher than the attacker's, reduces the DMG the attacker deals to you by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>.<br>When dealing DMG and your HP percentage is higher than the target's, increases the DMG you deal to them by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>."},"1123":{"name":"Weakness Strike","description":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> ATK to an enemy and grants <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Sand Crystal</style>."},"1124":{"name":"Amplified Earthfort","description":"Enhances Shield effectiveness by <style=\"accent-gn\">15%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>."},"1125":{"name":"Countercrush","description":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> ATK to enemies within <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> meters, ignores <style=\"accent-gn\">Block</style>, and generates significant Threat."},"1126":{"name":"Lucky Block","description":"When performing a <style=\"accent-gn\">Block</style>, gains a chance to trigger <style=\"accent-gn\">Lucky Block</style> based on Luck percentage."},"1127":{"name":"Shield Combo","description":"For the next <style=\"accent-gn\">7s</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Shield Bash</style> becomes a two-hit combo and costs no <style=\"accent-gn\">Rage</style> or <style=\"accent-gn\">Sand Crystals</style>, while also granting a <style=\"accent-gn\">Shield</style> to yourself. The effect ends after <style=\"accent-gn\">Shield Bash</style> is used."},"1128":{"name":"Shield Echo","description":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">300%</style> ATK to enemies within <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> meters. For the next <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>, recover <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Rage</style> every <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> second. This effect cannot stack."},"1129":{"name":"Survival Instinct","description":"Reduces DMG taken by <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> and increases Healing Received by <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>."},"1130":{"name":"Law of Energy Surge","description":"Restores <style=\"accent-gn\">3%</style> of Max <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Energy</style> per second (scales with Mastery and Haste), lasting for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>."},"1131":{"name":"Granite","description":"Strikes the nearest <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> enemy, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">70%</style> ATK."},"1132":{"name":"Dazzle","description":"Moves forcibly into melee range to strike the target."},"1133":{"name":"Melody","description":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Heroic Melody</style> or <style=\"accent-gn\">Healing Melody</style>"},"1134":{"name":"Terra Sunder","description":"An enhanced version of <style=\"accent-gn\">Rageburst</style> that summons giant rocks around you, which then explode to deal <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">750%</style> ATK (which scales with the Level/Tier of <style=\"accent-gn\">Rage Burst</style>. <br>It does not consume <style=\"accent-gn\">Sand Crystals</style>."},"1135":{"name":"Enraged","description":"DMG dealt <style=\"accent-gn\">+20%</style>, Move SPD <style=\"accent-gn\">+10%</style>, and gains <style=\"accent-gn\">Super Armor</style>."},"1136":{"name":"Sand Crystal Shock","description":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">300%</style> ATK to enemies within <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> meters."},"1137":{"name":"Sandfield","description":"Reduces <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> taken by the caster within the circle by <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>. Allies (up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style>) inside have <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> of the damage they take absorbed directly."},"1138":{"name":"Photon Reforge","description":"When <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style> is full, using a <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style> allows you to enter <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Reforge</style>. In this state, <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attacks</style> and certain <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise</style> are enhanced. <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Reforge</style> gradually depletes, and the state ends when it reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">0</style>."},"1139":{"name":"Tail Sweep","description":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">80%</style> ATK to enemies within <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> meters. For each additional enemy hit, increases the DMG dealt by <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> (up to +<style=\"accent-gn\">120%</style>, which scales with the Level/Tier of <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack</style>)."},"1140":{"name":"Pounce and Bite","description":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> ATK to an enemy and inflicts <style=\"accent-gn\">Bleed</style>."},"1141":{"name":"Bleed","description":"The effect lasts <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> ATK per second. If applied again from the same source before the previous <style=\"accent-gn\">Bleed</style> ends, it deals all remaining DMG of the previous <style=\"accent-gn\">Bleed</style> immediately."},"1142":{"name":"Lightseeker Arrow","description":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> ATK to the enemy."},"1143":{"name":"Lightning Strike","description":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">410%</style> ATK to the enemy."},"1144":{"name":"Explosive Arrow","description":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> ATK to enemies within <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> meters."},"1145":{"name":"Stomp","description":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">250%</style> ATK to the enemies within range."},"1146":{"name":"Legendary Eagle","description":"Flaps wings in place, increasing Photon Energy gain rate by <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> for the next <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style>s."},"1147":{"name":"Legendary Boar","description":"Lets out a fierce howl, increasing Light bonus by <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>."},"1148":{"name":"Steel Beak","description":"When <style=\"accent-gn\">Steel Beak</style> stacks reach <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> or more, each additional <style=\"accent-gn\">Steel Beak</style> stack gained has a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> chance to trigger <style=\"accent-gn\">Implosion</style>, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> ATK to the enemies within range. <style=\"accent-gn\">Steel Beak</style> loses <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack <style=\"accent-gn\">per</style> second and stacks up to <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style> times."},"1149":{"name":"Celestial Eagle","description":"Creates a storm with a <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style>-meter radius, dealing <style=\"accent-gn\">80%</style> ATK as <style=\"magic\">Attack DMG</style> ignoring Armor to targets marked with <style=\"accent-gn\">Steel Beak</style> inside the storm every <style=\"accent-gn\">0</style>.<style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>. After <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Celestial Eagle</style> dives to the ground, dealing <style=\"accent-gn\">500%</style> ATK as <style=\"magic\">Attack DMG</style> ignoring Armor."},"1150":{"name":"Phantom Falcon","description":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">400%</style> ATK to the enemy."},"1151":{"name":"Split Arrow","description":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">35%</style> ATK to the enemy (which scales with the Level/Tier of <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack</style>)."},"1152":{"name":"Sharp","description":"ATK <style=\"accent-gn\">+5%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>."},"1153":{"name":"Rend","description":"Target loses HP equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style> ATK per second for <style=\"accent-gn\">8s</style>."},"1154":{"name":"Rupture","description":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Rend</style> DMG <style=\"accent-gn\">+100%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>."},"1155":{"name":"Vigor Spike","description":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Strength</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">+30%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">12s</style>."},"1156":{"name":"Spear Thrust","description":"Luck Effect: Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">150%</style> ATK."},"1157":{"name":"Chasing Step","description":"DMG of <style=\"accent-gn\">Instant Edge</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">+30%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>. It stacks up to <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> times and 1 stack is consumed after the use of <style=\"accent-gn\">Instant Edge</style>."},"1158":{"name":"Tornado","description":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">350%</style> ATK to the enemies within range."},"1159":{"name":"Typhoon: Sharp Impact","description":"An enhanced version of <style=\"accent-gn\">Sharp Impact</style>. Leaps into the air, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">800%</style> ATK in total to the target and surrounding enemies (which scales with the Level/Tier of <style=\"accent-gn\">Sharp Impact</style>)"},"1160":{"name":"Talent: Shattering Strike","description":"When Ice Meteor deals DMG, <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Crystal Core</style> fires <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Arrow</style>, granting 1 <style=\"accent-gn\">Frost Crystal</style>."},"1161":{"name":"Frost Crystal","description":"Grants extra effects to certain skills."},"1162":{"name":"Icy Bolt","description":"Deals <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> ATK to the target."},"1163":{"name":"Frost Shock","description":"Deals <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> ATK to enemies within <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> meters."},"1164":{"name":"Piercing Ice Lance","description":"Throws a <style=\"accent-gn\">Frost Lance</style> that pierces targets, dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">250%</style> ATK."},"1165":{"name":"Frost Comet","description":"Luck Effect: Summons a <style=\"accent-gn\">Frost Comet</style> from the sky, dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">200%</style> ATK to the enemy."},"1166":{"name":"Cold Pulse","description":"Unleashes a powerful pulse from the Frost Ray, dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">500%</style> ATK to enemies it hits."},"1167":{"name":"Blade Intent","description":"Gains <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Blade Intent</style> per second. Starts with a Max of <style=\"accent-gn\">100</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Blade Intent</style>.<br>When <style=\"accent-gn\">Blade Intent</style> reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">100</style>, greatly accelerates the using of <style=\"accent-gn\">Iaido Slash</style>. Using <style=\"accent-gn\">Iaido Slash</style> consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">100</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Blade Intent</style>.<br><style=\"accent-gn\">Blade Intent</style> can also be used as a resource for <style=\"accent-gn\">Thundercut</style>."},"1168":{"name":"Sandy Shelter","description":"Enhances <style=\"accent-gn\">Shield</style> effectiveness by <style=\"accent-gn\">3%</style>. The effect lasts <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style> and stacks up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> times."},"1169":{"name":"Rageblow","description":"Jumps and deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">400%</style> ATK to enemies within range. Always triggers <style=\"accent-gn\">Weakness Strike</style> (which scales with the Level/Tier of <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack</style>)."},"1170":{"name":"Block","description":"Grants a chance to <style=\"accent-gn\">block</style> <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> and to reduce it by <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style>."},"1171":{"name":"Frozen","description":"Immobilizes the target and increases Ice DMG taken by <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>. The effect breaks upon taking DMG. Rapidly applying this effect within a short duration will reduce its total duration. Does not affect bosses."},"1172":{"name":"Radiant Shield","description":"Infuses the Shield with light, absorbing <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> of incoming DMG. The effect can stack absorption and reset duration when the Skill is reused. Max absorption cannot exceed <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> of Max HP."},"1173":{"name":"Sonic Surge","description":"Restores HP equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> ATK for allies every <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5s</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>"},"1174":{"name":"Radiant Impact","description":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">150%</style> ATK to the enemy."},"1175":{"name":"Lightforged Barrier","description":"Each stack increases Max HP by <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style>, and <style=\"accent-gn\">Lightforged Barrier</style> stacks up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> times. Any incoming DMG consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack. The effect lasts <style=\"accent-gn\">25s</style> or until all stacks are consumed. Duration resets each time a new stack is gained."},"1176":{"name":"Vanguard Hunt","description":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">240%</style> ATK to target, which scales with the Level/Tier of <style=\"accent-gn\">Vanguard Strike</style>. <br>When <style=\"accent-gn\">Vanguard Hunt</style> deals DMG, restores <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style> of Max HP and grants <style=\"accent-gn\">Bold Fearless</style>."},"1177":{"name":"Divine Strike","description":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> ATK and reduces the target's movement speed by <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style>."},"1178":{"name":"Melody","description":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Melody</style> (Desc)"},"1179":{"name":"Tempestrike","description":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Strength</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">+12%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">8s</style>."},"1180":{"name":"Encore","description":"Fires a string note at a nearby enemy/ally, dealing DMG/healing equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> of highest ATK or MATK."},"1181":{"name":"Fiery Passion","description":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Intellect</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">+5%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">6s</style>."},"1182":{"name":"Burn","description":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> *stacks of ATK per second for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>."},"1183":{"name":"Note","description":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Note</style> (Desc)"},"1184":{"name":"Soundwave Surge","description":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Soundwave Surge</style>"},"1185":{"name":"Healing Wave","description":"Applies healing to nearby friendly targets, equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> of the Beat Performer's MATK."},"1186":{"name":"Sound Barrier","description":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Sound Barrier</style>"},"1187":{"name":"Wind Fury","description":"Increases DMG dealt by <style=\"accent-gn\">15%</style> and Attack SPD by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">15s</style>."},"1188":{"name":"Photon Arrow","description":"Deals <style=\"accent-gn\">80%</style> ATK <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to enemy targets."},"1189":{"name":"Verdant Impact","description":"Deals <style=\"accent-gn\">300%</style> ATK <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> to enemy targets around self."},"1190":{"name":"Flame Pillar Blash","description":"Deals <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">60%</style> ATK to the enemies within range (which scales with the Level/Tier of <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack</style>)."},"1191":{"name":"Scorching Impact","description":"Unleashes a fiery shockwave in a <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style>-meter radius around yourself, dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> ATK to enemies hit."},"1192":{"name":"Note","description":"Restores HP equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">35%</style> ATK in total within <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>. When a <style=\"accent-gn\">Note</style> is granted again, it immediately triggers the remaining healing of the previous <style=\"accent-gn\">Note</style>."},"1193":{"name":"Encore Strings","description":"Each time a damage or healing <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> is cast, there is a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> chance to trigger <style=\"accent-gn\">Encore Strings</style> once, either dealing DMG to the current target or healing the ally with the lowest HP (Party Members Prioritized)."},"1194":{"name":"Passion Fury","description":"Moves and channels for 6s, continuously casting Passion Burst forward."},"1195":{"name":"Transcendence","description":"Instantly gains <style=\"accent-gn\">100</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Energy</style> and resets the CD of all healing <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise</style> immediately. Increases MATK by <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>."},"1196":{"name":"Shield Impact","description":"Raises the Shield and charges forward, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">200%</style> ATK to any enemies hit."},"1197":{"name":"Flame Shock","description":"Deals <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> ATK to the enemies within range."},"1198":{"name":"Radiant Core","description":"After <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>, unleashes a burst of Holy <style=\"accent-gn\">Energy</style> around, dealing Attack DMG equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">500%</style> of <style=\"physical\">ATK</style> and restoring <style=\"accent-gn\">15%</style> of Max HP."},"1199":{"name":"Holy Mark","description":"The target takes DMG equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> ATK every second for the next <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>. During this time, each time the target deals DMG to you, there is a fixed <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> chance to restore HP equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5%</style> of your Max HP."},"1200":{"name":"Fantasia Impact","description":"Luck Effect: Deals Adaptive DMG equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">1375%</style> ATK to enemies within <style=\"accent-gn\">3m</style>, but cannot Crit."},"1201":{"name":"Phantom Execution","description":"Deals Adaptive DMG equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">850%</style> ATK to the enemies within <style=\"accent-gn\">3m</style>, and the Crit DMG reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">500%</style>."},"1202":{"name":"Phantom Arrow","description":"Deals Adaptive DMG equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">165%</style> ATK to the enemies within <style=\"accent-gn\">3m</style>."},"1203":{"name":"Mirage Dream","description":"ATK +<style=\"accent-gn\">18</style> per stack (up to +<style=\"accent-gn\">50</style>, scaling with season level)."},"1204":{"name":"Dreamforce","description":"Increases Main Stats by <style=\"accent-gn\">450</style> (up to <style=\"accent-gn\">1050</style>, scaling with season level). Cannot gain Vestige during the duration."},"1205":{"name":"Oblivion","description":"ATK –<style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style>, Dream DMG taken +<style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>, Movement Speed –<style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> (cannot stack)."},"1206":{"name":"Annihilation Strike","description":"Deals Adaptive DMG equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">200%</style> ATK to enemies within <style=\"accent-gn\">5m</style> and <linktext=3005><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Stuns</style></linktext> them for <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>.<style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>."},"1207":{"name":"Near Death","description":"Immune to death."},"1208":{"name":"Shattered Illusion","description":"Deals Adaptive DMG equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">330%</style> Armor to the enemies within <style=\"accent-gn\">5m</style>."},"1209":{"name":"Endless Mind","description":"Max HP +<style=\"accent-gn\">3%</style>, Mastery +<style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style>, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> stacks."},"1210":{"name":"Artisan's Power","description":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> STR/INT/AGI converts to <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> ATK.<br>Every <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> Endurance converts to <style=\"accent-gn\">8</style> Max HP.<br>Every <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Haste converts to <style=\"accent-gn\">0.6%</style> Attack SPD and <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Casting SPD.<br>Every <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Versatility increases outgoing DMG, healing, and shields by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.35%</style> and DMG Reduction by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.15%</style>.<br>Every <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> Mastery converts to a <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5%</style> universal damage bonus."},"1211":{"name":"Infernal Combo.","description":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> Attack SPD +<style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style>s, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> times."},"1212":{"name":"Blaze.","description":"Grants <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> Fire Bonus for <style=\"accent-gn\">8</style>s."},"1213":{"name":"Burn.","description":"Deals <style=\"accent-gn\">35% × stack count</style> ATK as <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> every <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style>s for <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style>s, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> times. When <style=\"accent-gn\">Burn</style> reaches max stacks, any newly applied <style=\"accent-gn\">Burn</style> immediately deals <style=\"accent-gn\">35%</style> ATK as <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>."},"1214":{"name":"Explosion.","description":"Deals <style=\"accent-gn\">800%</style> ATK as <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to enemies in range, and grants <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Flame Soul</style>."},"1215":{"name":"Hellfire Meteor.","description":"Deals <style=\"accent-gn\">500%</style> ATK as <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to enemy targets."},"1216":{"name":"Formless Flame Slash.","description":"Each hit has a chance to add extra stages based on the current skill multiplier:<br>Formless Flame Slash<style=\"accent-gn\"> Stage 1</style> Chance: <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style>.<br>Formless Flame Slash<style=\"accent-gn\"> Stage 2</style> Chance: <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>.<br>Formless Flame Slash<style=\"accent-gn\"> Stage 3</style> Chance: <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style>."},"1217":{"name":"Great Crimson Lotus","description":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">800%</style> of ATK to enemies within range."},"1218":{"name":"Flame Suppression","description":"When taking DMG, if own HP percentage is higher than the attacker's, DMG taken from that attacker is reduced by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>.<br>When dealing DMG, if own HP percentage is higher than the target's, DMG dealt to that target is increased by <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style>."},"1219":{"name":"Ability Conversion","description":"Every <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> STR/INT/AGI converts to <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> ATK.<br>Every <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> Endurance converts to <style=\"accent-gn\">8</style> Max HP.<br><style=\"accent-gn\">Crit %</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Luck %</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Mastery %</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Haste %</style>, and <style=\"accent-gn\">Versatility %</style> lose their original effects and gain a new ability: The skill damage of the current Resonance Skill is guaranteed to Crit, but the Crit DMG is fixed and calculated as the sum of <style=\"accent-gn\">Crit % + Luck % + Mastery % + Haste % + Versatility %</style>."},"1500":{"name":"Iaido Slash","description":"Powers up and delivers a swift forward slash, consuming all <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Sigils</style> to deal <style=\"physical\">Attack Damage</style>. <style=\"accent-gn\">Each</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Sigil</style> consumed boosts DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style>. <br><br><i><style=\"text_third_gray\">\"Everything I see, hear, or sense can be severed.\"</style></i><br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Use when Thunder Sigils reach the max for maximum damage.</style></size>"},"1501":{"name":"Flash Strike","description":"Consumes all <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Sigils</style> to power up and dash forward, slashing all enemies along the path to deal <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>. <style=\"accent-gn\">Each</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Sigil</style> increases DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style>. <br><br><i><style=\"text_third_gray\">\"In a blink of lightning, the blade is already unsheathed.\"</style></i><br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: A core skill of Iaido Slash Spec. Prioritize using it before Iaido Slash. Use when your Thunder Sigils are at their maximum to maximize damage.</style></size>"},"1502":{"name":"Oblivion Combo","description":"A supreme sword technique sharp enough to cut the air itself. Unleashes a flurry of slashes in front, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack Damage</style> to all enemies in range. Grants max <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Sigil</style> and fully restores <style=\"accent-gn\">Blade Intent</style> at the end of the strike.<br><i><style=\"text_third_gray\">\"Heaven's weapon dims even the brightest stars.\"</style></i><br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Cast when Thunder Sigil is empty to quickly charge it. Also effective against multiple targets for massive area damage.</style></size>"},"1503":{"name":"Thundercut","description":"Double lightning-fast Iai Slashes. Inflicts <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> on enemies at the cost of <style=\"accent-gn\">50</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Blade Intent</style>. Once Attack Speed reaches <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style>|<style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>|<style=\"accent-gn\">80%</style>, deals <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>|<style=\"accent-gn\">2</style>|<style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> additional attack(s). If <style=\"accent-gn\">Blade Intent</style> remains after the strike, the skill can be recast. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Core skill of the Spec. Consumes Blade Intent to deal DMG. Release when Blade Intent is at its maximum.</style></size>"},"1504":{"name":"Volt Surge","description":"Enchants the blade with thunderous power. While active, any action that would grant <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Sigils</style> would instantly maxes them out. Also increases ATK and grants <linktext=1102><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Super Armor</style></linktext> for the duration. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Best paired with Overdrive and Talents to rapidly gain and spend Thunder Sigils, unleashing massive DMG within a short window.</style></size>"},"1505":{"name":"Stormflash","description":"Unleashes raging Thunder within, generating <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Blade Intent</style> per second. When in this state, using Expertise Skills that consume <style=\"accent-gn\">Blade Intent</style> triggers a <style=\"accent-gn\">Lightning Strike</style>, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to the current target. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Pair with Thundercut to generate more Thunder strikes. Higher Mastery significantly increases Moonblade DMG for the Moonstrike Spec.</style></size>"},"1506":{"name":"Chaos Breaker","description":"Enhanced <linktext=1507><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Moonstrike</style></linktext>. Throws a devastating thunderous cyclone forward, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">500%</style> ATK to enemies while gaining full <style=\"accent-gn\">Blade Intent</style>. Scales with the Level/Tier of <linktext=1507><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Moonstrike</style></linktext>."},"1507":{"name":"Moonstrike","description":"Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Sigils</style> to dash forward with a spinning blade attack, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to nearby enemies. <style=\"accent-gn\">Moonblades</style> on the field perform a whirling slashing attack, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to surrounding targets. This damage scales with the Level/Tier of <style=\"accent-gn\">Scythe Wheel</style>.<br><i><style=\"text_third_gray\">\"Under the moonlight, I move as one with the shadows.\"</style></i><br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Use when multiple Moonblades exist to trigger as many whirling attacks as possible.</style></size>"},"1508":{"name":"Tidepool","description":"Summons a surging Tidal Vortex at the target location, dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> on impact. Channels for <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style> after casting. Recast to end early.<br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Ultra Cold: Tidepool</style><br>In the <style=\"accent-gn\">Ultra Cold</style> state, the vortex freezes and violently explodes upon ending, dealing higher <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> to all enemies within range.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: You cannot move or cast other skills while channeling. Best paired with allies' AoE skills in coordinated attacks.</style></size>"},"1509":{"name":"Frostbeam","description":"Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">15</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Energy</style> to launch a concentrated ice beam toward the target, dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic Damage</style> to all enemies in its path every <style=\"accent-gn\">0.3s</style>. After dealing DMG <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> instances, the beam attempts to consume additional Ice Energy to sustain itself. Every <style=\"accent-gn\">12</style> Ice Energy extends the beam by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.3s</style> and deals <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> additional instance of DMG. Each time <style=\"accent-gn\">Frostbeam</style> deals DMG, it increases its own DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">8%</style>, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">80%</style>. (Terminates when <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Energy</style> drops below <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style>.)<br><style=\"accent-gn\">Frostbeam</style>'s firing interval is affected by Haste. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Cast when Ice Energy is near maximum capacity for extended beam duration. While firing, use the joystick to make minor positioning adjustments.</style></size>"},"1510":{"name":"Crystal Veil","description":"Casts a slow-moving water orb and gains <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <linktext=1161><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Crystal</style></linktext> immediately, and <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <linktext=1161><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Crystal</style></linktext> every <style=\"accent-gn\">3s</style> thereafter. On impact, the orb's velocity decays. While the aqueous orb persists, it continuously deals <style=\"magic\">Magic Damage</style> to all nearby enemies and applies <linktext=3003><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost</style></linktext> to them. <br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Ultra Cold: Crystal Veil</style><br>While in the <style=\"accent-gn\">Ultra Cold</style> state, the water orb will freeze and violently explode upon ending, dealing higher <style=\"magic\">Magic Damage</style> to all enemies within range. <br><br>This skill holds <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> charges. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: At least one charge shall be maintained at all times unless Ice Energy overflows. It is recommended to maintain two charges before casting the Ultimate, as combining it with Ultra Cold grants bonus DMG.</style></size>"},"1511":{"name":"Meteor Storm","description":"Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Energy</style> to instantly summon 3 <style=\"accent-gn\">Meteor Storms</style> above the target, dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic Damage</style> to the target and surrounding enemies. <br>This skill holds <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> charges. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: This instant-cast DMG skill is best utilized in a highly mobile style of combat to maximize DMG dealt through repeated use.</style></size>"},"1512":{"name":"Frost Lance","description":"Chants for <style=\"accent-gn\">1.4s</style>, then consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Energy</style> to fire a sharp Frost Lance at the target, dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic Damage</style> on impact. <br>Consuming <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <linktext=1161><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Crystal</style></linktext> can skip chanting and increase DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style>. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Cast Frost Lance regularly to avoid wasting excess Energy.</style></size>"},"1513":{"name":"Blizzard","description":"Chants for <style=\"accent-gn\">2.9s</style>, then consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Energy</style> to summon an intense Blizzard at the target location, continuously dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> and applying <linktext=3003><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost</style></linktext> to all enemies within the area. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: This devastating AoE skill is most effective when used against immobilized enemies to maximize DMG dealt.</style></size>"},"1514":{"name":"Frozen Gale","description":"Unleashes built-up cold energy in a violent surge, dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic Damage</style> and inflicting <linktext=1171><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frozen</style></linktext> on nearby enemies.<br>Charging the skill alters both its range and DMG.<br>Tier <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>: Chants for <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>s, targeting an <style=\"accent-gn\">8</style>m frontal cone.<br>Tier <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style>: Chants for <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style>s, targeting an <style=\"accent-gn\">8</style>m frontal cone with <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> increased DMG.<br>Tier <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style>: Chants for <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style>s, targeting an <style=\"accent-gn\">8</style>m frontal cone with <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> increased DMG.<br>When holding <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>/<style=\"accent-gn\">3</style>/<style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> <linktext=1161><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frost Crystal</style></linktext>, the skill will instantly cast at Tier <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>/<style=\"accent-gn\">2</style>/<style=\"accent-gn\">3</style>, skipping the charge time.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: This skill offers both area damage and crowd control. For best results, cast it when you have high Frost Crystal count.</style></size>"},"1515":{"name":"Permafrost","description":"Summons the power of frost, gaining Super Armor for the duration while accumulating <style=\"accent-gn\">6</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Energy</style> per second and increasing <style=\"accent-gn\">Haste</style>. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Increases Attack SPD and Casting SPD. Since this skill generates Ice Energy, don't use it when Ice Energy is about to cap. If you do, burn the Ice Energy quickly afterward.</style></size>"},"1516":{"name":"Glacier Hymn","description":"Summons the ice's blessing to unfold an <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Domain</style>, knocking all enemies back within range. Then summons a comet to strike the targets, dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> and inflicting <linktext=1171><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frozen</style></linktext> on all affected enemies. <br><style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Domain</style><br>Within the Domain, restores <style=\"accent-gn\">220</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Energy</style> over time and gains <style=\"accent-gn\">Ultra Cold</style>. Enemies within the domain are continuously <linktext=3011><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Slowed</style></linktext> until <linktext=1171><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frozen</style></linktext>. <br>While in <style=\"accent-gn\">Ultra Cold</style>, targets are treated as <linktext=1171><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Frozen</style></linktext>. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Don't use this skill when Ice Energy is about to cap. If you do, burn the Ice Energy quickly afterward. Skills enhanced by the Ultra Cold state are most effective when cast within this skill's duration.</style></size>"},"1517":{"name":"Gale Thrust","description":"Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">50</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Courage</style> to perform <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> thrusts toward the enemy, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> with each hit.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Time casts carefully, and use this skill between Basic Attacks, as Courage takes time to accumulate.</style></size>"},"1518":{"name":"Valor Cyclone","description":"Converts <style=\"accent-gn\">Courage</style> into a sustained wind field, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to nearby enemies until <style=\"accent-gn\">Courage</style> runs out, using <style=\"accent-gn\">16</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Courage</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">per</style> second. The skill may be deactivated by clicking again. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Cast at full Courage and regain Courage during Valor Cyclone to extend duration.</style></size>"},"1519":{"name":"Instant Edge","description":"Consumes 2 stacks of <style=\"accent-gn\">Sharp</style> to leap into the air and deliver a powerful aerial strike, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Combo with Skyward Spec. Cast when Courage is low to prevent overcapping and wasting Courage regeneration.</style></size>"},"1520":{"name":"Skyfall","description":"Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">35</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Courage</style> to leap into the air and deliver a downward strike on the enemy, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>.<br><i><style=\"text_third_gray\">\"Even if enemy lines are unbreakable, the wind of victory will tear them asunder!\"</style></i><br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Cast when Courage is near cap. When casting in succession, the leap is skipped for faster follow-up attacks.</style></size>"},"1521":{"name":"Sharp Impact","description":"Leaps into the air and crashes down, dealing massive <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to the target and surrounding enemies. <style=\"accent-gn\">Each</style> stack of <style=\"accent-gn\">Sharp</style> consumed charges the skill for <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style>.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Sharp Impact deals massive DMG. Consume as much Sharp as possible within a fixed time window to maximize DMG.</style></size>"},"1522":{"name":"Breach Pursuit","description":"Lunges toward the enemy, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> and gaining <style=\"accent-gn\">15</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Courage</style>. Can be cast again to unleash a sweeping slash, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to all nearby enemies and knocking them <style=\"physical\">Airborne</style>. Targets with Resilience cannot be knocked airborne but will have their Resilience reduced. Additionally, gains <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Courage</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">each</style> enemy hit, up to a maximum of <style=\"accent-gn\">50</style> Courage.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Equip when facing multiple enemies.</style></size>"},"1523":{"name":"Spiral Thrust","description":"Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">30</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Courage</style> to reel in the spinning lance and unleash a final piercing strike. The spiraling gust tears through the air, dealing sustained <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to enemies within range. The initial strike inflicts a <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style><style=\"accent-gn\"> <linktext=3004><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Wound</style></linktext> on the target, lasting <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Whenever you have enough Courage, use it on your most important skill.</style></size>"},"1524":{"name":"Falcon Toss","description":"Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">40</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Courage</style> to leap into the air and hurl a wind-forged spear with force. Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to all enemies in range and greatly reduces their Resilience. Grants 1 stack of <style=\"accent-gn\">Sharp</style>.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Effective against enemies with Resilience. Also recommended when dealing with multiple targets.</style></size>"},"1525":{"name":"Typhoon Cleave","description":"Launches into enemy lines, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to enemies in range and knocking them <style=\"accent-gn\">Airborne</style>. Restores <style=\"accent-gn\">100</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Courage</style>.<br><i><style=\"text_third_gray\"><br>\"Endless storm, unlock thy mighty power at my knight's command! Wind, reveal thy glory with a surging rush!\"</style></i><br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Cast when Courage is low.</style></size>"},"1526":{"name":"Wild Bloom","description":"Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Energy</style> to summon a giant vine that strikes a target area, dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> and <style=\"accent-gn\">healing</style> the caster and the nearby ally with the lowest HP (Party Members Prioritized). Healing grows with MATK.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Use on demand in emergencies. For better results, pair with offensive skills to trigger Symbiotic Marks and boost effectiveness.</style></size>"},"1527":{"name":"Life Bloom","description":"Chants for <style=\"accent-gn\">1.8s</style>, then consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">30</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Energy</style> to <style=\"accent-gn\">heal</style> the caster and up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> nearby allies (Party Members Prioritized). Healing grows with MATK.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: In emergencies, cast repeatedly for fast healing. Otherwise, use Basic Attacks to stack Regen Buds, boosting Bloom's healing.</style></size>"},"1528":{"name":"Nourish","description":"Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Energy</style> to imbue the caster and up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> nearby allies (prioritizing teammates) with the forest power for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">healing</style> them every second (Interval affected by Haste).<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Cast after combat begins to provide steady team-wide healing over time.</style></size>"},"1529":{"name":"Feral Seed","description":"Summons a seed to strike enemies, dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> and reducing their Move SPD by <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style>. While dealing DMG, the seed restores a total of <style=\"accent-gn\">30</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Energy</style>. <br>This skill holds <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> charges. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Casting is advised when Energy is low.</style></size>"},"1530":{"name":"Infusion","description":"Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">30</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Energy</style> to channel a seed barrage for <style=\"accent-gn\">5.9s</style>, dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> to enemies. You can move while channeling.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Great for solo play or filling DMG gaps.</style></size>"},"1531":{"name":"Divine Circle Bloom","description":"Creates a barrier using the forest power. When the barrier forms, it continuously deals <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> to nearby enemies. The caster and up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> nearby allies receive <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style> DMG Reduction and HOT while inside the barrier.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Great for easing pressure on the party. Cast before incoming DMG. Requires solid timing awareness.</style></size>"},"1532":{"name":"Regen Pulse","description":"Chants for <style=\"accent-gn\">2.3s</style>, then consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">40</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Energy</style> to release a pulse from the caster. The pulse <style=\"accent-gn\">heals</style> the caster and all affected allies.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: In AoE-heavy healing encounters, use this skill carefully to avoid wasting its dispel and putting it on CD too early.</style></size>"},"1533":{"name":"Blossom Charge","description":"Unleashes vines, inflicting <linktext=3005><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Stun</style></linktext> on surrounding enemies while dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style>, and restoring HP to friendly targets around you. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: This is an instant cast skill. Paired with Lifebind Spec talents, it provides good damaging and healing capabilities in combats requiring continuous movement.</style></size>"},"1534":{"name":"Grove Wish","description":"Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">40</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Energy</style> to channel the power of forest for <style=\"accent-gn\">4s</style>, healing the caster and up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> nearby allies over time (party members prioritized). Healing scales with the caster's MATK (plus an additional fixed amount equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">15%</style> of the target's Max HP), and healing targets also gain <style=\"accent-gn\">15%</style> All Element Resistance for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: A strong healing skill for high-pressure moments. Since it requires channeling, time your cast carefully.</style></size>"},"1535":{"name":"Nature Ward","description":"Grants a <style=\"accent-gn\">Nature Shield</style> to the caster and up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> nearby allies.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Great for high-pressure moments, helping stabilize the party. Pairs well with Smite Spec Talents for healing allies.</style></size>"},"1536":{"name":"Cracking Echo","description":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Cracking Echo</style><br>Unleashes the Power of Rock, instantly dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> in a large area in the front and <linktext=3005><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">stunning</style></linktext> enemies for 3s, then condenses energy to immediately gain <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Sand Crystals</style>. Also puts the caster into <style=\"accent-gn\">Rock's Fury</style> state.<br><style=\"accent-gn\">Rock's Fury</style><br>Lasts for<style=\"accent-gn\">8s</style>, grants <linktext=1091><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Super Armor</style></linktext>, increases Armor by <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> and Max HP by <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>, and grants <style=\"accent-gn\">40</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Rage</style> over time.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Use when facing extremely heavy incoming DMG.</style></size>"},"1537":{"name":"Star Shatter","description":"Charges ahead with immense force. Upon hit, gains <style=\"accent-gn\">25</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Rage</style> and <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Sand Crystal</style>, deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>, and <linktext=3005><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">stuns</style></linktext> the enemy. Becomes <style=\"accent-gn\">unstoppable</style> during the execution of the charge. <br>This skill holds <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> charges. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: This skill enhances mobility and accumulates Rage quickly.</style></size>"},"1538":{"name":"Countercrush","description":"Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">40</style> points of <style=\"accent-gn\">Rage</style>, violently slams down the weapon, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to surrounding enemies, and enters the <style=\"accent-gn\">Countercrush</style> state. During this time, Block Chance +<style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style>, <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> taken from blocks -<style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style>. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Very effective in environments with mostly Attack DMG. After casting, the block chance increases, reliably reducing Attack DMG taken.</style></size>"},"1539":{"name":"Granite Fury","description":"Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Sand Crystals</style>, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to the target and reducing DMG taken by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> for the next <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style> (non-stackable).<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: When you have enough Sand Crystals, a good use of Granite Fury delivers high DMG and ensures high chances of survival.</style></size>"},"1540":{"name":"Shield Bash","description":"Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">40</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Rage</style> to unleash a powerful shockwave that deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to all nearby enemies. When sufficient <style=\"accent-gn\">Sand Crystal</style> is available, <style=\"accent-gn\">it</style> is consumed to generate a <linktext=1035><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Shield</style></linktext> that absorbs all incoming DMG, lasting for <style=\"accent-gn\">12s</style>. For <style=\"accent-gn\">each</style> additional <style=\"accent-gn\">Sand Crystal</style> consumed, additional shield value is added, with a maximum of <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Sand Crystals</style> consumed at a time. (Shields can stack, but cannot exceed <style=\"accent-gn\">150%</style> of Max HP.)<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Casting is recommended when no shield is active to ensure continuous shield uptime.</style></size>"},"1541":{"name":"Sandshroud","description":"Gathers sand around yourself, dealing a burst of <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to surrounding enemies. The sand then solidifies, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to surrounding enemies <style=\"accent-gn\">every second</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">6s</style>. Throughout this effect, continuously regenerates <style=\"accent-gn\">Rage</style> and <style=\"accent-gn\">Sand Crystal</style>, providing <style=\"accent-gn\">33</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Rage</style> and <style=\"accent-gn\">6</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Sand Crystals</style>. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Keep it active as often as possible. The continuous AoE DMG poses a great threat to the enemies while generating Rage quickly.</style></size>"},"1542":{"name":"Stoneform","description":"Channels the power of sandstone, automatically countering <style=\"accent-gn\">Lethal Skills</style> for the next <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>, while increasing <style=\"accent-gn\">Armor</style> and reducing DMG taken by <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style>.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Use in high-pressure battles to greatly improve survival.</style></size>"},"1543":{"name":"Brave Bastion","description":"Creates a rocky barrier around yourself, automatically countering <style=\"accent-gn\">Lethal Skills</style> for a period of time and increasing <style=\"accent-gn\">Block DMG Reduction</style>. <style=\"accent-gn\">Each</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Sand Crystal</style> consumed extends the duration by <style=\"accent-gn\">1s</style> (up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>).<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Time carefully and use it during massive incoming Attack DMG to maximize Block DMG Reduction and minimize DMG taken.</style></size>"},"1544":{"name":"Rage Burst","description":"Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">50</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Rage</style> and <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Sand Crystals</style>. Unleashes a mighty roar, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to nearby enemies, <linktext=3000><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">interrupting</style></linktext> their actions, and granting an all-DMG-absorbing <linktext=1035><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Shield</style></linktext>. (Shields may be stacked, with a maximum capacity equivalent to <style=\"accent-gn\">150%</style> of maximum HP.) Reduces <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> taken from the target by <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> for <style=\"accent-gn\">12s</style>. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Provides damaging capabilities when survival pressure is minimal and grants greater Armor in situations where enemies predominantly inflict Attack DMG.</style></size>"},"1545":{"name":"Surging Shot","description":"Slides sideways and quickly shoots <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> arrows, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>.<br>In <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Reforge</style> state, <style=\"accent-gn\">Double Arrow</style> evolves into <style=\"accent-gn\">Quadraflare</style>, leaping into the air and firing <style=\"accent-gn\">4</style> empowered arrows that deal high Attack DMG with doubled critical rate.<br>This skill holds <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> charges.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Keep an eye on the Photon Reforge state and use ​Quadraflare​ at the right moment.</style></size>"},"1546":{"name":"Luminary Bolt","description":"Concentrates Photon Energy and fires a massive arrow toward enemies. <br>Upon impact with an enemy or reaching maximum range, the arrow explodes, dealing continuous <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to all enemies in the blast area, creating a gravity effect, and inflicting <style=\"accent-gn\">Vulnerability</style> and <linktext=3002><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Rooted</style></linktext>. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: An excellent crowd-control skill that can be decisive in multi-target engagements.</style></size>"},"1547":{"name":"Double Arrow","description":"Slides sideways and quickly shoots <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> arrows, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>.<br>In <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Reforge</style> state, <style=\"accent-gn\">Double Arrow</style> evolves into <style=\"accent-gn\">Quadraflare</style>, leaping into the air and firing <style=\"accent-gn\">4</style> empowered arrows that deal high Attack DMG with doubled critical rate.<br>This skill holds <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> charges.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Keep an eye on the Photon Reforge state and use ​Quadraflare​ at the right moment.</style></size>"},"1548":{"name":"Blast Shot","description":"Fires an <style=\"accent-gn\">Explosive Arrow</style> at the target that detonates on impact. The <style=\"accent-gn\">Explosive Arrow</style> deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to all nearby enemies. <br>Each time when a <style=\"accent-gn\">Class Skill</style> deals Crit DMG, <style=\"accent-gn\">Explosive Arrow</style> gains <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> charge. At <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> charges or after <style=\"accent-gn\">6s</style>, the <style=\"accent-gn\">Explosive Arrow</style> explodes, <style=\"accent-gn\">each</style> charge increases the DMG of <style=\"accent-gn\">Explosive Arrow</style> by <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style>. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Better paired with Falconry Spec. Focus on Crit DMG to power up the explosion.</style></size>"},"1549":{"name":"Wildcall","description":"Summons a powerful combat Companion to provide assistance in battle. <br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Summon Wild Wolf</style>: The summoned Wild Wolf pounces on the current target, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to the target and nearby enemies, then joins the battle for <style=\"accent-gn\">20s</style> before disappearing. <br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Summon Falcon</style>: The summoned Falcon dives in a straight line, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to all enemies in its path before disappearing. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Boosts the number of active Companions during the battle. Casting is recommended when all buffs are prepared to ensure maximum efficiency.</style></size>"},"1550":{"name":"Arrow Rain","description":"Fires a rain of arrows over a target area, dealing continuous <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>. Grants <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style> upon cast, plus <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> additional <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style> per enemy hit, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> extra.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: The more enemies hit, the more energy you gain.</style></size>"},"1551":{"name":"Vital Surge","description":"Immediately resets the CD of Healing <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style>s and grants <style=\"accent-gn\">50</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Energy</style>. While active, surrounds you with verdant energy, increasing ATK, reducing skill <style=\"accent-gn\">Energy</style> costs, and each <linktext=1527><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Life Bloom</style></linktext> cast shortens the remaining CD of Healing <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style>s."},"1552":{"name":"Bloomheal","description":"Channels for <style=\"accent-gn\">6</style>s, summoning falling seeds every 0.5s to deal <style=\"magic\">magic dmg</style> to nearby enemies. At the same time, heals up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> nearby allies (prioritizing teammates) and grants them <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style> DMG Reduction."},"1553":{"name":"Galeform","description":"Stuns enemies in front upon casting, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>. While active, continuously restores <style=\"accent-gn\">105</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Courage</style> and increases your Strength.<br>This skill holds <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> charges.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Cast when Courage is low.</style></size>"},"1554":{"name":"Raijin Dash","description":"Consumes all <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Sigils</style> to release slashes across a wide area, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>. <style=\"accent-gn\">Each</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Sigil</style> increases DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style>. Grants <style=\"accent-gn\">immunity to all DMG</style> while slashing. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: A core skill of Iaido Slash Spec. Use when facing 3 or more targets and your Thunder Sigils are at their maximum to maximize damage.</style></size>"},"1555":{"name":"Focus","description":"Enters Focus state, greatly increasing Haste and reducing the CD of Special Attacks by <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Best paired with Falconry Spec. Use it just before activating Photon Reforge for maximum uptime.</style></size>"},"1556":{"name":"Overdrive","description":"Unleashes the power of tachi and shifts its form into a scythe, each attack dealing increased <style=\"physical\">Attack Damage</style> and granting <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Sigil</style>.<br>This skill holds <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> charges.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Always keep at least one charge regenerating without overflowing Thunder Sigils.</style></size>"},"1557":{"name":"Quadraflare","description":"Slides sideways and quickly shoots <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> arrows, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>.<br>In <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Reforge</style> state, <style=\"accent-gn\">Double Arrow</style> evolves into <style=\"accent-gn\">Quadraflare</style>, leaping into the air and firing <style=\"accent-gn\">4</style> empowered arrows that deal high Attack DMG with doubled critical rate.<br>This skill holds <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> charges.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Keep an eye on the Photon Reforge state and use ​Quadraflare​ at the right moment.</style></size>"},"1558":{"name":"Maelstrom","description":"Unleashes a water vortex at the target's feet, continuously dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> to enemies within range. For <style=\"accent-gn\">each</style> target hit, restores <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Energy</style>, up to 10 <style=\"accent-gn\">Ice Energy</style> per hit. <br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Ultra Cold: ​Maelstrom​</style><br>While in the <style=\"accent-gn\">Ultra Cold</style> state, the water vortex will freeze and explode upon ending, dealing higher <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> to all enemies within range. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Pair with Frostbeam Spec. Casting at the right moment can restore considerable Ice Energy.</style></size>"},"1559":{"name":"Sacred Blade","description":"Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Holy Sigils</style>, summoning a sword from beneath the target's feet to deal <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to the target, while gaining <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> stacks of <style=\"accent-gn\">Lightforged Barrier</style>.<br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Lightforged Barrier</style>: Each stack increases the final Max HP by <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style>. You can have up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> stacks of Lightforged Barrier, and any damage taken will consume <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack. It lasts for <style=\"accent-gn\">25s</style> or until all stacks are consumed, and the duration resets each time a stack is gained.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: While having considerable damage capability, it can efficiently replenish Lightforged Barrier.</style></size>"},"1560":{"name":"Divine Circle","description":"Creates a holy zone beneath your feet, healing yourself <style=\"accent-gn\">every</style> second and healing allies in the area slightly, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to enemies.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Great for sustained DMG and healing. Try to cover as much area as possible.</style></size>"},"1561":{"name":"Valor Bash","description":"Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Holy Sigil</style> to deliver a powerful shield bash to enemies in front, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> and increasing your Armor, stacking up to <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> times.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Monitor the Armor buff from Valor Bash and try to keep it active at all times.</style></size>"},"1562":{"name":"Shield Toss","description":"Spins and throws a shield, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to enemies hit, <linktext=3000><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">interrupting</style></linktext> them, and reducing all DMG they deal to the caster for the next <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: While improving survivability, it performs well in multi-target situations with its wide-area DMG. Cast it according to your survival conditions or the battle environment.</style></size>"},"1563":{"name":"Reckoning","description":"Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Holy Sigils</style>. Performs a fiery blade strike at all nearby enemies, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Powerful offensive skill. Use when survivability is not an issue.</style></size>"},"1564":{"name":"Judgment","description":"Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">45</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style> to call down a blast of holy light on the target area, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> and healing yourself based on HP lost (minimum heal: <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style> of Max HP).<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Cast when your HP is low—but not critically low—to maximize healing while staying safe.</style></size>"},"1565":{"name":"Aegis Ward","description":"Summons Aegis Ward to shield yourself, automatically countering <style=\"accent-gn\">Lethal Skills</style> while increasing <style=\"accent-gn\">Armor</style> and <style=\"accent-gn\">DMG Reduction</style>. If you take lethal DMG while this effect is active, the effect is consumed to prevent death and immediately restore <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">HP</style>. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Powerful Resistance effect combined with death prevention, extremely valuable when facing extreme survival threats.</style></size>"},"1566":{"name":"Vanguard Strike","description":"Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Holy Sigil</style>. After a brief charge, performs a fierce sweep forward, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> and gaining <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> stacks of <style=\"accent-gn\">Lightforged Barrier</style>.<br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Lightforged Barrier</style>: Each stack increases max HP by <style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style>, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> stacks. Taking any DMG consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack. The Barrier lasts <style=\"accent-gn\">25s</style> or until all stacks are consumed. Gaining a new stack refreshes the duration.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Maintain high stacks of Lightforged Barrier while weaving in attacks. Pay attention to the use of Vanguard Hunt to trigger bonus effects.</style></size>"},"1567":{"name":"Zeal Crusade","description":"Consumes up to <style=\"accent-gn\">8</style> stacks of <style=\"accent-gn\">Lightforged Barrier</style>, summoning continuous radiant energy to spiral rapidly around you. <style=\"accent-gn\">Each</style> second, it deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to nearby enemies (interval affected by Attack Speed) and grants <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack of <style=\"accent-gn\">Lightforged Barrier</style>. <br>Each time it deals DMG to <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> target, restores <style=\"accent-gn\">1%</style> max HP (up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style>). When activated, <style=\"accent-gn\">each</style> stack of <style=\"accent-gn\">Lightforged Barrier</style> adds <style=\"accent-gn\">2s</style> to the duration, up to a maximum of <style=\"accent-gn\">16s</style>. <br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Lightforged Barrier</style>: Max HP +<style=\"accent-gn\">2%</style> with each stack. Lightforged Barrier stacks up to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> times. Any incoming DMG consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack. The effect lasts <style=\"accent-gn\">25s</style> or until all stacks are consumed. Duration resets each time a new stack is gained. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Cast Lightforged Barrier to deal DMG and heal. Cast the skill when Lightforged Barrier is fully stacked to achieve excellent defense and burst potential.</style></size>"},"1568":{"name":"Radiance","description":"Gains unwavering resolve and throws <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> shields at the enemies within <style=\"accent-gn\">10m</style> (closest first), dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> and <linktext=3000><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">interrupting</style></linktext> them. Afterward, throws <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> time every <style=\"accent-gn\">2s</style> and gains <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style> each time. For the next <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>, each instance of damage taken is reduced by a percentage of the caster's Max HP, and the caster automatically counters <style=\"accent-gn\">Lethal Skill</style>. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: This skill requires no Photon Energy or Holy Sigil to cast and provides solid survivability, making it suitable as an opener.</style></size>"},"1569":{"name":"Stirring Melody","description":"A soothing melody. When <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Energy</style> exceeds <style=\"accent-gn\">15</style>, you can start the performance freely and stop at will. Each time you start, a <style=\"accent-gn\">speaker</style> is deployed to perform a Concerto. (<style=\"accent-gn\">Speaker</style> disappears when <style=\"accent-gn\">Healing Melody</style> ends.) CD: <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>. <br>While performing <style=\"accent-gn\">Healing Melody</style>, consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Energy</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">per</style> second, and heals <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> allies every <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> second (Interval affected by Haste). <br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Speaker</style>: When you cast <style=\"accent-gn\">Healing Beat</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Fivefold Crescendo</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Rock the Stage</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Concert Circuit</style>, the <style=\"accent-gn\">speaker</style> will simultaneously cast the same skill.<br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Energy</style>: Required to play Melody skills (<style=\"accent-gn\">Heroic Melody</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Healing Melody</style>). Regenerates <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> point <style=\"accent-gn\">per</style> second. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Mastering where and when to place the speaker is essential.</size></style>"},"1570":{"name":"Thermal Surge","description":"Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style> to swing your guitar with force, dealing heavy <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> to enemies. <br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style>: Required to perform music. Regenerates <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack every <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: High coverage healing skill. Use it before your Performance Passion overflows.</size></style>"},"1571":{"name":"Rhythm Vortex","description":"Leaps high and slams your guitar into the ground to burst sparks, dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> to the enemies within range. <br>Each instance of DMG dealt by Amplified Beat (only once per multi-target hit) increases the hit count of <style=\"accent-gn\">Harmonic Anthem</style> by <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style>. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Master the Amplified Beat's mechanic of increasing hit count to boost Harmonic Anthem's Attack.</size></style>"},"1572":{"name":"Passionate Slide","description":"Increases your <style=\"accent-gn\">MATK</style> for a period of time and amplifies the next skill you cast. <br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style>: Your next <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> Special Attacks do not consume <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style>. <br><linktext=1607><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Fivefold Crescendo</style></linktext>: Doubles the healing instances. <br><linktext=1614><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Heroic Melody</style></linktext>: Halves the time needed to trigger <linktext=1615><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Fierce Strike</style></linktext>. <br><linktext=1605><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Harmonic Anthem</style></linktext>: Doubles the DMG dealt. <br><linktext=1608><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Passion Burst</style></linktext>: Allows for direct cast in its strongest form, no chanting required. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Evaluate the battle environment and your combat style, then apply the appropriate enhancement at the optimal moment.</size></style>"},"1573":{"name":"Full Firepower","description":"A rousing melody. When <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Energy</style> exceeds <style=\"accent-gn\">15</style> stacks, you can begin the performance, which cannot be stopped once started. CD: <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>. <br>While performing <style=\"accent-gn\">Heroic Melody</style>, you consume <style=\"accent-gn\">6</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Energy</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">per</style> second, and every <style=\"accent-gn\">3s</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> allies restore HP (Interval affected by Haste). <br>While you perform <style=\"accent-gn\">Heroic Melody</style>, every <style=\"accent-gn\">7s</style>, your <style=\"accent-gn\">String Strike</style> transforms into <linktext=1615><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Fierce Strike</style></linktext>. <br>While you perform <style=\"accent-gn\">Heroic Melody</style>, the conversion rate of <style=\"accent-gn\">Peaceful Tune</style> +<style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>. <br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Energy</style>: Required to play Melody skills (<style=\"accent-gn\">Heroic Melody</style> and <style=\"accent-gn\">Healing Melody</style>). <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> point of energy is regenerated <style=\"accent-gn\">per</style> second. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: The skill can't be stopped manually, so time its activation wisely to maximize synergy with Peaceful Tune and Fierce Strike.</size></style>"},"1574":{"name":"Vitality Revival","description":"Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> stacks of <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style> to play a tune that heals the caster and the nearby ally with the lowest HP (party members prioritized). The healing amount scales with the caster's MATK (plus an additional fixed heal equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">3%</style> of the target's Max HP).<br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style>: Required to perform music. <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> point is regenerated every <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: A healing skill with high uptime. Cast it to avoid letting Performance Passion overflow.</size></style>"},"1575":{"name":"Blooming Melody","description":"The perfect piece for fan interaction. Grants <style=\"accent-gn\">Encore</style> effect to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> allies for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>. <br><style=\"accent-gn\">Encore</style>: Grants <style=\"accent-gn\">Super Armor</style>. Each time an offensive or healing <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> is cast, there is a <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> fixed chance to trigger <style=\"accent-gn\">Encore Strings</style> once, dealing DMG to the current target or healing the lowest-HP ally. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Cast during your team's burst window for optimal DMG and healing of Encore.</size></style>"},"1576":{"name":"Passionate Rhapsody","description":"Let the passion surge again! Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style>, reigniting the spirits of the weary. Performs a sequence of notes that restores HP to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> allies within range (prioritizing teammates) and grants Tenacity Chord. Each stack of Tenacity Chord additionally increases Max HP by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5%</style> (up to <style=\"accent-gn\">2.5%</style> Max HP) for <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style>s (duration cannot be refreshed once 5 stacks are reached).<br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style>: Required to perform music. Regenerates <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack every <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Highest healing potential. Monitor your team's health to maximize efficiency and prevent overhealing.</size></style>"},"1577":{"name":"Healing Sound Wave","description":"My Passion Still Burns! Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> stacks of <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style> to summon a randomly shaped graffiti on the ground, healing <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> allies (party members prioritized) and dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> to the enemies within range.<br>While standing within the graffiti, the caster gains <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> Fire Bonus.<br>Only 1 graffiti can exist at a time.<br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style>: Required to perform music. <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> point is regenerated every <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: This skill has the widest range for both healing and DMG. Cast it once the CD ends for max effectiveness.</size></style>"},"1578":{"name":"Explosive Note","description":"Strums the strings and releases searing flames forward, dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> to the enemies within range.<br>Charging alters the skill's range and DMG.<br><style=\"accent-gn\">Tier 1</style>: Chants for <style=\"accent-gn\">0.7s</style>, targeting a fan-shaped area with an <style=\"accent-gn\">8</style>-meter radius in front.<br><style=\"accent-gn\">Tier 2</style>: Chants for <style=\"accent-gn\">1.4s</style>, targeting a fan-shaped area with an <style=\"accent-gn\">8</style>-meter radius in front and increasing DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>.<br><style=\"accent-gn\">Tier 3</style>: Chants for <style=\"accent-gn\">2.1s</style>, targeting a fan-shaped area with an <style=\"accent-gn\">8</style>-meter radius in front and increasing DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style>.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: High DMG skill. Combine with Talent effects and the amplifier for strong DMG and healing. Be mindful of environmental safety during casting.</size></style>"},"1579":{"name":"Rock the Stage","description":"As a passionate music lover, your impromptu performance immediately grants <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style>. It also heals nearby allies and gives them a <style=\"accent-gn\">Shield</style> that lasts for <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style>s, while dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> to nearby enemies.<br><style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style>: Required to perform music. Regenerates <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack every <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style>s.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: In emergencies, this powerful shield can ease the team's survival pressure. Time the cast carefully.</size></style>"},"1580":{"name":"Torrent Volley","description":"Continuously draws bow to launch a barrage of arrows at enemies, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>. Recast to end early.<br><style=\"accent-gn\">While in Photon Reforge</style> state, Photon Energy consumption stops until the next Special Attack cast and hitting enemies recovers up to <style=\"accent-gn\">42</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style>.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Cast during Photon Reforge state to pause Photon Energy consumption and regenerate Photon Energy.</style></size>"},"1581":{"name":"Radiance Barrage","description":"Charges and fires Photon Arrows to a target area, dealing continuous <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>. The damage interval scales with Attack SPD. <br>While in <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Reforge</style> state, Photon Arrows consume no Photon Energy, generate extra arrows, and deal <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> more <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style>. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Casting during Photon Reforge increases its damage and consumes no Photon Energy.</style></size>"},"1582":{"name":"Powerdraw","description":"Charges and then fires a piercing arrow that deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> and <style=\"accent-gn\">Knockback</style> to all enemies in its path. Cannot knock back targets with Resilience, but reduces targets' Resilience. <style=\"accent-gn\">Powerdraw</style> deals a bonus <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> Crit DMG.<br>This skill holds <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> charges.<br>No charge time required when in <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Reforge</style> state.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Great for reducing enemies' Resilience while dealing area damage.</style></size>"},"1583":{"name":"Fast Growth","description":"Applies an acceleration effect to the caster. Increases MATK and reduces CD while active.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Cast when other skills are on CD .</style></size>"},"1584":{"name":"Dracoflash","description":"Enhanced <linktext=1501><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Flash Strike</style></linktext>, Consume all <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Sigil</style>s, then charges forward after powering up to slash all enemies in path, dealing <style=\"accent-gn\">510%</style> ATK as <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> (which scales with the Level/Tier of <linktext=1501><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Flash Strike</style></linktext>). <style=\"accent-gn\">Each</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Sigil</style> consumed increases DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style>."},"1585":{"name":"Phantom Slash","description":"Enhanced <linktext=1554><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Raijin Dash</style></linktext>, Consume all <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Sigil</style>s to summon more ferocious lightning, dealing <style=\"accent-gn\">450%</style> ATK as <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> (which scales with the Level/Tier of <linktext=1554><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Raijin Dash</style></linktext>). <style=\"accent-gn\">Each</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Sigil</style> consumed increases DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style>."},"1586":{"name":"Storm Scythe","description":"Quickly slashes horizontally with a scythe condensed from lightning, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">300%</style>ATK to the enemy, which scales with the Level/Tier of <style=\"accent-gn\">Thundercut</style>."},"1587":{"name":"Divine Sickle","description":"Forcefully slashes vertically forward with a scythe wreathed in destructive power, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">1500%</style>ATK to the enemies. Scales with the Level/Tier of <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack</style>."},"1588":{"name":"Thunder Cut","description":"Consume all <style=\"accent-gn\">Thunder Sigil</style> to unleash <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> rapid blade waves, dealing <style=\"magic\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">700%</style> ATK. Scales with the Level/Tier of <style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style>."},"1589":{"name":"Azure Sever","description":"Enhanced <linktext=1524><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Falcon Toss</style></linktext>, leap into the air and gather wind <style=\"accent-gn\">power</style>, launching a fierce wind blade spear. Deals <style=\"accent-gn\">750%</style> ATK as <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to all enemies in the area and significantly reduces their tenacity, growing with the upgrade/advancement of the <linktext=1524><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Falcon Toss</style></linktext> skill.<br>Immediately gain <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> stacks of <linktext=1152><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Sharp</style></linktext> after Casting ."},"1590":{"name":"Vortex Strike","description":"Empowered <linktext=1523><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Spiral Thrust</style></linktext> unleashes a final strike, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">1265%</style> ATK (which scales with the Level/Tier of <linktext=1523><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Spiral Thrust</style></linktext>)."},"1591":{"name":"Drake Cannon","description":"A thrust followed by a backward leap releasing strong wind pressure, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">380%</style> ATK to enemies (which scales with the Level/Tier of <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack</style>).<br>After casting, immediately restores <style=\"accent-gn\">20</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Courage</style>."},"1592":{"name":"Swift Blade","description":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> ATK to all the enemies, which scales with the Level/Tier of <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack</style>. <br>Restores <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Courage</style> immediately upon use."},"1593":{"name":"Stag Charge","description":"Deals <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">500%</style> ATK to enemies hit along the path, and heals allies hit for <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> ATK. Scales with the Level/Tier of <style=\"accent-gn\">Special attack</style>. Casting it immediately refreshes Infusion."},"1594":{"name":"Starfall","description":"Enhanced <linktext=1537><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Star Shatter</style></linktext>. Lunges at the enemy, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">500%</style> ATK, knocking them airborne. Scales with the Level/Tier of <linktext=1537><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Star Shatter</style></linktext>. <br>Gains double <style=\"accent-gn\">Rage</style> and becomes <linktext=1135><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Enraged</style></linktext>."},"1595":{"name":"Rupture","description":"Raises your weapon for a mighty blow, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">300%</style> ATK, and knocking the target airborne. Scales with the Level/Tier of <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack</style>.<br>Gain <style=\"accent-gn\">25</style><style=\"accent-gn\">Rage</style> upon casting."},"1597":{"name":"Stone Fist","description":"Empowered <linktext=1539><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">​Granite Fury​</style></linktext> channels the Power of Rock to summon a massive boulder from above, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">800%</style> ATK to the enemies within range (which scales with the Level/Tier of <linktext=1539><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">​Granite Fury​</style></linktext>) and always triggering Crit."},"1598":{"name":"Condemn","description":"Deals <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">200%</style> ATK to the enemy (which scales with the Level/Tier of <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack</style>)."},"1599":{"name":"Enhanced Condemn","description":"Enhanced <linktext=1563><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Condemn</style></linktext>, whose DMG is equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style>times that of <linktext=1563><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Condemn</style></linktext>."},"1600":{"name":"Inferno Reckon","description":"Empowered <linktext=1563><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Reckoning</style></linktext> deals <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> times the normal DMG of <linktext=1563><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Reckoning</style></linktext>, starts at <style=\"accent-gn\">250%</style> Crit DMG, and does not consume <style=\"accent-gn\">Holy Sigils</style>, but still generates Holy <style=\"accent-gn\">Energy</style>."},"1601":{"name":"Storm Arrow","description":"Quickly draws the bow to fire <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> arrows at the target, each dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> and generating <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style>.<br>This skill holds <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> charges.<br>When <style=\"accent-gn\">Photon Energy</style> reaches max, <style=\"accent-gn\">Storm Arrow</style> instantly gains <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> charges, and the max number of charges increases to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style>.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Even after five uses, Storm Arrow will continue to re-charge. Use other skills to buy time for more casts.</style></size>"},"1602":{"name":"Lumi Torrent","description":"Fires a giant arrow at the target, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">1000%</style> ATK."},"1603":{"name":"Rhapsody of Flame","description":"My Passion Still Burns! Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> stacks of <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style> to summon a randomly shaped graffiti on the ground, healing <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> allies (party members prioritized) and dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> to the enemies within range.<br>While standing within the graffiti, the caster gains <style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style> Fire Bonus.<br>Only 1 graffiti can exist at a time.<br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style>: Required to perform music. <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> point is regenerated every <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: This skill has the widest range for both healing and DMG. Cast it once the CD ends for max effectiveness.</size></style>"},"1604":{"name":"Amplified Beat","description":"Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style> to swing your guitar with force, dealing heavy <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> to enemies. <br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style>: Required to perform music. Regenerates <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack every <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: High coverage healing skill. Use it before your Performance Passion overflows.</size></style>"},"1605":{"name":"Harmonic Anthem","description":"Leaps high and slams your guitar into the ground to burst sparks, dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> to the enemies within range. <br>Each instance of DMG dealt by Amplified Beat (only once per multi-target hit) increases the hit count of <style=\"accent-gn\">Harmonic Anthem</style> by <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style>. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Master the Amplified Beat's mechanic of increasing hit count to boost Harmonic Anthem's Attack.</size></style>"},"1606":{"name":"Healing Melody","description":"A soothing melody. When <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Energy</style> exceeds <style=\"accent-gn\">15</style>, you can start the performance freely and stop at will. Each time you start, a <style=\"accent-gn\">speaker</style> is deployed to perform a Concerto. (<style=\"accent-gn\">Speaker</style> disappears when <style=\"accent-gn\">Healing Melody</style> ends.) CD: <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>. <br>While performing <style=\"accent-gn\">Healing Melody</style>, consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Energy</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">per</style> second, and heals <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> allies every <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> second (Interval affected by Haste). <br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Speaker</style>: When you cast <style=\"accent-gn\">Healing Beat</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Fivefold Crescendo</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Rock the Stage</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Concert Circuit</style>, the <style=\"accent-gn\">speaker</style> will simultaneously cast the same skill.<br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Energy</style>: Required to play Melody skills (<style=\"accent-gn\">Heroic Melody</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Healing Melody</style>). Regenerates <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> point <style=\"accent-gn\">per</style> second. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Mastering where and when to place the speaker is essential.</size></style>"},"1607":{"name":"Fivefold Crescendo","description":"Let the passion surge again! Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style>, reigniting the spirits of the weary. Performs a sequence of notes that restores HP to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> allies within range (prioritizing teammates) and grants Tenacity Chord. Each stack of Tenacity Chord additionally increases Max HP by <style=\"accent-gn\">0.5%</style> (up to <style=\"accent-gn\">2.5%</style> Max HP) for <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style>s (duration cannot be refreshed once 5 stacks are reached).<br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style>: Required to perform music. Regenerates <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack every <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Highest healing potential. Monitor your team's health to maximize efficiency and prevent overhealing.</size></style>"},"1608":{"name":"Passion Burst","description":"Strums the strings and releases searing flames forward, dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> to the enemies within range.<br>Charging alters the skill's range and DMG.<br><style=\"accent-gn\">Tier 1</style>: Chants for <style=\"accent-gn\">0.7s</style>, targeting a fan-shaped area with an <style=\"accent-gn\">8</style>-meter radius in front.<br><style=\"accent-gn\">Tier 2</style>: Chants for <style=\"accent-gn\">1.4s</style>, targeting a fan-shaped area with an <style=\"accent-gn\">8</style>-meter radius in front and increasing DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>.<br><style=\"accent-gn\">Tier 3</style>: Chants for <style=\"accent-gn\">2.1s</style>, targeting a fan-shaped area with an <style=\"accent-gn\">8</style>-meter radius in front and increasing DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style>.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: High DMG skill. Combine with Talent effects and the amplifier for strong DMG and healing. Be mindful of environmental safety during casting.</size></style>"},"1609":{"name":"Healing Beat","description":"Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">3</style> stacks of <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style> to play a tune that heals the caster and the nearby ally with the lowest HP (party members prioritized). The healing amount scales with the caster's MATK (plus an additional fixed heal equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">3%</style> of the target's Max HP).<br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style>: Required to perform music. <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> point is regenerated every <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: A healing skill with high uptime. Cast it to avoid letting Performance Passion overflow.</size></style>"},"1610":{"name":"Center Stage","description":"Increases your <style=\"accent-gn\">MATK</style> for a period of time and amplifies the next skill you cast. <br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Special Attack</style>: Your next <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> Special Attacks do not consume <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style>. <br><linktext=1607><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Fivefold Crescendo</style></linktext>: Doubles the healing instances. <br><linktext=1614><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Heroic Melody</style></linktext>: Halves the time needed to trigger <linktext=1615><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Fierce Strike</style></linktext>. <br><linktext=1605><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Harmonic Anthem</style></linktext>: Doubles the DMG dealt. <br><linktext=1608><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Passion Burst</style></linktext>: Allows for direct cast in its strongest form, no chanting required. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Evaluate the battle environment and your combat style, then apply the appropriate enhancement at the optimal moment.</size></style>"},"1611":{"name":"Rock the Stage","description":"As a passionate music lover, your impromptu performance immediately grants <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style>. It also heals nearby allies and gives them a <style=\"accent-gn\">Shield</style> that lasts for <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style>s, while dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> to nearby enemies.<br><style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style>: Required to perform music. Regenerates <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack every <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style>s.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: In emergencies, this powerful shield can ease the team's survival pressure. Time the cast carefully.</size></style>"},"1612":{"name":"Infinite Rhapsody","description":"Instantly releases a powerful sonic wave, dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> to nearby enemies. Heals nearby allies and grants a <style=\"accent-gn\">Shield</style> that lasts for <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style>s. Doubles the <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style> cap and fully restores <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style>.<br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style>: Required to perform music. Regenerates <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> stack every <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style>s.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: A powerful emergency shield to ease team survival pressure. Time the cast carefully. Once fully charged with Performance Passion, trigger burst.</size></style>"},"1613":{"name":"Concert Circuit","description":"A mobile performance melody. While performing, continuously heals allies. Deals <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> to nearby enemies. <style=\"accent-gn\">Each</style> healed ally increases healing by <style=\"accent-gn\">6%</style>, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style>. <style=\"accent-gn\">Each</style> enemy hit increases DMG by <style=\"accent-gn\">6%</style>, up to <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style>. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Sustained healing and DMG. Adjust your position based on the number and location of targets to maximize efficiency.</size></style>"},"1614":{"name":"Heroic Melody","description":"A rousing melody. When <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Energy</style> exceeds <style=\"accent-gn\">15</style> stacks, you can begin the performance, which cannot be stopped once started. CD: <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>. <br>While performing <style=\"accent-gn\">Heroic Melody</style>, you consume <style=\"accent-gn\">6</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Energy</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">per</style> second, and every <style=\"accent-gn\">3s</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> allies restore HP (Interval affected by Haste). <br>While you perform <style=\"accent-gn\">Heroic Melody</style>, every <style=\"accent-gn\">7s</style>, your <style=\"accent-gn\">String Strike</style> transforms into <linktext=1615><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Fierce Strike</style></linktext>. <br>While you perform <style=\"accent-gn\">Heroic Melody</style>, the conversion rate of <style=\"accent-gn\">Peaceful Tune</style> +<style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style>. <br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Energy</style>: Required to play Melody skills (<style=\"accent-gn\">Heroic Melody</style> and <style=\"accent-gn\">Healing Melody</style>). <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> point of energy is regenerated <style=\"accent-gn\">per</style> second. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: The skill can't be stopped manually, so time its activation wisely to maximize synergy with Peaceful Tune and Fierce Strike.</size></style>"},"1615":{"name":"Fierce Strike","description":"Swings your guitar with force, dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">300%</style> ATK to nearby enemies. <linktext=1605><style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Harmonic Anthem</style></linktext> instantly gains 1 charge. Scales with the Level/Tier of <style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack</style>. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Cast this skill when Harmonic Anthem is on CD.</size></style>"},"1616":{"name":"Encore","description":"The perfect piece for fan interaction. Grants <style=\"accent-gn\">Encore</style> effect to <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> allies for <style=\"accent-gn\">10s</style>. <br><style=\"accent-gn\">Encore</style>: Grants <style=\"accent-gn\">Super Armor</style>. Each time an offensive or healing <style=\"accent-gn\">Expertise Skill</style> is cast, there is a <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> fixed chance to trigger <style=\"accent-gn\">Encore Strings</style> once, dealing DMG to the current target or healing the lowest-HP ally. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Cast during your team's burst window for optimal DMG and healing of Encore.</size></style>"},"1617":{"name":"Passion Fury","description":"Channels for <style=\"accent-gn\">6s</style> and continuously spews searing flames forward, dealing <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">1000%</style> ATK in total to the enemies within range. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Move continuously and try to maximize DMG dealt while staying safe.</size></style>"},"1618":{"name":"Resonant Strings","description":"<style=\"accent-gn\">Peaceful Tune</style><br>A magical melody that, whenever DMG is dealt, restores HP equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">20%</style> of the DMG dealt, distributed evenly among up to <style=\"accent-gn\">5</style> allies (Party Members Prioritized). <br>Allies at full HP will not be included in the healing targets. If all Allies are at full HP, the healing will be considered as excess healing. <br><style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Energy</style>: Energy required to play Melody skills (<style=\"accent-gn\">Heroic Melody</style> and <style=\"accent-gn\">Healing Melody</style>). <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> point is regenerated <style=\"accent-gn\">per</style> second. <br><style=\"accent-gn\">Performance Passion</style>: Required to perform music. <style=\"accent-gn\">1</style> point is regenerated every <style=\"accent-gn\">5s</style>. <br><br><style=\"accent-gn\">Basic Attack: Resonant Strings</style><br>Strums the strings to emit a scorching soundwave, dealing long-range <style=\"magic\">Magic DMG</style> to the enemy. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Using Basic Attacks when Performance Passion and Performance Energy are not maxed out provides consistent healing. Pair with talents to store this healing for emergency use.</size></style>"},"1619":{"name":"Blazing Ascension.","description":"Wielding the battle axe, spins to continuously attack targets in front, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> and recovering <style=\"accent-gn\">15</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Flame Soul</style>.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Strategy: The most basic skill for increasing Formless level. Alternate use with other Expertise Skills.</style></size>"},"1620":{"name":"Soaring Flame.","description":"Enhanced <style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blazing Ascension</style> spins forward to deal <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">900%</style> ATK to enemies. Scales with the <style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Blazing Ascension</style> skill's levels/tiers."},"1621":{"name":"Frenzied Slash","description":"Steps forward after a brief charge to fiercely slash the target, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to the enemy and recovering <style=\"accent-gn\">25</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Flame Soul</style>. If the attack hits the target, instantly recovers <style=\"physical\">5%</style> of Max HP.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Strategy: Intersperse this skill during damage output to effectively improve survivability. It can also be used after Wildfire Dance to replenish some HP.</style></size>"},"1622":{"name":"Blazing Assault.","description":"Continuously swings the battle axe left and right to attack the target, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> and recovering <style=\"accent-gn\">10</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Flame Soul</style>.<br>This skill holds <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style> charges.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Strategy: Make full use of the short CD and 2 charges. Combining it with Blazing Ascension can quickly increase Formless level.</style></size>"},"1623":{"name":"Rage Cleave.","description":"With superb technique, continuously unleashes storm-like slashes on the target, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> and consuming <style=\"accent-gn\">85</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Flame Soul</style>. The skill can be cast again within <style=\"accent-gn\">2</style>s of the previous instance ending, up to a maximum of <style=\"accent-gn\">4</style> times.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Strategy: High cost makes it unsuitable for increasing Formless level. It is usually used as the main damage dealer after Formless reaches maximum.</style></size>"},"1624":{"name":"Axe Wind","description":"Wields the weapon like a whirlwind, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to targets within 3 meters. Each spin consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">260</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Stamina</style>. Tap again while skill is active to end it.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Strategy: Stamina must be reasonably allocated between damage output and survivability. When safe, it can be used more for dealing damage and increasing Formless level.</style></size>"},"1625":{"name":"Wasteland's End.","description":"Imbues the power of fire, granting a <style=\"accent-gn\">Class Skills CD Boost</style> and increased <style=\"accent-gn\">Haste</style> while active.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Strategy: Use when Formless reaches A or S to maximize benefits during the burst window.</style></size>"},"1626":{"name":"Wildfire Dance.","description":"Unleashes an ultra-high-speed flurry. Each round consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">50</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Flame Soul</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style> of the <style=\"accent-gn\">Crimson Soul Gauge</style>, or <style=\"accent-gn\">25%</style> of <style=\"accent-gn\">Max HP</style> to deal <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to all enemies within 3 meters. <br>Prioritizes consuming Flame Soul, then Crimson Soul Gauge, then HP. Cannot be cast if HP is below 50%. Tap again while the skill is active to end it.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Strategy: The absolute core skill of Crimson Spec. Accumulate as much Flame Soul and Crimson Soul Gauge as possible to sustain its use. Observe play while casting to interrupt it at any time for survival.</style></size>"},"1627":{"name":"Unbound Meteor.","description":"Releases power to perform a powerful leaping cleave at the target, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to enemies within 4 meters of the landing point. Upon landing, creates Crimson Earth, which deals additional <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to all enemies within 4 meters over 5s, and restores <style=\"accent-gn\">15</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Flame Soul</style>.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Use to engage targets and restore Flame Soul. Cast in advance when burst damage is needed to remain within Crimson Earth.</style></size>"},"1628":{"name":"Falling Hellfire.","description":"Enhanced <style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Unbound Meteor</style> executes a charged leaping slash, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> equal to <style=\"accent-gn\">1,200%</style> ATK to enemies within 4 meters of the landing point. Damage scales with the <style=\"ItemQuality_5\">Unbound Meteor</style> skill's levels/tiers. Recovers <style=\"accent-gn\">15</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Flame Soul</style>. Upon landing, generates Crimson Earth, which deals additional <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to all enemies within 4 meters for 5s."},"1629":{"name":"Endless Hellfire","description":"Becomes frenzied, increasing all <style=\"accent-gn\">Flame Soul</style> generated by <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style>, and temporarily granting increased Crit.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Strategy: Must maintain during the burst window.</style></size>"},"1630":{"name":"Flowing Splendor Slash.","description":"Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">50</style> <style=\"accent-gn\">Flame Soul</style> to unleash a powerful cross-shaped energy slash forward. The slash travels forward for a set duration, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to all enemies along its path. <style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style> of the DMG dealt to the primary target is converted into HP. Also grants <style=\"accent-gn\">50%</style> Life Steal for a certain duration.<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Combine with rapid Crimson Soul Gauge buildup and gain additional recovery when HP is low.</style></size>"},"3000":{"name":"Interrupt","description":"Interrupts the target's casting and puts the interrupted skill on CD. Does not affect bosses."},"3001":{"name":"Silence","description":"Prevents the enemy from casting spells. Does not affect bosses. This is a debuff."},"3002":{"name":"Rooted","description":"Prevents the enemy from moving. Does not affect bosses. This is a debuff."},"3003":{"name":"Frost","description":"Reduces the enemy's Move SPD by <style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style>."},"3004":{"name":"Wound","description":"Reduces the amount of healing the enemy receives. This is a debuff."},"3005":{"name":"Stun","description":"Prevents the enemy from taking any actions. Does not affect bosses. This is a status effect."},"3006":{"name":"Frozen","description":"Prevents the enemy from taking any actions. The effect is removed upon receiving DMG. Does not affect bosses. This is a status effect."},"3007":{"name":"Petrified","description":"Prevents the enemy from taking any actions. The effect is removed upon receiving DMG. Does not affect bosses. This is a status effect."},"3008":{"name":"Paralyzed","description":"Prevents the enemy from taking any actions. The effect is removed upon receiving DMG. Does not affect bosses. This is a status effect."},"3009":{"name":"Dazzle","description":"Forces the enemy to move into melee range of their current target to attack. Does not affect bosses. This is a status effect."},"3010":{"name":"Afraid","description":"The enemy cowers in place in fear. The effect is removed upon receiving DMG. Does not affect bosses. This is a status effect."},"3011":{"name":"Slow","description":"Reduces the enemy's Move SPD. Does not affect bosses. This is a debuff."},"3012":{"name":"Poisoned","description":"Causes the enemy to continuously lose HP. This is a debuff."},"3013":{"name":"Bleed","description":"Causes the enemy to continuously lose HP. This is a debuff."},"3014":{"name":"Burn","description":"Causes the enemy to continuously lose HP. This is a debuff."},"3020":{"name":"Status Effects","description":"Includes <style=\"accent-gn\">Stun</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Frozen</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Petrified</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Paralyzed</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Dazzle</style>, and <style=\"accent-gn\">Fear</style>."},"3021":{"name":"Debuffs","description":"Includes <style=\"accent-gn\">Silenced</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Slowed</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Rooted</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Wounded</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Poisoned</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Bleeding</style>, <style=\"accent-gn\">Burning</style>."},"10001":{"name":"Chroma Edition","description":"Apparel recreated using dyeable craftsmanship based on high-end custom styles. You can dye it as you please."}}}